<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Psalm Late</book>
  <para style="h">Psalm Late</para>
  <para style="toc1">Psalm Late</para>
  <para style="toc2">Psalm Late</para>
  <para style="mt">Psalm Late</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing lungdam ih ci te in mihing ngilote ii ngaisut piakna a nialte, mawneite zia a zui ngawlte, Pathian ii zak ngawlte taw a kizom ngawlte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in Topa Thukham zuina sungah lungnopna mu zaw uh a, tua thute sun taw zan taw ngaisusun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in luihui ah a po thingkungte bang hi a, a nga hunin nga a, a teete a vul bua hi. A sep a vawt theampo a zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahizong mihing ngilote in tuabang hi vet ngawl a, vui ii letkeak taangphaw taw kibang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawneite Pathian in puavawk tu a, Pathian ii mite sung pan a tuamin koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thutangte Topa in lamlakin dal a, ahizong a ngilote sia amate lalcip natu munah a pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Banghangin minamte in leedo sawm thong ziam? Banghangin mihingte in a thimthaam tupnate vawt ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kumpite in leedo a, a ukpite taw Topa le a teal kumpipa a thimthamin langpan khawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in “Hong ukna pan ei le ei kisuatak tawng i, hong letna vawk keak tawng” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantung ah a om ama tokhum tung pan Topa nui a, amate ii a ngina ngawl ngealnate nunau lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang ama in thin uukna taw amate kidop natu thupia a, a thinsona hangin amate patausak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in “Ka mual thiangtho Zion ah ka kumpipa ka koi zo hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa in “ Topa thu khensatna son tu khi hi,” ci hi. Ama in kei tungah hi bangin hong ci hi, “Nang sia ka tapa na hi hi, tuni in na pa ka suak zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hong ngen ta'n, minamte theampo kong pia tu a, leitung bup nangma aa hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in amate thikmol taw na veltham tu a, leibeal tam bek bangin amate na sutham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in no kumpi te awng, hi kidop natu thu hong ngai tavun. No leitung ukte awng, hi thu tel tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kiitakna taw Topa ii na seam vun a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama mai ah liinna taw kun vun; tua ahibuale ama thin uuk vat tu a, thakhat thu in na thi tu uh hi. Ama a bealte in a lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngal tam ka nei lawlawm hi, Topa awng, kei hong langpan tam lawlawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in kei thu son a, “Pathian in ama hu ngawl tu hi” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang, Topa awng, nang sia a tawntungin launa pan hong dal ka lum na hi hi. Nangma in zawna nong pia a, thinletna taw nong dimh kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hu ngenin Topa ka biakpui a ama in a mual thiangtho panin hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lum in ka mu a, zankhuateakin Topa in hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kiimkot pan hong uumci ka ngal tul tampite ka kiita bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hong pai ta'n, Topa awng hong hun ta'n, ka Pathian awng, nangma in ka ngalte theampo daan na pia a, kei hong natsak natu vaang na selsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngalzawna sia Topa kung pan hong pai hi — Ama in ama ii mihingte thupha pia tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thu kong nget ciang hong zo ta'n, Pathian, kei hong hungpa awng! Ngimna sungah ka om ciangin nong hu hi. Hong dik ta'n a, tu in ka thungetna hong za ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No mihingte in bang tanvei kei hong zawnsak vawt tu nu ziam? Luithawthong khat sia bang tanvei dei in thumaan ahi ngawl khat bang tanvei del tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in a thutangte ama atu in tealtuamin ka biapui ciang hong zaak hunlam phawk tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kiitakna taw liingin mawna vawt nawn heak vun; na lupnate tungah thim dide in na lup uh ciang, hi thu a thukin ngaisun vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A maan sangaw biakpiaknate Topa tungah pia vun, na muanna uh ama tungah koi vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihing tam mamate in “ Topa awng, thupha tamzaw hong pia ta'n a, kote maipha hong pia ta'n” ci in thungen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate ii an le sapittui a neisa theampo tungtawn a, a lungdam na sangin lungdamna a lianzaw ka thinsung ah nong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lupsuk ciangin thinnuam in ka mu hi, Aw Topa awng, nangma bek in bit takin nong keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka kammalte hong ngai ta'n a ka huuisaknate hong za ta'n, Topa awng
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hu ngenin ka auna aw hong ngai ta'n, ka Pathian le ka kumpipa awng! Topa awng, na tungah thu kong ngen hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />zingsangin ka aw nong za hi; ni sua ciang kong ngetnate na mai ah kong lui a, nong zo tu kong ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile nang sia tatsiatna a dei Pathian na hi bua hi; nang omna munah ngitlonate na oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kiphasakte sia na mai ah a ding thei buatu hi; mihing seksol theampo na ensan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma in leilot thusonte na susia a, a ngoltolte le ngual theamte na thusim bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang kei sia nong itna lian ahikom na inn sungah kong tum thei hi, na Biakinnpi thiangtho sang nga in nangma thasiana taw kong bia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, ngal ka hau lawlawm hi! na deina bang a vawt tu in lam hong pui ta'n; ka zui tu in na lampi tamkimsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngalte ii kampaute kimuang thei ngeingawl hi, amate in lalcipsak tu bek uuk hi. Amate kampau te sia kisial pokna hi a, zaak nop huai hi, ahihang, thina hong then thei kitheamna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian awng, amate puavawk in daan pia in: amate ii thimtham tupna taw amate puk tahen; a khialna tam mamate le nang hong leedo hu in na kung pan amate notkeak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang nangma hong bealte theampo lungdam tahen. Amate in lungdamna taw lasa thei tawntung tahen. Nang hong itte na dal in, nang hu in amate lungdam takpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang thu hong nite thupha na pia hi, Topa awng; nangma itna in amate lum bangin sung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, thin uuk in hong teih heak in a; thin uuk in daan hong pia heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tha zawm vangeu zo hi, Aw Topa ; hong hesuak ta'n! tha hatna hong pia ta'n, zawmcip zo khi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka pumpi bup ngim lawlawm hi. Topa awng, nong hu tu bang tanvei haisaang lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hong pai ta'n a, hong hun ta'n Topa awng; nong hesuakna taw thina pan hong suatak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mithi khua ah nang hong kiphawk ngawl hi; tua munah nang kuama in hong pok thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuangaina taw ka zawmcip hi; zan simin ka kakaana in, ka lupna kawtcip hi; Ka lukham, thitui in tuamh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khua ka mu thei tak bua hi; ka ngalte vawtna in ka kakaana in ka mit bol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />No a ngilo te kei kung pan kiheam vun! Ka Topa in ka kaana hong za hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />hu ngenin ka kaana ama in hong ngai a, ka thungetna hong zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngalte in ngallel maizumna he tu hi; thakhat thu hi biaibuai in amate kinotkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, ka kidal natu in nang kong zuan hi, kei hong zuizente panin hong suatak ta'n a, hong hun ta'n;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua ahibuale hong hun thei tu a om ngawlna munah tawpi bangin kei hong kai tu a, tua munah amate in kei hong baltham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, khat pawpo tungah khialin ka lawm khat theamin ka zuak zong tua ahibuale a thu om ngawlin ka ngal pa tungah ka ngoltol le —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuasia ciang, ka ngalte in hong del tahen a hong man tahen, hong saatvawk tahen a, hong that tahen, tuaciang ka luanghawm sia lei ah hong nusia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, na thin uukna taw hong tho to ta'n! ka ngalte thinsona a nalh tu in nangma hong ding ta'n; nangma le nangma hong kithaw ta'n a, hong hu ta'n! Nong tangkal sia thutang khenna ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mihingte theampo na kiimkot ah khawmtua in a, amate ii tungsia panin hong uk ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma in minam theampo ii thukhenpa na hi hi. Topa awng, keima sang pangin thu hong khen ta'n, kei ka maw ngawl hunlam nong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in a thutang Pathian na hi a, kote ngaisutna le ka deinate thu nong khen hi. A ngilote ii seksolnate tawpsakin, miphate thaman pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in kei hong dal pa ahi hi, ama in a thu a nite hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian sia thutang thukhenpa ahi hi, tuaciang a tawntungin a seksolte a nil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kisiik nuam ngawl a om le Pathian in a namsau tat hiam tu hi; ama in a thal keaksa in kinging zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a kiitakhuai a ngalhiamte la zo hi, a meikuang thaltangte taw tuung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in bangbangin ngitlo tu ngaisun ziam ci sia he in; ngimna vawt nuam a, leilot thu zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in ngual thaangsia a, tua thaang sungah amate awk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ngamtat phat ngawlna teng sia amate tungah tu kik a, amate ii ngoltolna in amate nasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa sia ama thutang ahi hu in lungdam ka ko hi; A Saangbel Pa sia pokna la ka sak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa kote ii Topa awng, na letna sia leitung theampo ah kimu hi! Hong kipokna vantungte dong theng to hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />patangte le nausente in tua lasa uh hi. Na ngalte ii bangma hong law thei ngawl natu in, a kip a kho in na om hi. Nang hong langpan peuma na khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na vawt sa vantung le a omna mun tek ah na koi, tha le aksite ka et ciang —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mihingte sia bang hi a, banghang phawk ni ziam; a thithei mihingte po bangbangin thinbot ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma bekma sangin a niam zawhiat in na vawt a, minthanna le patoaina na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na vawt sa na theampo uk tu in na sep hi; bitphua sa theampo ii tungah na koi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuute, khuite, ngamsate;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />vacimte le ngasate, tuipi nganhing namcinte zongh na uksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa, kote ii Topa awng, leitung theampo ah na letna kimu hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, ka thin theampo taw nang kong pok tu hi; a lamdang na nasepnate ka son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma hangin lungdamna taw la ka sa tu uh hi. Vaanglianbel Pathian awng, na min pokna la ka sa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang nong kilaak ciangin ka ngalte nungkin kik a amate lutu in thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma thumaan thutang taw thu na khen a, kei sangah nong pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian he ngawlte na puavawk zo a, mihing seksolte na lalthamsak zo hi; amate kiphawk kik nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngalte sia a tawntungin bo siat zo hi, a khuapite na lalthamsak zo a, amate kimangil cip zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Topa sia a tawntungin kumpi hi a, ama in a thukhenna kumpi tokhum phut zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in thutang taw leitung uk a; ama in minamte thukhaikim taw thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zawthawk a thuakte atu in Topa sia bukna kip ahi hi, ngimna hun sungah ngammuanna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa awng, nang hong hete in nang hong muang tu hi; nang hong zuante na nusia bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion pan a uk Topa tungah pokna lasa vun! Ama nasepnate minam theampo tungah son vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian in a ngimngate phawk a, a kaana aw a mangil bua hi; tuaciang amate tungah a khialte daan pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei hong hesuak ta'n, Topa awng! ka ngalte tung pan ka thuaknate hong en ta'n! thina pan hong suatak ta'n Topa awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tua hi le Jerusalem mihingte mai ah ding thei a, nangma kong pokna thute theampo ka son thei tu hi. Nangma in kei nong hut manin ka lungdam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian he ngawlte in amate ii taw sa dum sungah taaksuk uh hi, a thaangsiana sungah amate awk zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in thutang khennate taw ama le ama hong kilaak hi, mihing seksolte sia amate ii a sep a vawtte taw ma in awk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian a nial theampo le a seksol theampo ii lam tawpna sia thina hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A cimawte kimangil tawntung ngawl tu hi, a zawngte lametna zongh a tawntungin kisucip ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa awng, hong pai ta'n, mihingte in nang nalhsak heak in; Pathian he ngawlte na mai ah samin, amate tungah thu khen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa awng, amate lausak in; a thithei te ahi lel hunlam kitelsak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Banghangin a khuala ah om ni ziam, Topa awng? Ngimna ka nga uh hun sungah banghangin buu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi seksolte in kiphasak a, mizawngte vawtsia hi, amate ii thaangsia sungah amate ma awksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A seksol pa in ama ii a sia deinate kiphatsak pui hi, a duhop pa in Topa haamsiat in nial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing seksol pa in Topa awlmaw ngawl a, a kiphatsakna in, Pathian thupi sim ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi seksol pa in na theampo sungah zawna nga hi, Pathian thukhennate tel thei ngawl hi; amate in ngalte nunau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in, “Kei lel ngei bua vak ing; ngim nga ngei bua vak ing” amate le amate kici uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kam uh sia haamsiatna, theamna le ngual tawnna taw kidim a; amate in ngaimawkna le ngitlona kammalte pau memeang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khuanote sungah amate mama buu in, mawnei ngawl mite that tu in pang hi. Akua cimaw ziam ci in kankuu uh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tawpite bangma in ama in a bukna pan mizawngte pang hi. A thaang sungah amate manin kaikeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mat a thuak a cimawte kisucip hi; ngoltol thahatna in amate zo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi seksolte in amate le amate, “Pathian in phamaw sa ngawl hi! Ama a mit si a, hong mu ngeingawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, mihing seksolte daan pia in! ngim a thuakte phawk in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Banghangin mihing seksol pa in Pathian sia thusim ngawlin a thinsung ah “Daan hong pia buan te” ci thei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang nang in a ngimna le a thuaknate na mu a, a hu tu in na kinging tawntung hi. A cimawte in nang tungah hong ki aap a, a kitaangsamh te na hu tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing seksolte le mihing ngilote ii thahatna nuaitan in; khialna a vawt kik nawn ngawl dong daan na pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in a tawntung a tawntungin kumpipa ahi hi; pathian dang a biate sia ama ii leitang tung panin mong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa awng, mihing a kinengniamte ii thungetna na ngai tu hi; amate thinletna na pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zawthawk thuakte le tangate kaana na za tu hi; a thithei mihingte ii liinna launa a piansak nawn ngawl natu in amate sang pangin thu na khen tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sia ngammuanna nga natu in ka muang hi. Hi bang na ci uh sia bangza in mawmawthuai ziam? “Vacim bangin mualte ah leang ta in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />banghang ziam cile, mi seksolte in thal keak a, amate in thaltangte taw mihing phate a buliana panin kap tu in tuung zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na theampo a cipthap zawkciang mihing phate vawt thei tu bangma a om nawn bua hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa, ama ii biakinn thiangtho sungah om hi; Topa ii kumpi tokhum in vantung ah om hi. Mun theampo a om mihingte encik a, amate bang vawvawt ci sia he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in a miphate le a seksolte a kibangin encian khawm hi, tuaciangin a maitatte a thinsung theampo taw ensan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a seksolte tungah suangmeihol kaamte le kaan meikuangte buaksuk hi; ama in amate a sa mama vuite taw daan pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in thutang a, na pha sepna dei hi; tuabang a, a seamte sia ama ii omna munah teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, ko hong hu ta'n. Mipha khat zongh kikhe nawn ngawl hi; mihing thumaante kimu zo nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in khat le khat kitheam uh hi; Amate in khat le khat kisial pokna taw kitheam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa awng, sialpok thei te ii a leeite na thimsak in! Hi bang a, kihisakna taw a paute ii kam na huksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ka kammal uh taw ka dei uh po nga khu hi. Ka uuk bang po in ka pau lel tu uh a, kuama in hong khaam thei ngawl tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ahihang tu in hong pai tu khi hi,” Topa in ci hi, “Banghang ziam cile a cimawte kizothaw a, vawtsiatna a thuakte in na a sakna taw tau uh hi. Amate ii dei ngammuanna ka pia tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa kamciamte in muanhuai hi; tuate in pummei sungah salivei a kithiangsak ngunn tatakte taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi seksolte mun theampo ah om uh a, tuaciangin a kuama theampo in ngitlona sia pok uh hi. Topa awng, ko hong keam tawntung ta'n a, tuabang mihingte ii kung panin hong keam ta'n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, bang tanvei hong mangil lai tu ni ziam? A tawntung ziam? Kei kung pan bang tanvei na kiseal lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngimnate bang tanvei thuak lai tu khi ziam? Sun taw zan taw bang tanvei heena taw kidim lai tu khi ziam? Ka ngalte in bang tanvei kei tungah hong zo lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, kei hong en ta'n a, hong zo ta'n. Ka thatang hong dimh kik ta'n a, hong thisak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ngalte in “Ama ka zo zo uh hi” cisak heak in; kei puna hu in amate na kisatheisak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kip nong itna hong suang khi hi; ka lungdam tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in nong suatak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, nang, la kong sak tu hi, banghang ziam cile nang in kei tungah nong pha hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing mawmawte in, “Pathian om bo!” ci uh hi. Amate theampo siatna khaatna taw kidim siat a, a cizathuai nate seam zo uh hi; a maan a seam kuama a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing khat po a ciim a om ziam, ama a bia khat po a om ziam ci in, Topa in vantung panin mihingte ensuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang amate lampial siat zo uh hi; amate a kibangin sia siat hi. A maan a ngamta khat zongh om ngawl, khat beak zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama te in he ngawl ziam?” Topa in dongh hi. “Hi a tatsiate in awlmawk nei ngawl ziam? Amate in ka mite neisa sutolna taw nungta a, kei tungah zongh thu hong ngen ngeingawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang tuasia ciangin amate laungawp tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in ama thu a nite taw omkhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngitlo tatsiatna a vawtte in mihing kiniamkhiak pa ii ngealnate nawngkaisak hi, ahihang Topa sia ama ii kidalna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zion panin Israel te ii zawna hong pai natu in bangza in thungen khi ziam. Topa in Israel te a khantosak kik hun ciang bangza in amate lungdam tu ziam!
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, na Biakinnpi sungah akua bangte tum thei tu ziam? Akua bangte in na mual thiangtho Zion tungah biakpiakna vawt thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na theampo sungah Pathian thu ni a, a tawntungin a maan nasep seam in, a kammalte maanin taknei tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuaciang ama in ngualdangte ngensia ngawl tu hi. Ama in a lawmte tungah tat khialna nei ngawl tu a, a innpaamte huvau kamleang kizelsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ii nilte sia amate zongh in thusim ngawl tu hi, ahihang Topa thu a nite sia amate in patoai tu hi. Bangza po supna keak a om tu ahi hial zong, amate in a kamciam bangin vawt tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in a meet ngawl taw sum pukthaak hi, tuaciang a maw ngawlte langpanna tetti tu in sumnguk ne ngawl hi. A kuama po hi bang a, a ngamta sia in ngam muanna nei tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, hong sungsia ta'n; bit takin ka om thei natu nang kong muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah “Nangma in ka Topa na hi hi; na pha ka nei theampo nangma kung panin hong pai hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ii a thumaan mihingte sia bangza in pha ziam! Amate taw kithol sia ka nopsakbel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian dang a del mihingte in amate tungah ngimna tam mama tungsak hi. Amate ii sangaw biakpiakna sungah ka kihel buatu a, amate ii pathiante ka bia buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, Nangma in ka nei a minpiang a buppi na hi a, tuaciang ka kisap theampo nong pia hi; maisang ka nuntak natu na khut sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tel a nong piakte kei atu bangza in lamdang ziam; tuate in bangza in pha ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa ka pok hi, banghang ziam cile ama in hong lampui hi, tuaciang zanIN ka thinsung phawtheina in hong hilkhol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa hong ompuina a tawntungin ka phawk hi; ama in kei taw kinai in hong om hi, bangma in hong liinglawngsak zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom kei sia lungdamko nopna le lungdamna taw ka kidim hi, tuaciangin ngammuanna a cing takin nei ka kisa hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thina vaangletna panin hong sungsia na hikom thumaan takin nang atu kong seam hi, tua hi a mithi khua ah nong nusia buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma in nuntakna sung hong then lampi nong lak tu hi; nangma II nong ompuina in lungdamna taw hong kidimsak a, nopsakna a tawntungin hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hong ngai ta'n, Topa awng, thutang khen natu a kong ngetna hong za ta'n! Hu ngen a kong auna hong ngai ta'n! Thin tak taw thu kong ngetna hong ngai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in kei sang pangin thu nong khen tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in a maan sia na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thinsung hong he ni hi. Zanin kei kungah nong pai hi; nong veal ngiingeei zo a, ka sungah ngitlo nopna nong mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngualdangte bangin kamsia ka pau bua hi; na thupiakna kong ni a ngoltolna lampi ka tawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma lampi ka zui tawntung a ka pial tha ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma tungah thu kong ngen hi, Pathian awng, banghang ziam cile nangma in kong ngetna nong zo hi; tua ahikom kei sang hong nga ta'n a ka kammalte hong ngai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A lamdang na itna hong pualaak ta'n a, hong hun ta'n; nang kungah ka om ciang ngal le sa panin ka ngammuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mittang mama na kep bangin kei hong keam ta'n a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />a seksolte ii hong dona panin na thakhui ii limh sungah hong seal ta'n. Thi theina ngalte in kei hong kiim uum a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate in mulkimna nei ngawlin kiphatsak kam pau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tu in koisang po ka nga zong amate ka kiimkot ah om siat a, hong kuaivawk tu in hong pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in tawpite bang hi a, hong balneen nuamin hong ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa awng, hong pai ta'n! Ka ngalte langpanin a, zothal in! Mihing seksolte kung panin na namsau taw hong hun ta'n;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />hi leitung nuntakna sungah a dei uh po a neite khut sung panin hong hun ta'n. Amate atu na khealsia ngimnate taw amate daan pia in; tua daante sia a tate atu zongin kicing lai tahen a, a tate ii tate dong pawlkhat khomsuan lai tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang kei in nang kong mu tu hi, banghang ziam cile ngamtat khialna ka nei bua hi; tuaciang ka khanlaw ciang nong ompuina in lungnopna taw hong kidimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, bangza in nang hong it khi ziam! Nangma in kei hong hungpa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in kei hong dal pa hi a, ama sia a kip a kho ka kulhpi `ahi hi. Ka Pathian in ka kidalna hi, ama taw ka kikop ciang kei ka ngammuang hi. Ama in lum bangin kei hong dal hi, ama in kei hong dal a, hong sungsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ka biakpui a, ama in ka ngalte khut sung panin hong hun hi. Topa pok tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lauhuai thina in kei hong uumci a, lalna tuihual in kei hong nawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lauhuai thina in kei hong uumci a, thaankuul in a thaang taw kei hong sia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngimna kawmkaal pan Topa ka biakpui hi; hong hu tu in Pathian ka biakpui hi. A biakinn sungah ka aw hong za hi; hu ngenin ka auna ama in hong ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuasia ciang leitung sia liingin ngawk hi; mualte ii tawdapte kilokin phe vadil hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A naak hawng sung panin meikhute hong buak hi, a kam sung panin a kaanghtumsak thei meikamte le meikuangte hong pusuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in van sia eautham in meeikaaivom sisanh in hong tuaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in Cherub khat tungah to in manlang takin leang hi; ama in vui ii thate tungah khualhaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama le ama khuazing taw kituam a, tui taw a kidim meeikaai saate in kiim uum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngialtangte le meileng vazalte ama mai khualeng panin hong pai a meeizingte phullet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuaciang Topa in van panin vanto bangin hong pau a, Saangbel Pa aw kiza hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a thaltangte hong kap a, a ngalte kithethaangsak hi; khualeng tee vazialte taw amate taisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa awng, na ngalte na teih ciang le thin uukin amate na oksat ciang, tuipi taw le lei tawdapte kilawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in ka tung panin hong zamsuk a kei hong len hi; ama in tuithukte panin hong kaito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thahat ka ngalte le kei hong ensante kung panin hong suatak hi — amate in kei atu in hat lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ngim nga laitakin amate in kei hong sim hi, ahihang Topa in hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in launa sung panin hong hu hi, banghang ziam cile ama in kei sia dik hong sa a, hong hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in kei thaman hong pia hi banghang ziam cile a maante sep le vawtin ka nei hi; ama in keima thupha hong pia hi, banghang ziam cile kei mawna ka nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa thukham ka zui zo a, ka Pathian kung panin ka pial bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama thukhamte theampo ka tang zo a, ama thupiakte ka nit ngawl a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in ka sitbaan ngawlna, khial ngawl tu in ka kikepna hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in telte hong pia hi, banghang ziam cile a maan na seamin ka maw ngawl hunlam hong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa awng, hong thumaante tungah na thumaan hi; a cialcingte ii tungah a kicingin na dik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A thiangthote tungah na thiangtho hi; ahihang a seksolte na ngal vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A kiniamkhiak te na hun hi, ahihang a kiphasakte na niamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa awng, kei khuavak nong pia hi; ka khuazing na bosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka ngalte ka sim natu in thahatna nong pia hi, tuaciang amate ii kinannate ka zaw natu tha nong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hi Pathian ii nasepnate bangza in cialcing ziam! Ama kammalte bangza in suan thamman ziam! Ama ii huuk tu a zongte theampo atu in Ama in lum taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa bekma Pathian ahi hi; Pathian bekma ei kinanna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in kei hong thahatsak Pathian hi a, ka lampi bitsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in sangai bangin ka peang hong khosak a, mual tungah hong keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thal khobel sia ka zak thei natu in ama in ngal kido zia hong sinsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in nong dal a nong hun hi; nangma ii nong khoina in hong liansak a, na vaangletna in hong keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Kipummat natu panin nong keam a ngalte khut sung ka theng ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka ngalte ka del a, amate ka man hi; amate ka lalsak mateng in ka tawlnga bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate ka vaatvawk a, a tho kik thei bua uh hi; ka mai ah ngallel in amate liik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nangma in kidona sung a zak tu thahatna nong pia a ka ngalte nong zosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ka ngalte ka kung panin a tai natu in na vawt hi; kei hong ensante ka lalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in hu ngenin au ahihang kuama in amate hun ngawl hi. Amate in Topa biakpui hi, ahihang Ama in a zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate leivui bang ahi dongin ka sucip a, vui ii let leivuite bang ahi uh hi. Lampite ah buan omte bangin amate ka tuanhcil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ngal phuang mihingte kung panin nong hun a tua ngamte a uk tu in kei nong siam hi; ka heak ngeingawl mite, tu in ka khutnuai mi suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ngamdangmite sia ka mai ah kun uh hi; ka thu hong zaak ciangin ka thu ni uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amate in thinkiamin a kulhte uh sung pan a liing sa in hong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Topa nungta hi! Kei hong hungpa pok vun! Kei hong hun Pathian letna thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama in ka ngalte hong zosak hi; ngam tuatuamte ka khutnuai ah biiksak vakheau a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />kei sia ka ngalte khut sung panin hong hun hi. Topa awng, ka ngalte nong zosak hi; tuaciang a ngoltol mihingte khut sung panin nong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngam tuatuamte kawm ah nang kong pok hi; nang tungah pokna la kong sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Pathian in zawna lian mamate a kumpipa tungah pia hi; ama in itna kip sia ama tealsa David le ama suan le paalte tungah a tawntungin lak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Van in Pathian minthanna thiang takin kilanghsak hi! Ama nasepna huvau in a kician mama in lak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni simin tua thu kisawson a, zan simin kison kikik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thusonna ahibuale kammalte kizangh ngawl a, awnging zongh kiza ngawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ahitazong amate ii thupuak sia leitung bup ah kizel a leimong dongin kiza hi. Pathian in ni atu in van ah inn khat vawtsak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a lungdam zinei pa bangin zingsang in hong pusuak hi, tai kidem tu a lawp kimai thiamte bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van mong khat pan hong kipan a, van laizang kaantanin a langkhat dongah pai hi. Ama ii satna sia bangma in lia thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa thukham sia cialcing a; thahatna thak a pia hi. Topa thupiaknate sia muan thamman a, a kitaangsamhte atu in ciimna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa ii thukhamte maan hi, tuaciang tua thukham a nite lungdam hi. Topa thupiakte tang a, thinsung heakna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa thasiana sia pha a, a tawntungin kizom paisuak tu hi. Topa thukhennate sia tang a, tuate sia a tawntungin maan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuate sia khamh pha belte sangin dei huai zaw a, khuaitui thiangbel sangin thum zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuate in na naseampa, keima heakna hong pia a; tuate ka nit hu in tel ka saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuama in ama mama ii khialnate a mu thei bua hi; Topa awng, a kiseal khialnate panin hong hung ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vawtluih mawnate panin hong keamcing si ta'n a; tuate in kei hong uksak heak in. Tua hile ka cialcing tu a, mawna ii siatna khaatna pan ka suakta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka bukna le hong tanpa ka Topa awng, ka ngaisutnate le ka kampaunate nong saan thei hi tahen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngimna na nga ciangin Topa in na biapuina hong zo tahen; Jacob ii Pathian in nang hong dal tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a Biakinnpi panin nang kungah huna hong puak tahen, tuaciangin Zion Mual panin panpuina hong pia tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na piakkhiatnate theampo ama in hong saang tahen a, na sangaw biakpiaknate theampo ama lungkim tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na dei sia ama in hong pia tahen a na tupna theampo ah zawna hong ngasak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciang nang ii zawna tungtaang ah lungdamna taw kong au tu uh hi, Eite ii Pathian pokna taw na zawna poai ka khaam tu uh hi. Topa in na nget theampo hong tungsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in ama tealsa kumpipa sia zawna pia hi ci, tu in ka he hi; ama in a thiangtho vantung panin ama ii ngetnate zo hi, tuaciang ama ii vaangletna taw zawna lianpi te pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawlkhat in amate ii ngalsimna siphu ngalleangte muang hi, a dangte in a siphute muang uh hi, ahihang eite in Topa ih Pathian ii vaangletna ih muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabang mihingte sia lutu in liik tu uh hi, ahihang eite tho in kip takin ih ding tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa awng, kumpipa tungah zawna na pia in a, kong biapui uh ciangin hong zo ta'n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, kumpipa lungdam hi, banghang ziam cile ama thahatna na pia hi; ama ngalzo pa na suasak manin lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii lungngul sia na pia zo a, hong ngetna bangin na zo kik zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama kungah thupha lianpite taw nong pai a a lu tungah khamh kumpilukhu na khusak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in nuntakna hong ngen a, tuasia ma na pia hi, khansau le a kikhomsuan nuntakna na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma huna hangin ama ii minthanna lian a, ama sia minthanna le uk theina vaang na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thuphate ama tungah a tawntungin om a, na ompuina hu in ama sia lungnopna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa in Vaanglianbelpa Topa muang a, Topa ii a kip itna hu in ama sia a ngam muang tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kumpipa in a ngalte pummat siat tu a, ama a ensan theampo man tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama hong kilaak tak ciang amate sia meilingh pui ii a kak bangin susia tu hi. Topa in a thin uukna taw amate valh tu a, meikuang in amate kaanghtum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa in thatlum siat tu a, a suan a paal kuama a taang buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in kumpipa thasawm uh a, ahihang a taangtung buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a thaltangte taw amate kap tu a, nungsangah leetaisak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa awng, Na thahatna lianpi hu in kong pok uh hi! Na vaangletna pokin, la kong sak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian, ka Pathian awng, banghangin kei hong nusia ni ziam? Cimaw in, nong hu natu hong ausan khi hi, ahihang huna hong pai tuan ngawl lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pathian awng, sunin kong biakpui hi, ahihang nong zo bua hi; zanin kong biakpui hi, ahihang thin muanna ka nga tuan bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang nang sia Israel te ii a pok, a Thiangtho Pa in na maang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite in nang hong muang hi; amate in nang hong muang a, nang in amate na hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in nang hong ko a, launa panin suakta uh hi; amate in nang hong muang a, thinkiamna a thuak bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang kei sia mihing zongh hi nawn ngawl khi hi; lungno khat ka hi a mihing theampo in hong thusim ngawlin hong nunau uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hong mu theampo in hong selno hi; a leei uh hong daw a, a lu uh hong pei san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Nangma in Topa na suang hi. Banghangin nang hong hun ngawl ziam? Topa in hong it ahi le banghangin nang hong hu ngawl ziam?” amate in hong ci san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bit tak a hong piangsak sia nangma na hi a, tuaciang nausen ka hi lai in nong keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka pian ni panin nang kong suang a, nang sia ka Pathian na hi tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngimna hong nai a, hong hu tu kuama om ngawl ahiciang, kei kung pan kiheam heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuitalte bangin ka ngalte in hong kiim uum a; ka kiimkot ah om uh hi, amate sia a kiitakhuai Bashan ngam khuitalte bang ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in tawpite bangin a kam uh kaa a, hawkin kei hong laai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka tha tual zo a, lei ah tui buak bangin bo vangeu hi. ka ngu kipeenate zongh kipealkhial siat zo a, ka lungtang sia khuainun tuitham bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka longtawl sia leivui bangin ko a, ka leei sia ka vadang ah kibelto hi. Leivui sungah a thi tu in nong nusia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing ngilo honkhat sia ka kiim ah hong om a, uihonte bangin kei hong neak hi; amate in ka khut le ka peang pan hong laai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ngu ka taangte sia lawt siat a, ka ngalte in hong en a hong sal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in ka puante a hawm natu in aisaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa awng, kei kung panin kiheam heakin a, kei hong suatak tu in a manlangin hong pai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namsau panin hong hun ta'n a, hi uite panin ka nuntakna hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hi tawpite panin hong suatak ta'n; hi ngam khuitalte mai ah cimaw in ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka mipuite tungah nangma ii nong sepsaksate ka son tu a, amate kikhopna sungah nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“ Topa naseamte awng, ama pok vun! Jacob suante awng, ama zatakna pia vun! no Israel mite awng, ama bia vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in a zawngte ngaingon in ahibuale amate thuaknate awlmawk ngawlin a om bua hi; amate a nungngat bua a, hu ngenin a biapui uh ciang ama in zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihonpite kikhopna sungah nangma ii nong sepsaksate ka pok tu hi; nang hong biate ii omna munah ka kamciamsa sangaw biakpiakna ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizawngte in a du zaza ne tu uh a, Topa kung a zuan peuma in ama a pok tu uh hi. Amate in a tawntungin nuamsa tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngam theampo in Topa a phawk tu uh hi. Leitung mun tuatuamte panin ama a zuan tu a minam theampo in ama a bia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Topa sia kumpipa hi a, ama in ngam theampo uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mihing kiphasak theampo in ama mai ah kun tu a, a thithei theampo in ama mai ah kun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Maisang khangkikte in ama atu seam tu uh hi; amate in hong khang pheang tute tungah Topa thu son tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A piang pheang tu mite tungah “Topa in a mite hun hi” ci in kison tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in tuu bangin kei hong cing pa “Jehovah Ra-ah” ahi hi; bangma ka kitaangsamh bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in lo hingna sungah hong lumsak a, tuithiang cingna munah hong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in thahatna thak hong pia hi. Ama hong kamciamsa bangin lampi maan tawn tu in lam hong pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thina luamkuam khuazing thuk belna sung keak kaantanin ka tawn zongin ka lau buatu hi, banghang ziam cile, Topa awng, nangma in kei taw nong omkhawm a, na tuucinna molpum le na ciangkhut in kei hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngalte mu tangin an neakna poai nong vawtsak hi. Leangna pipa bangin nong muak a, ka lu sathau nong thiisak hi; ka hai a dim letin nong buh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khan tawntungin na phatna le na itna in kei hong ompui tu a, na inn sungah a tawntungin ka teang tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Simleitung le a sungah a om theampo sia Topa neisa ahi hi; leitung le a tungah a teang theampo sia ama aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in tuipi taw ah, inn tawdap pha a, leinuai tuithukpite tungah sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ii mual tungah pai thei natu akua in thu nei ziam? Ama ii a thiangtho Biakinnpi sungah akua tum thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngaisutna le ngamtatna a thiangthote, milim a bia ngawlte tua ahibuale a maan ngawl kamciam a vawt ngawlte pai thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabangte sia Topa in thupha pia in hun tu hi; Pathian in amate sia maw ngawl hi ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian kungah hong pai, Jacob ii Pathian kung a zuan tu te sia tuabang mite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kongpite hongkeak vun a, taangh kongkhate hong tavun, minthang kumpipa hong tum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minthang kumpipa sia akua ziam? Ama sia Topa hi a, a thahat le a thakho, ngal a zo Topa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kongpite hongkeak vun a, taangh kongkhate hong tavun, minthang kumpipa hong tum tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minthang kumpipa sia akua ziam? Zawna mualsua Topa — ama sia minthang kumpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nang tungah, thu kong ngen hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka Pathian awng, nang sungah muanna kong nei hi. Lel a maizumna panin hong hun ta'n a, ka ngalte kei tungah hong kisatheisak heak in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang hong muangte kuama in nguallel ngawl tu hi, ahihang nang hong langpan papaihte nguallel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, na zia na tong hong hil ta'n a, tuate hong telsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thumaanna taw kizui in ka nuntak thei natu hong hil ta'n, banghang ziam cile nangma in kei hong hunpa ka Pathian na hi hi. Nang kong muang tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, taanghlai panin nong lak, na cikna le na itna kip sia na phawk ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng, ka khangno lai a ka mawnate le ka khialnate hong maisak ta'n a, Na itna kip sung le na phatna sungah hong phawk ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa sia pha a thutang ahikom mawneite tungah a tot tu uh lampi hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a kiniamkhiakte lam maan lakin ama deina hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thuciam le a thupiak a nite theampo itna le thumaanna taw lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa awng, na kamciam kipsak in a, ka mawnate hong maisak ta'n, banghang ziam ci le ka mawna tam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa a thasiate in a tot tu uh lampi sia ama tung panin a he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate in nuamsa tawntung tu a, a tate in ngam le lei a lua tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa sia ama' thu a nite ii lawm hi a, amate tungah a thuciam kipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huna nga tu in a tawntungin Topa ka ento a, ama in launa pan hong suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa awng, kei hong maingat ta'n a, kei hong hesuak ta'n, banghang ziam cile ka lungzuangin ka tha zawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thinngimnate pan hong suut ta'n a, ka ngim nganate pan hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ngimna le ka thuaknate hong heakpui ta'n a, ka mawnate theampo hong maisak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ngalte bangza in tam a, bangza in hong ngaimaw ci sia hong heaksak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kei hong dalin, hong hun ta'n a, hong lelsak heak in. Ngammuan natu in nang kong zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka phatna le ka thumaanna in kei hong keam tahen, banghang ziam cile kei in nang kong muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian awng, na minam Israel mite a ngim ngana theampo panin na hun in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, maw ngawl hi hong ci ta'n, banghang ziam cile a maan in ka seam a, nang muan citakin hong muang khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, hong veal ta'n a, hong sittel ta'n, ka deinate le ka khua ngaisutnate thu hong khen ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nong itna kip in kei lam hong lak a, na thumaanna in a tawntungin lam hong pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mannung ngawlte taw ka kithawl bua a, a kihitheamsakte bangma in ka sim bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing ngilote ii hong pawlpuina ka ngaimaw a, a seksolte ka pial hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, mawbaang ngawl ka hi hunlam ka khut silin kong lak a, na biaknatau kiim ah pai in kong bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungdamkona la kong sak a, a lamdang na nasepna theampo ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, na minthanna a omna mun, na teenna inn ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mawneite taw hong susia khawm heak in a, ngual suamlumte thuak tute panin hong tongsak ta'n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />ngitlona a vawt tawntungte le sumnguk a ne nuam tawntungte ii thuak tute hong thuaksak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei ka hi le a maanin ka seam hi. Kei hong hesuak ta'n a, hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Launa theampo panin ka ngammuang a, ama mihingte ii kikhopna sungah Topa ka pok hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in ka khuavak le kei hong ngumpa hi a, kuama ka kiita buatu hi. Topa in launa theampo panin hong sungsia a, ka lau ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing ngilote in that tu in hong sim ciangin, amate lutu in puk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngalkap hon buppi in hong kiim uum hial zong ka lau buatu hi; ka ngalte in hong sim le zong Pathian ka muang veve tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa tungah na khat ka ngen a, ka dei khat bek a om hi; ka khan tawntung Topa inn sungah teang a, ama ii phatna lamdang ka sak tu le lam hong laknate nget tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngimna hun sungah ama in hong lia tu a, ama Biakinnpi sungah hong keamcing tu hi, tuaciang suangpi saang tungah ngammuangin hong koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka kiim a ka ngalte tungah zawna mualsua na ka nei tu hi. Lungdamna taw au in a Biakinnpi sungah sangaw biakpiakna ka pia tu a; lasa in Topa ka pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng kong biapui ciang hong za ta'n! Hong hesuak ta'n a hong zo ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hong pai ta'n a hong bia ta'n” nong ci ciang, “Hong pai tu khi hi, Topa awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />kei kung pan nangma le nangma hong kiseal heak in,” ci in ka zo hi. Kei tungah hong thin uuk heak in a, na naseampa hong nungngat heak in. Nangma in kei hong hupa na hi ngei zo hi; hong paisan heak in a, hong nusia heak in, Pathian, kei hong ngumpa awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka pa le ka nu in hong nusia thei tha tu hi, ahihang Topa in kei hong keamcing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa awng, nong sepsak nop thute, hong hil ta'n, Ngal tam mama ka nei hu in, a ngammuanhuai lampi ah lam hong pui ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leilot thu le tawnna taw hong ngalvawt ka ngalte khut sungah hong nusia heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi nuntakna hun sung mama ah Topa phatna mu lai tu ci in ka kihe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa muang in, upna nei in, thinkiam heak in. Topa muang in!
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa kei hong hungpa awng, nang kong biakpui hi. Ka auna hong za ta'n! Nong zo bua ahile, kei sia mithi khua a zuan suk te sungah ka kihel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang tungah hu ngenin kong au ciang le na Biakinnpi thiangtho sungah ka khut kong lap ciangin hong za ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing seksolte taw hong puavawk heak in, ngitlo nasep a seamte, a kam teng taw lawm bang a kithoai ahihang a thinsung uh ah etsatna a neite taw hong puavawk khawm heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sep le vawt a ngitlo ngamtatnate hu in daan na pia in. Amate sepna theampo taw a kilawm in daan na pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in Topa ii sep le vawt sate a awlmawk bua uh hi; tua ahikom amate sia ama in daan pia tu a a tawntungin a susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa pokna pia vun; ama in hu ngen a, ka auna hong za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in hong dal a hong hung hi; ama ka muang hi. Ama in huna hong pia a hong lungdamsak hi. Lungdamna lasa in ama ka pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in ama mite sungsia hi; ama in a tealsa a kumpipa hungin hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa awng, na mite hun in a, nangma neisate thupha pia in. Amate ii tuucingpa hi in a, amate keamcing tawntung in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No vantung mite awng; Topa pok vun, Ama ii minthanna le vaangletna pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A minthang Topa ii min pok vun a, Thiangtho Pa hong kilangh ciangin a mai ah kunsuk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ii awnging sia tuipite tungah kiza hi; a minthang Pathian in vanto bangin nging a, ama awnging tuipi lian tungah hawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awnging sia a thahatna le vaang theampo taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awnging in cedar kungte taltansak hi, Lebanon mual tungah cedar kungte ngawngawn thiaktan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Lebanon mualte sia khuino bangin leang va eetsak a, Hermon mual sia khuital moi bangin kinuntawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awnging in khualeng taangkeaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama awnging in sennealngam liingsak a, Kadesh sennealngam sia thing zazaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw in oak thingkungte ngawksak a, a teete a kung tung pan thong siat hi, tua laitakin, a Biakinnpi sung a om theampo in “Pathian minthang hen” ci in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in kumpi a hina taw tui thukte a tawntungin uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in a mite thahatna pia a, kilemna thupha zongh pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, Nangma in kei hong hun zo na hikom, Nang kong pok hi, tuaciang kei tungah ka ngalte in nong enthawsak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, huna ngenin kong au ciang kei nong damsak a, thaankuul panin nong keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leinuai a thuk zaw na zuanin ka pai laitakin nuntakna a thak nong pia kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thumaan ama ii mihingte theampo awng! Topa tungah pok na lasa vun! A Thiangtho Pa in bang teng seam zo ziam ci in phawk vun a, ama tungah lungdamko vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thin uukna in tawmvei sung teng bek hi a, a phatna in khan tawntung ahi hi. Zanin thitui zongh taak tha tu ahitazong zing sang ciangin lungdamna hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngammuang ka kisa a, keima le keima “Hong kinuaisia ngeingawl tu hi” ka kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng, nang in kei tungah nong dik hi; mualtung ngalnanna kulhpi bangin kei nong dal hi. Ahihang ka mai panin nong kiseal a, tuaciang ka lau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, nang kong biakpui a, nong hu natu in kong thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka thina tungtaang ah bang meetna nei tu ni ziam? Thaankuul sung ka zotsuk ciang bang phattuamna om ziam? Mithite in nang hong pok thei tu ziam? A lalmaw na phatna amate in thangsak thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa awng, hong ngai ta'n a, hong hesuak ta'n! Topa awng, hong hu ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka khuangaina sia lungdam lapna taw nong laihsak zo hi; ka khuangaina nong laaksak zo a lungdamna taw nong uap zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom ka thim om buatu a, nang pokna la kong sak tu hi. Topa awng, nangma in ka Pathian na hi a, a tawntungin lungdam kong ko tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nong sungsiat tu in nang hong tu ka hikom lelna hong thuaksak ngei heak in. Nangma in a thutang Pathian na hikom; hong hun ta'n, thu kong ngen hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hong za ta'n a, tu mama in hong hun ta'n! Ka bukna hong hi ta'n a, hong dal ta'n; ka kihuukna hong hi ta'n a hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in ka bukna le ka kihuukna na hi a, nong ciamsa bangma in lamlakin lam hong pui ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei hong kisiana thaang panin hong keamcing ta'n a; launa panin hong khoi hong pao ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nong kepna sungah keima le keima kong ki aap hi. Topa awng, nong hun tu hi. Nang sia a thumaan Pathian na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A maan ngawl pathiante, a biate na ensan hi, ahizong kei ka hile nangma kong muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lungdam in ka lawp tu hi, banghang ziam cile nong itna in kip hi. Ka thuakna nong musak a, ka ngim ngana nong heaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngalte in kei nong pummatsak bua a, ka pai nopna po ka pai thei natu in suatakna nong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa awng, kei hong hesuak ta'n, banghang ziam cile ngimna ka thuak a, ka kakaana in ka mit taak in, ka tha zawcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khuangaina in ka tha hong tatsak a, kaana in ka khan hong tomsak hi. Ka ngimna theampo hu in ka thazawm a, ka ngute ngawngawn ngot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ngalte theampo le a tuanin ka innpaamte in hong zawngsak hi; kei hong hete in hong kiita a, lam lai ah hong mu uh ciangin tai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kuama po in kei sia a thisa bangin hong mangil siat zo a, a kivawksa na khat bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngal tam mamate ii a kihuau ka za a, liinna launa sia ka kiimkot ah om hi. Amate in kei hong langpanin ngealna nei uh a, kei hong thasawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang kei ii lung muanna in nangma na hi hi, Topa awng, nangma in ka Pathian na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei sia nangma khoina sungah ka om tawntung hi; ka ngalte kung pan le hong vawtsiate kung panin hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na naseampa sia cikna taw hong en ta'n a, na itna kip taw hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa awng, nang kong biakpui hi; maizumna hong thuaksak heak in, mihing seksolte maizumna thuak tahen; amate ahile mithi khua thim takin zuansuk tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A leilot theite, a kiphasakte, a kisathei le thutangte zawnsakna kam a paute na thimsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang hong upatte atu in a lamdang mama nate na khealsia hi! A kuama po in nangma bangza inpha ci sia hong he tek hi, nang hong muangte sia ngammuang takin na sungsiatna hong he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate sia mihingte ii thasawmna pan le ngalte selnona panin nangma omna ngam muanna ah na seal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Kei hong ki uumci a, hong kisim lai in, kei tungah itna hong lak sia bangza in lamdang ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama omna panin kei hong hawlkeak zo vei bua na ziam ci in ka lau hi. Ahihang huna ngenin ka biapui ciangin ka auna hong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thumaan ama ii mihing theampo awng Topa it vun. Topa in a thumaante hung hi, ahihang a kiphasakte ahile amate taw kiphu in daan pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa sungah lametna a neite theampo awng, na tha uh khosak vun a, na thin uh hangsak vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A mawna uh kimaisak a, a khialna uh a kipengsakte in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii ngamta khial hi ci a, maw a sot ngawlte le, theamna cite theampo taw a kipealte in mihing lungdamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mawnate ka pualaak ngawl ciangin, sunkhuateak in ka kakaana taw ka zawm ngiingeei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, sun taw zan taw daan nong pia hi, khaal nisa ii tuikhu a kosak bangin ka thazawm dikdek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin nang tungah ka mawnate kong pualaak a, ka tatkhialnate ka seal bua hi. Tuate nang tungah pualaak tu in ka khensat hi, tuaciang nangma in ka mawnate theampo nong maisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom a thumaan na mihingte in a taangsap hun sung nang tungah thu hong nget tu ahi hi; ngimna in namthuam lianpi bangin hong pai in hong nawkngawp ciang, amate a baan buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma in ka bukna mun na hi a, ngim ngana panin nong hun tu hi. Nging takin, na ngupna thu, la in ka sa hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in kei nong sungsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in, “Na pai natu lampi kong hil tu hi; keima in kong lak tu a, ngaisutna kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ki uk thei natu in kamkhau bul a kul siphu ahibuale laa bangin na mawmaw heak vun” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing seksolte a thuak uh kul hi, ahihang Topa a muangte sia ama ii itna kip in dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No thutangte awng, lungdam in lawp vun, Topa sep sate hu in lungdam vun. Ama thu a nite awng, lungdam in au keak vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No a thutangte awng, Topa ii a sep sate hu in lungdamin au vun; ama thu a nite awng, ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamkona in tengtonghte tumin, khau a kithua tumtheite tumin ama ii tungah lasa vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ii tungah lathak sa vun, thiamna taw tengtonghte tum vun a, lungdam in au vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa kammalte in maan hi, tuaciangin ama ii nasepnate theampo sia suan thamman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in a thutang le a maan dei a, ama ii itna kip leitung ah dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in a thupiakna taw vantungte bitphua hi, ni, tha le aksite a kammal taw piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in tuipi theampo mun khat ah khawmtua a, tuipi thukte khakin a bitna sungah khol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung theampo awng, Topa bia vun! Leitung mihingte theampo awng, ama vaang pia vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama a pau ciangin leitung kibitphua a, ama thupiakna taw na theampo piang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in minam tuatuamte ii tupnate nawngkaisak a, amate ii ngealnate a vawt suak zawk ngawl natu in khak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang ama ngealnate in a tawntungin kip a, ama tupnate in a tawntungin kikhomsuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian sia Topa in a neite, minam lungdamte hi uh a, Ama ii mi tu in a teal sate sia mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in vantung panin ensuk a mihing nam bup mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ukna mun panin leitung ah a teangte theampo ensuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate khua ngaisut theina theampo sia ama ii piak hi a, amate sep le vawt theampo he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa khat in ama ngalkaphon thahat hu in ngalzo hi ngawl a, ngalkap khat in ama thahatna hu in zawna mualsua hi ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ngal simna siphute sia ngalzaw natu in mannung ngawl a, amate ii a lian thahatna in hun thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in ama thu a nite le ama ii itna kip a muangte encing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in thina panin amate hun a, kialpi tun hun sungin nungtasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eite in ih lametna sia Topa sungah ih nga a, ama sia eite kidalna le hong hu pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eite in ama hangin ih lungdam a, ama ii min thiangtho ih muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa awng, Nang sungah lametna kong nei uh bangma in nong itna kip sia ko taw hong omkhawm tawntung tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdam ka ko tawntung tu a, ama pokna ka tawlnga ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii sepnate hangin ama ka pok tu a, a kizothaw theampo in ngai in lungdam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />keima taw kopin Topa letna thangsak in, ama min pok khawm tek tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa tungah thu ka ngen a, ama in hong zo hi; ama in ka launa theampo panin hong suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kizothaw theampo in ama mitsuan uh a, lungdam uh hi; amate in a thinkiam ngeingawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A cimawte in ama biakpui a, tuaciang ama in zo hi; amate ngimna theampo panin ama in hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa a zaktate sia a vantunglalang in cing a, launa sung panin suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa sia bangza in pha ziam ci sia noma le noma in zong tavun. Ama sungah ngammuanna a ngate in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama ii mi theampo awng, Topa patoai vun; ama ii thu a nite in a kitaangsap theampo nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tawpite ngawngawn an neak tu samh in ngilkial thei a, ahihang Topa thu a nite in na pha bangma a kisamh bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A khangmoi ka lawmte awng, hong pai tavun a, hong ngai tavun, Pathian patoai tu zia kong hil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A nuamin na nungta nuam uh ziam? Khansauna le lungdamna na dei uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahile kam ngilo pauna le leilot thusonnate pan kikeam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngitlonate nungngatin a pha vawt vun; na thin theampo uh taw kilemna a om natu in hanciam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa in thutangte encing a, amate aunate ngai hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahihang siatna a vawtte sia ama in langpan a, tua in amate a thi uh ciangin a kimakngil pal natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thutangte in Topa biakpui uh a, ama in ngai hi; amate ngimna theampo panin suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in a thinkiam mihingte taw a kinai in om a, lametna a nei nawn ngawlte hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Miphate in ngimna tam mama thuak a, ahihang Topa in tuate theampo panin ama hun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in ama pha takin keam a, a ngute khat zongh tal ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngitlona in mihing seksolpa that tu a, thutangte a ensante in daan thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in ama mite hun tu a, ama a bealhte kikhoaikhe tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, kei hong langpante na langpan in; kei hong dote na do in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na lum le na thikpuante zamhin kei hong suatak tu in hong pai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei hong delte sangah na tei le na hei hong vik ta'n a, kei nong hut natu kamciam hong pia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei hong tha sawmte in lelna le maizumna thuak tahen a, kei hong thasawmte nungkin in lungmang tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa ii vantunglalang in a del ciang amate sia vui ii taangphaw a letkeak bang hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa ii vantunglalang in a vaat vawk laitakin amate lampi sia khuazing in leinaal tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangma ahang om ngawl bulin amate in keima thaang hong sia hi, tuaciangin kei hong mat natu in vuum thuk khat to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang amate ii tel ma in, siatna thuak tu a, amate ii thaang sungah amate awkin lalna sungah taaksuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin keima in Topa hangin ka lungdam tu hi; banghang ziam cile ama in hong hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa tungah “Nang bang ahi kuama om ngawl hi; a hatte khut sung pan a thazawmte na sungsia a, a zawngte sia a zothawte khut sung pan na hung hi” ka thin theampo taw ka ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi ngilote in kei lang ah tetti in hong ding uh a, ka heak ngawl khialna liante hong suan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in a pha ka vawtte, a sia taw hong thuk a, thin kiamin ka topsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang amate a ciinat uh ciangin khau-ip puan silhin ka heena taw an ka tang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />suapui laipee ahibuale ngualtamh khat atu thu ka ngetsak tu bangma in kun in thu ka ngen hi. A nu atu in a tau mihing khat bangin, tau in a kun sa in ka vavak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang ngim ka nga ciang amate lungdam siat a, hong selno tu in hong kikhawm uh hi; khualmite in hong vel a hong sasaat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Peangzawte nunau tu bangin amate in kei sia etsatna taw hong salh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa awng, bang tanvei, hong en thong lalai tu ni ziam? Amate ii hong simnate pan hong suatak ta'n a, hi tawpite panin ka nuntakna hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia ciang na mipawlte kikhopna munah lungdam kong ko tu a, amate theampo mai ah nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua a leilot thei ka ngalte sia kei ii lelna hangin na kisatheisak heak in. Bangma ahang om ngawl bul a kei hong ensante in kei ii khuangaina hangin lungdamna taw hong nuisansak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in ngualtamh bangin pau ngawl uh hi; kilemna a dei mihingte taw kisai in, leilot thu a tuatuamte phuak tawm zawsap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Nang bang seam cisia hong mu khu hi” ci in amate au in maw hong suan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang, Topa awng, nangma in hite sia na mu sa ahi hi. Tua ahikom om thim heak in, Topa; a khuala na ah hong kiheam heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma le nangma hong kithawn ta'n a, hong panpui ta'n; ka Pathian awng, hong tho ta'n a, ka thu hong sonsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa awng, nang sia thutang na hikom kei, maw ngawl hi ci in hong pualaak ta'n; ka ngalte in kei tungah hong kisatheisak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate le amate tungah, “Ama taw kipeal thei hing! Ih oai bang keak hi!” cisak heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kei thuakna tungtaang ah a kisatheite lel kha ma in na lelsak in a, lungmang biaibuai tahen; kei sangin pha a kisa zawte maizumna le min siatna in tuam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Maw ngawl hi ci in kei tungah thukhensat natu a mu nuamte in “ Topa bangza in lian ziam! Ama in a naseampa ii zawna tungah lungkim hi.” ci in lungdamna taw au kikik tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuasia ciang na thutang ka thangsak tu a, nitangtumin kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing seksol pa thinsung tawngh ah, mawna in thu son hi; Pathian nialin ama thasiana a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama le ama nasia mama kisa ahikom Pathian in a mawna mu ngawl tu a puavawkna thuaksak ngawl tu hi ci in um uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ii kampauna in seksolna le leilotnate taw kidim a, ama in ciimna le phatna taw seam nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lupna tungah a lup laitak zong ngitlo vai veu amate in ngeal uh hi; a sep pawpo a pha om ngawl a, a sia khat beak zongh nial ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, na itna kip in vantungte ban a, na thumaanna in vante ah kizelto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thutang sia mualpite bangin saang a, na thutang khenna in tuipi bangin thuk hi. Mihingte le nganhingte in nangma khoina sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian awng, na itna kip sia, bangza in manpha ziam! Na thakhui ii limh nuai ah kote in kidalna ka nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tam mama nong piak ante ne in nuam ka sa uh a, na phatna sia nguntui bangin nong dawnsak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang sia nuntakna theampo ii naak na hi a, nangma ii khuavak hangin khuavak ka mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang hong hete sia it suak in a, a thutangte tungah a pha in hong seam suak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihing kiphasakte in hong ngalvawtsak heak in a, mihing seksolte in hong notsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi ngilote liikna san en vun. Tua munah amate pukin thoto zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing seksolte hangin thinngim heak vun; khialna a vawtte eang heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in lopa ko bangin bo pal tu hi; thingno vulte bangin thi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa muangin ngamtat pha ngamta vun; tua leitang tungah teangin ngammuang tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lungdamna uh sia Topa sungah zong vun, tuasia ciang ama in na lungngulna bang hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma le nangma Topa tungah ki aap in; ama muang in, ama in nang hong hu tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama in na thutang sia sun ni bangin hong taangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thinsau in Topa sep tu ngak in; a nuamsate le a sia ngealna neite ii maa tutnate hangin thinngim heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thinngimna le thin uukna in na zosak heak vun, tuate in ngimna sung hong then bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa a muangte in ngam le lei a lua tu hi; ahihang a seksolte kinotkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hai ngawlin a seksolte hong bo tu hi; na zawzon hangin na mu nawn buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kiniamkhiakte in ngam le lei lua tu a, nopsakna le thinnopna nga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in mihing phate thasawmin etsatna taw salh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in mihing seksolte nuisan lel hi, banghang ziam cile amate hai ngawlin kilalcipsak tu hi ci in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zawngte le a cimawte thatlum nuam a, a maan na a seamte thatlum nuamin, mihing seksolte in a namsau dokin a thal uh keak uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahihang amate le amate a namsau uh taw ma kithatlum tu uh a, tuaciang a thal uhte laltham tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing pha khat ii tawmno khat a nei teng sia mihing seksol theampo ii hauna sangin man neizaw hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa in a seksolte ii thahatna laaksak tu a, ahihang mihing phate sungsia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in ama ii thu a nite khoi a, a ngam le a lei sia a tawntungin amate atu hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hunsia hong tun ciangin, amate in thuak ngawl tu uh hi; kialpi tun hunin a khom tu uh an nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahihang mihing seksolte thi tu uh hi; Topa ngalte sia ngamsung paakte bangin mangthang tu hi; amate meikhu bangin a bo tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in leitoai in, lo kik ngeingawl a, ahihang mihing phate in ngo takin pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa ii thupha a piakte in ngam le lei lua tu uh a, ama ii haamsiatna a thuakte ahile, kinotkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in mihing khat sia a pai natu lak a, ama a lungkimsakte hung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate sia a puk zongin a topcip buatu uh hi, banghang ziam cile Topa in domto tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tu in ka huai zo a, hun sau ma ka nungta zo hi. Ahihang mihing pha khat Topa in nusia ahibuale a tate khutdaw an ngenin vaak ci thu ka mu ngei bualai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in midangte tungah ol takin pia in, pukthaak tawntung a, tuaciang a tate sia a thupha saanna khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngitlona panin kiheak vun a, a pha vawt vun, tuasia ciang na suan na paalte in tua leitang tungah teang tawntung tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa in a maan dei a, a thumaan a mihingte a nusia bua hi. Amate a tawntungin sungsia a, ahihang a seksolte ii suan le paalte sia kinotkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thutangte in ngam le lei lua in a sungah teang tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Miphate ii kammalte sia ciimkam hi a, thutang hi tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate’ Pathian ii thukham sia a thinsung ah keam a, tua thukham panin a pial ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihing pha khat sia mihing seksol khat in encik a thalup tu in hanciam hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in a ngalpa khutsa sungah a nusia buatu a, ahibuale thu a kisit ciangin mawputsakna a thuak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa tungah lametna nei vun a, a thupiakte ni vun; ngam le lei hong piakna taw ama in note hong patoai tu hi, tuaciang mihing seksolte a nawkeak na mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khatvei lai in mihing seksol ahi ngual a zothaw ngawp thei khat ka he ngei hi; ama in Lebanon mualtung ah cedar thingkung khat bangin ngual tungtuangin om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />ahihang ka pai kik ciang a na om nawn bua hi; ama ka zon hang ka mu zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mihing pha pa en vun a, thutang pa entel vun; kilemna a nei mihingte in suan le paal nei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />ahihang mimawte sia kilal cimitsak siat a, a suan a paalte sia kimon siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Topa in mihing thutangte hun a, ngimna hun sungah amate sungsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Topa in amate hu a suatak hi; ama in mihing ngilote khut sung panin hun hi, banghang ziam cile amate a dal tu in ama zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, na thin uukna taw daan hong pia heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na thaltangte taw nong liamsak zo a, nong vaatvawk zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thin uuk hu in nasia takin natna ka thuak hi; ka mawnate hu in ka pumpi bup natna ka vei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mawna namthuam sungah tui ka ta zo hi; tuate kei puak tu in ngit leih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka mawmawt hu in ka meimate uih in muat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima bawngcip in, hong kisupeak zo a, sunkhuateak in ka tau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ci sa mama a, sukin, ka thi dektak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima sia zawm dikdek in nasia tak hong kisupeak zo hi. Ka thinngim a, na sa in ka tau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in ka thangai teng na he a, ka tauna theampo nong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungpeal ngam vasauh in ka tha bo vangeu a, ka mit zongh ciim vaset meal ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka meimate hangin ka lawmte le ka innpaamte in hong neak ngawl tu hi; ka innkuanpuite ngawngawn zongh ka kung pan kiheam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei hong thatlum nuamte in thaang hong sia a; hong liamsua nuamte in susia tu in hong tawng hi; amate in kei hong thasawmna a tawp ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei sia nangong khat bangin khua ka za thei bua a, a ngoai khat bangin ka pau thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khua zaak thei ngawl man po ngual paupuina a zo ngawl khat taw ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nang kong muang hi; Topa ka Pathian awng, nangma in kei nong zo kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka ngalte sia kei ngim ngana tungah kisathei heak hen a, ka kiamsukna huvau in amate kisuangtaaksak heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei, a puk dektak ka hi zo a, tatsat ngawlin na ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka mawnate kong pualaak hi; tuate in ka thin hong ngimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ngalte sia ciidamin thahat hi; bangma thu om ngawl bulin hong ensan tam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A pha khat a sia taw a thukte in kei hong langpan hi; banghang ziam cile a pha sep tu ka hanciam hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa awng, kei hong nusia heakin, ka Pathian awng, a khuala na ah om heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa kei hong hunpa awng, tu tatak ma in hong hu ta'n!
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka sep po kidawmin seam tong tuaciang ka leei zongh in mawna vawtsak bua tong; mihing ngilote hong nai laitakin bangma pau bua tong” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thim om a, kam khat zongh ka huthe bua hi, a phate ngawngawn zongh ka son bua hi! Ahihang ka thuakna sia khang vaial bekin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka thinngim cip hi. Ka ngaisut a tam vaial ciang, ka thinngim vaial a; hi bangin dongh ngawlin ka om thei bua hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Topa awng, bang tanvei nungta tu khi ziam? Bang hun ciang thi tu khi ziam? Ka nuntakna bangza in bo pal tu ziam hong son ta'n.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka khan bangza in hong tomsak zo ni ziam! Nang muna ah kei ii khan khat sia bangma ngawl bang ahi hi. A tatakin a nungta mihing khat sia vui muut khat za hi bek a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />limh khat bang hi lel hi. Ama sep le vawtte bangma in a kimang bua hi; ama in nei le lamh khawmtua ahitazong akua in lua tu ziam ci in a he bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahile Topa awng, bang lamen thei tu khi ziam? Ka lametna in nangma sung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mawna theampo panin hong hun ta'n a, mihing mawmawte in hong nuisansak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thim takin ka om tu a, kam khat zongh ka huthe buatu hi, banghang ziam cile hi bang a, hong thuaksak sia nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Daan hong pia nawn heak in! Nong vuakna taw ka thi dek zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ko ii mawnate sia nangma ii teihna taw daan nong pia hi, tuaciang koma ii itte sia nget ii neak bangin na lalsak hi! A tatakin kote sia husan khat za kan ha hi bua uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, kong thungetna hong za ta'n a, ka auna hong ngai ta'n; ka kaa ciangin kei hong hu tu in hong pai ta'n. Ka taanghpupite theampo bangma in keima in tawmvei no sung atu bekin na leangna ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thi ma thinnopna tawm ka nga thei natu in keima nguak hong omsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa huna nga tu in thinsau takin ka ngak hi; ama in hong ngai a ka auna hong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in a lauhuai dum sung le, thi theina sennawng sung panin hong kaito hi. Ama in suangpi tungah lau om ngawlin hong suanhto a ngam muanna hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Pathian pokna la thak sak tu khat hong hil a, ih Pathian pokna la ahi hi. Hi thu teng a mu mi tam mamate in kidop theina nga tu a, Topa tungah muanna nei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Milim sang zuan ngawlin ahibuale pathian maan ngawl a biate taw kop ngawlin, Topa a muangte in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa kote Pathian awng, ko atu na tam mama nong sepsak zo hi; nang taw a kibang khat zongh om ngawl hi! Ko atu in a lamdang ngealnate tam mama nong vawtsak zo hi. Tuate tam lei ahikom a vekpi in ka son zo ngei buatu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sangaw biakpiakna le piakkhiatnate na dei bua hi; biaknatau tungah nganhing pumhal tu nong ngen bua hi, tua ahibuale zong mawnate laak keak natu in sangaw biaknate nong ngen bua hi. Tuate taangin na aw ka zaak thei natu in bil nong pia hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaciangin, keima in “Hi lai ah om khi hi; na thukham laibu sungah keima atu na thupiakte om nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na deina bangin sep tu sia bangza in uuk khi ziam, ka Pathian awng! Nong hilnate ka thinsung ah ka keam hi,” ci in ka zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa awng, na mite theampo ii kikhopna sungah, kote nong ngupkhiat lungdamna thupha ka son hi. Tawp hun nei ngawlin ka son tu sia nong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngupna thute sia keima aituam atu in bilh thong ngawl khi hi; na thumaanna le nong huna sia ka son tawntung zo hi. Na mite theampo kikhopna sungah na thumaanna le na itna kipte son ngawlin ka om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa awng, kei nong hesuakna sia tawp ngeingawl tu hi, ci in ka he hi. Nong itna le na thumaanna in kei hong keamcing tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sim zawk zongh ahi ngawl ngimna tam mama in kei hong kiim uum hi. Khuamu thei ngawl za dongin, ka mawnate in, kei hong khunel zo hi; amate ka samzam phaza sangin tamzaw a, ka thin kiamcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa awng, kei hong hun ta'n! Tu ma in hong hu ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kei thalup tu hong sawmte lelna le buaina thuak siat tahen. Kei ii ngimna hu a, a lungdamte sia nungkinin maizum thuak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei hong selnote amate ii lelna hu in a thin lal tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang kung hong zuan theampo lungdam in thinnuam tahen. Nong ngupkhiatna tungtaang ah a lungdam theite theampo in, “Topa bangza lian ziam” ci tawntung tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa awng, kei sia thazawm in ka zawngkhal a, ahihang nong mangil bua hi. Nang sia ka hunpa le ka Pathian na hikom, hong hu memeang ta'n!
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mizawngte a thinnuammawte sia mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi; amate ngim a nga uh ciangin Topa in hu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in sungsia in a nuntakna uh kepsak tu hi; amate a ngam a lei sungah a lungdamsak tu hi; a ngalte khut sungah amate a nusiat buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ci uh a nat ciang Topa in hu tu a, ciidamna pia kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Topa awng, nang tungah kong maw zo hi; hong hesuak ta'n a hong damsak ta'n” kong ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngalte in kei huvau kam ngilo pau uh hi. Amate in kei sia thi leng a hong kimangil le oai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hong ve tu a hong pai te zongh a thin takpi hi ngawl hi; kei huvau thusiate khawmtua a, tua zawkciang pai in mun theampo ah son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hong ensan theampo in kei hong ngenin khat le khat kihuau uh a, kei taw kisai a siabel teng ngaisut in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in, “Ama sia thi tu in a na hi zo hi; a lupmuntung ngak top tu hi” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lawm phabel, ka muanbel, ka ankuang uumpui sia ngawngawn in kei hong langpan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa awng, hong hesuak ta'n a, ciidamna hong pia kik ta'n, tuasia ciang ka ngalte ka thuk kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in kei hong zo ngawl tu a, tuaciang nong lungkimpui hunlam ka he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangma in kei nong hu tu hi, banghang ziam cile a maan sia ka seam hi; na omna munah kei nong keam tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian Topa pok vun! Tu le a tawntungin pok vun! Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, sangai in luitui vot vakil a thangai bangin, nang kong thangai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang a nungta Pathian sia tui du bangin kong thangai hi; bang hun ciang nang omna munah hong pai in hong bia thei tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Na Pathian koi sungah om na ziam?” ci in ka ngalte ii hong dok hunsung bup, sun taw zan taw kapin ka thitui bek an in ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A bosa hun sungah lasakna le auna taw Pathian a pok a lungdam mihing hon khat keima in lampui in Pathian inn ah ka paina uh ka ngaisut ciangin ka thin tamhtham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghangin tuaza in khuangai khi ziam? Banghangin tuaza in ngim nga khi ziam? Pathian sungah ka lametna ka koi tu a, ka hunpa le ka Pathian khatvei ma ka pok kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi sung ka saltanna ah ka thin tamhtham ahikom, ka ngaisutna te nang sangah kong heak a, khuangaina tuihualte ka thaa sungah ama in hong puak hi; lungmanna te in namthuam bangin keima hong hawk a, Hermon mual le Mizar mual tung pan Jordan ngun dong tuiteau nging bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka nuntakna ahi Pathian tungah zanin la khat ka sak thei natu le thungetna khat ka nei thei natu in Topa in sun lai in a itna kip hong lak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei hong hungpa Pathian tungah, “Banghangin hong mangil zo ni ziam? Ka ngalte tatsiatna banghangin thuak tan lai tu khi ziam?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Na Pathian sia koisungah om ziam?” ci in amate ii hong dawdok ciangin amate ii hong selnonate in kei hong supeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghangin tuaza in khuangai khi ziam? Banghangin tuaza in ngim nga khi ziam? Ka lametna Pathian tungah ka koi tu a, ka hunpa le ka Pathian khatvei ka pok kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, ka maw ngawlna sonlaak in a, Pathianzia bang ahi ngawlte taw thu ka kineina uh pan hong hung ta'n. a leilot, a ngilo mihingte kung pan hong hunkhia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang sia kei hong dalpa na hi hi; banghangin hong nusia ni ziam? Ka ngalte ii tatsiatna banghang thuak tan lai tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na khuavak le na thumaan thutak hong puak ta'n; tuate in na mual thiangtho Zion ah hong lampui tahen a, na teenna na Biakinnpi ah hong then kik tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang na biaknatau ah kong pai tu hi, Pathian awng; nangma in ka lungdamna ii a naak na hi hi. Ka tengtongh ka tum tu a, pokna la kong sak tu hi, Pathian, ka Pathian awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghangin tuaza in khuangai khi ziam? Banghangin tuaza in ngim nga khi ziam? Ka lametna sia Pathian sungah ka koi tu a, ka hunpa ka Pathian khatvei ma ka pok kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, ngei tawngh lai in na sep na vawtte ka taanghpupite in hong son zo a, ka bil uh taw ka za zo uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma mama in Pathian he ngawlte bangbang na notkeak a, amate ii leitang tungah na mite bangbang na koi a; minam dangte bangbang daan pia in, na mite bangbang khangtosak ci thu ka za uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite in tua leitang sia amate ii a namsau taw zothal hi ngawl hi; amate vaangletna taw a zothal hi ngawl hi; nangma vaangletna le thahatna taw ahizong, nangma ompuina taw ahizong a zo hi a, tua in amate na itna na lakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma in ka kumpipa le ka Pathian na hi hi; na mite tungah zawna na pia a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaciangin nangma vaangletna taw ngalte ka zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei hong hun tu in ka thal ahibuale ka namsau ka muang bua hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahihang nangma in ka ngalte khut sung panin nong hun zo a, hong ensante na zo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang kong pok tawntung tu a, a tawntungin lungdam kong ko tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang tu laitakin nong nial a, lelna nong thuaksak hi; ka ngalkap honte nong tonpui nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koma ngalte kung panin nong taisak a, ko neisate amate atu in la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuute bangin nong kingolumsak hi; ngamdang ah nong thethaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangma man a nei lei ngawlte bang phetin na mite takpi man tawmno taw nong zuak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka innpaamte in ko tungah nong ngamtatna teng hong mu a, amate in ko hong selno in hong nuisan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minam tuatuamte sungah ko sia ngual zawnsak tu in nong koi hi; amate in a lu uh hong thin in hong nunau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei sia a tawntungin minsiat ka thuak hi; maizumna in hong khunel hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ka ngalte le hong ensante ii hong nunauna le hong selnona ka zaak ciangin ka mai zumna in hong khulum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang hong mangil ngawl ahibuale ko taw na vawt thuciamna paltan ngawl hi napi, hi bangte ko tungah hong piang siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang tungah thumaan ngawlin ka om ngei bua uh hi; nong thupiakte kong nial bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua hi napi ngamsate kawm ah a cimaw in nong nusia hi; a thukbel khuazing sungah nong nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka Pathian kong biakna tawlnga hi le ung a, ngamdangte pathian tungah thungen hi le ung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />hong mu tatak zo tu ni hi, banghang ziam cile ka ngaisut kute dongin nong he siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang nang hu in kote thalupna ka thuak tawntung uh a, ngawlup tu tuute bangin hong kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa awng, hong khanglo ta'n! Banghangin mu ni ziam? Nangma le nangma hong thoto ta'n! A tawntungin ko hong nial heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Banghangin ko kung panin buu ni ziam? Ka thuakna uh le ka ngimnate hong makngilsak heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lei ah pukin ka topcip zo uh hi; leivui sungah lelna taw ka liik zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ko hong hu tu in hong pai ta'n! Nong itna kip hangin hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa atu hi la ka phua laitakin ka khua ngaisutna in kammal hoi nawno taw kidim hi. Lai at thiampa laikung bangin ka leei sia lamal phuak tu in kinging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in pasal a minpiang a mealphabel na hi hi; kampau thiam pa na hi hi. Pathian in nangma thupha hong pia tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaanglian Kumpipa awng; na namsau hong kua tan nangma in minthang in uk zawkna vaang nei ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thumaan le thutang khenna a huu tu in zawna sungah na uk theina vaang taw hong pai ta'n. Na thahatna in zawna lianpite hong ngasak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thaltangte hiam a, na ngalte lungtangte vutlet hi; minam tuatuamte in na peang ah puksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian ii hong piak kumpi ngam sia a tawntung a tawntungin kikhomsuan tu hi. Na mite thukhaikim taw na uk hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a maan na dei a, a siate na ensan hi. Tua hu in nangma ii Pathian in nang hong teal zo a, kumpi dang khat po sangin na tungah lungdamna a tamzaw hong buak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Myrrh le aloe a namtuite thau, na puan tungah nam hi; saiha taw a kizeam kumpi inn sungah music thiamte in nang hong lungdamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na suumsung sang a om numeite sia kumpite tanute veu hi a, tuaciang na kumpi tokhum ziatsang ah kumpinu dingin, ama in khamh phabel taw a kivawt kizepnate taw kizeam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa zi tu monu awng, kong thuson sia ngai in, na mite le na beete mangil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na mealphatna hangin kumpipa in hong dei tu hi; ama in na topa ahikom ama thu na ni tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tyre mihingte in nang atu letsong hong paipui tu hi; sumhaute in maipha na piak tu hong hanciam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kumpipa tanu kumpi inn sungah om hi — ama bangza in a mealpha ziam! A puantual sia khamh khau taw kitak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mealcii tuatuam a nei puantual pawl silhin kumpipa kungah ama kipaipui a, ama a zui moliate zongh kumpipa kungah a vekpi in kipaipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungdamna le thinnopna taw amate hong pai a kumpipa inn sungah hong tum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nang ka kumpipa in, na taanghpupite kumpiza a laih tu tapa tam mama na nei tu hi. Tuaciang amate sia leitung bup a ukte na suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka laphua in na minthanna sia a tawntungin nungtasak tu a, mihing theampo in hong pai lai tu hun theampo sungah nang hong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in ih belhna le ih thahatna hi a, ngimna hun sungah hong hun tu in a kinging sa in om tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ahikom leitung keak a ngawk ngawp a mualte tuipi thuk sungah a kisep hial zong;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tuipite hawkin kilok a, mualte liing ngawp le zong ih lau buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A Saangbel Pa ii inn thiangtho, Pathian khuapi a lungdamsak ngun khat a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in tua khuapi sungah om a, tua khuapi a lal ngei buatu hi; zing khuavak tuungin a hu tu in ama hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minamte lau uh a, kumpi ngam liinglawng hi. Pathian aw ngingin, tuaciang leitung tuitham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa, Vaanglianbelpa in ei taw omkhawm hi; Jacob ii Pathian sia ih bukna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ii sep sa le vawt sate en tu in hong pai tavun; leitung ah a vawt na lamdangte en in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in leitung theampo ah ngal kidonate thimsak hi; ama in thalkawngte thiaktan a, teite susia in, lumte haltham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Kisim kidona tawp vun a, Pathian ka hina hong tel tavun, minamte ii sungah a lianbel le leitung ii tungsia ah a lianbel ka hi hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa in ei taw hong omkhawm hi. Jacob ii Pathian sia ih bukna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungdamin na khut uh beang vun, mihing theampo awng! A nging lasaknate taw Pathian pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa a Saangbel Pa sia kiitak tu ahi hi; Ama in leitung theampo a uk kumpilian pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in mihingte tungah zawna ei hong pia hi; minamte hong uksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hong it ama mihingte ii kiphatsakpui tu neisa ahi ih teenna leitang sia ama in hong tealsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in ama ii kumpi tokhum zuan to hi. Topa a pai to laitak lungdamna taw auna le lemle awte nging hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian tungah pokna lasa vun; ih kumpipa tungah pokna lasa vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in leitung theampo ii kumpipa ahi hi; lasaknate taw ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in ama ii kumpi tokhum thiangtho tungah to hi; ama in minamte uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Minam tuatuam a ukte in Abraham ii Pathian ii mite taw hong kikhawm uh hi. Ngalkap hon theampo sangin ama thahat zaw hi; a lianbel in ama maang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sia lian a, ih Pathian khuapi sung le a mual thiangtho tungah nasia takin pok tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion, Pathian mual sia, saangin hoi hi; kumpilianpa khuapi in leitung theampo lungdamna hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian in a khuapi kulhte sungah ngammuanna om hi ci in lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpite kikhawmtua in Zion Mual sim tu in hong kuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang tuasia a mu uh ciangin lamdang sa hi; amate lau in taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua munah amate sia launa le thinngimna taw nausuak tu a tun numei khat bang hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />lauhuai vuipi suangval sungah a kilok teambawte taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian vawt sa le sep sate ih zaaksa hi a, tu in Vaanglianbel Topa ih Pathian khuapi sungah tuate ih mu zo hi; ama in tua khuapi sia a tawntungin keamcing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian awng, na Biakinnpi sungah, nong itna kip ka ngaisun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mun theampo ah nang hong kipok a, leitung theampo ah na minthanna kizel hi. Thutang khenna taw nangma in na uk hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion mihingte lungdam tahen! Nangma in a maan thukhennate na pia hi; Judah khuapite sungah lungdamna om tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian mite awng, Zion kiimkot ah pai vun a, ngalvilna tausaangte a phakza sim vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khang kikte tungah na son thei natu in luphungte le kulhpite ciamtee in, veal vun a, hi bangin ci vun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hi Pathian in a tawntung a tawntung atu eite Pathian ahi hi; hong pai lai tu hunte theampo sungah ama in eite lam hong pui tu hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A kuama po in hi thu za vun! Mun theampo a om mihingte awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lian, a no, a hau, a zawng a kibangin ngai khawm tek vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngaisutte kitelthiang tu hi; ciimna kammalte ka pau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paunakte kong zangh tu a tengtongh ka tum ciang a khiakna kong sontel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngalte in hong kiim uum a, launa hun sungah ka om ciang ka lau bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hauna uh muangin a neisate uh a kiphatsakpui mihing ngilote in hong kiim uum hangin ka kiita buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihing khat in ama le ama kitan thei ngeingawl hi; a nuntakna ii man Pathian tungah lo zo ngeingawl hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />banghang ziam cile mihing khat ii nuntakna ii a man sia tam leih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thaankuul a thet ngawl natu le tawntung nuntak natu in ama ii piak thei tute a kicing ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing mawmawte le a nanghte bangma in mihing a ciimte zongh thi hi ci in a kuama theampo ii mu thei ahi hi. Amate theampo in a hauna uh sia a suan a paalte nusiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in leitangte nei ngei ahihang Amate ii thaankuulte sia a tawntungin a inn uh hi a; tua munah a tawntungin teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing khat ii letna in thina panin ama hun thei ngeingawl hi; ama sia nganhingte bangin thi veve tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hauna uh taw a lungkimte ii tawpna le amate le amate a kimuangte bang tawk ziam ci sia en vun —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />amate sia tuute bangin a thi tu in kisee a, Thina sia amate tuucing pa a hi tu hi. Amate pumpi sia manlang takin muatin amate ii inn taw a kikhuala mithi khua ah a om uh ciang thutangte in amate tungah zawna mualsua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in kei hong suatak tu hi; thina vaangletna panin kei hong hun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat a hau ciang le ama haunate a khan seseam ciang zongin na thinnuammaw heak vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ama in a thi ciangin keng thei tuan ngawl hi; a hauna sia ama in thaan ah tonpui thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing khat in hi nuntakna sungah lungkim in ama zawnate hu in kipok kale,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama in thi in a tawntung khua zingna mun a taanghpupite kung zuan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihing khat ii letna in thina panin ama hun zo ngeingawl hi; ama sia nganhingte bangin thi lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbel Pathian ahi Topa hong pau hi; ama in leitung bup nisuana le nitumna kilaklaw ah a om theampo khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hoina taw a kicing Zion khuapi panin Pathian vaang hong taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite Pathian hong pai a, ahihang a thimtham in hong pai bua hi; ama mai ah a lengkeak meikuang om a, vuipi suangval in a kiim uum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a mite tungah thu a khen ciangin a tetti tu in van le lei sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in, “Sangaw biakpiakna nei in, kei taw thuciamna a vawt, a thumaan ka mihingte kei kungah hong khawmtua tavun” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantungte in Pathian sia thutang a, ama in thukhenpa ma hi ci in thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka mite awng, na ngai vun, hong son tu khi hi; Israel te awng, note langpanna tetti pang tu khi hi. Kei sia Pathian ka hi a, note Pathian ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na sangaw biakpiaknate hu le nong piak tawntung uh meihal biakpiaknate hu in kong mawsak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na lo sung pan na khuitalte ahizong, na nganhon sung pan kealte ahizong ka kitaangsamh bua hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />duisung nganhing theampo le mual tul tam mamate tungah nganhonte sia keima aa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngamsung vacimte theampo le nuntakna a nei theampo zongh keima neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka ngil a kial le nang tungah an kong ngen buatu hi, banghang ziam cile leitung le a sungah om na theampo sia keima neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuitalte ii sa ne in, ahibuale kealte ii chi dawn na khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian tungah lungdamkona sia nangma sangaw biakpiakna hi zaw tahen, Vaanglianbelpa tungah piak tu a, na kamciam bangin pia siat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ngimna hong pai ciangin keima hong ko tavun; Noma kong hun tu a kei nong pok tu uh hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in mi seksolte munah, “Banghangin ka thupiakte lotnga nu ziam? Banghangin ka thuciam sia thu sonin nei tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />No kong puuaphat tu nong oai bua uh a, ka thupiakte na nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nguta na mu theampo ii lawm na hi uh a palngul mawneite taw na kipawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ngitlona thuson tu in a tawntungin a kinging sa in na om uh hi; Leilot thute na son tu na haisaang ngei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na suapuite uh mawsiat tu in na kinging uh a, a khial natu na zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hite theampo na sep uh hangin, bangma kong ci bua hi, tuasia ciang kei sia noma taw a kibangin nong tuat uh hi. Ahihang tu in kong mawsak a, a thu kong telthiangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“No, kei hong ngaingonte awng, hi thu ngai vun, tua ahibuale kong susia tu hi, tuaciang no hong hun tu kuama a om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lungdamkona sia kei vaang hong pia sangaw biakpiakna hi a, kei thu hong nite theampo ka hun takpi tu hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, nong itna kip hu in kei hong hesuak ta'n, A lian na hesuakna hu in ka mawnate hong melsak ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ngitlona theampo hong silsak ta'n a, ka mawna panin hong thiangthosak ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka tatkhialnate ka he a, ka mawnate ka phawk tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma tung tatak ah hong maw zo khi hi, sia na sakte ka vawt zo hi. Tua ahiciangin, thu nong khenna sia maan hi; kei nong mawsak sia khial ngawl ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka pian ni pan ma in a sia ka hi hi; ka nu ngil sungah ka om lai pan ma in mimaw ka hi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Citakna le thumaanna sia na dei thu ahi hi; ka khua ngaisutna sia na ciimna taw hong dim ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mawna hong laakkeaksak ta'n, tua hile ka thiangtho tu hi, hong sil ta'n, tua hile vuuk sang ka ngo zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thinnopna le lungdamna awte hong zasak ta'n; na delpeak, na sukthap sa ka hi tazong khatvei ma ka lungdam kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mawnate hong etsak heak in a, ka siatnate theampo hong melmaisak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian awng, ka sungah thin thiangtho hong bitphua ta'n a, a thak le a thumaan thaa hong nguan ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na omna mun panin hong beng heak in; ka tung panin na thaa thiangtho lakeak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ngupna tungtawn a hong pai lungdamna sia hong pia kik ta'n a, na thu a ni nuam tu in hong siam ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin mimawte sia nangma thupiakte ka hil tu a, amate in nang hong zuan kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian awng, ka nuntakna hong khoaikhe ta'n a, hong hun ta'n, tuaciang thutang na hina lungdam takin ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa awng, ka pau thei natu in hong hu ta'n, tuaciang nangma kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sangaw biakpiaknate na dei bua hi, tua hi buale tuate kong pia zo tu hi; meihal biakpiaknate taw na lung a kim zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian dei sangaw biakpiakna sia a kiniamkhiak thinsung ahi hi; Pathian awng, a kiniamkhiak le a kisiik kik thinsung na nial bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian awng, Zion tungah thuthiam in na hu in; Jerusalem luphungte na ciangto kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a kilawm sangaw biakpiaknate le koma ii meihal biakpiaknate dik na sa tu hi; tuaciang na biaknatau tungah khuitalte biakpiakna in hong kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Milian pa awng banghangin na siatna kiphatsak pui ni ziam? Pathian thumaanna sia a tawntungin kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngualdangte lal natu in na ngeal uh hi; na leei sia mulnam hiam khat taw kibang a, leilot thu na phuaktawm tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Siatna sia phatna sangin na lamnai zaw uh a, thumaan sangin a maan ngawl thu na deizaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang a leilot thei sia awng, na kammalte taw mite natsak tu na lamnai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahikom Pathian in nang sia hong lalcipsak top tu hi; ama in nang hong man tu a, na inn panin hong tua tu hi; a nungtate omna leitung panin nang hong khiin tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thutangte in hisia mu tu a, amate lauthawng tu uh hi; tuaciang amate in nang hong nuisan tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“En vun, ngammuan natu Pathian a suang ngawl, hi sungah mihing khat om a, ama in a nei a lamh tampite suang a, seksol ngamtatna taw ngammuanna zon a sawm zaw hi,” hong ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang kei ka hile Pathian inn sungah a po olive thingkung bang ka hi hi; ama ii hong itna kip sia a tawntung, a tawntungin ka muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian awng, na sepsa nate hu in lungdam kong ko tawntung tu hi; na mite omna munah nang sia a pha na hi hunlam ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing mawmawte in, “Pathian om bo!” ci uh hi. Amate theampo siatna khaatna taw kidim siat a, a cizathuai nate seam zo uh hi; a maan a seam kuama a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing khat po a ciim a om ziam, ama a bia khat po a om ziam ci in, Topa in vantung panin mihingte ensuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang amate lampial siat zo uh hi; amate a kibangin sia siat hi. A maan a ngamta khat zongh om ngawl, khat beak zongh om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Ama te in he ngawl ziam?” Topa in dongh hi. “Hi a tatsiate in heakna nei ngawl ziam? Amate in ka mite neisa sutolna taw nungta a, kei tungah thu hong ngen ngeingawl hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang amate in nidangin a thuak ngeingawl uh launa nasia thuak tu uh hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian in a mite ii ngalte ii ngute sia thethaang tu hi. Pathian in amate nial zo ahikom, Israel in amate zothal siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion panin Israel te ii zawna hong pai natu in bangza in thungen khi ziam. Topa in Israel te a khantosak kik hun ciang bangza in amate lungdam tu ziam!
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, na vaangletna taw hong hun ta'n; na thahatna taw hong suatak ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian awng, kong thungetna hong za ta'n; ka kammalte hong ngai ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing kiphasakte in kei hong sim tu in hong kuan hi; Pathian a awlmawk ngawl mihing ngilote in kei thalup tu in hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in kei hong hupa hi. Topa in kei hong hungpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in amate ngitlona sia ka ngalte daan piakna in nei tahen. Ama in amate sucip tu hi, banghang ziam cile ama thumaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, lungdam takin sangaw biakpiakna khat kong pia tu hi; lungdam kong ko tu hi banghang ziam cile nangma na pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ngimnate theampo sung pan nong suatak zo a, ka ngalte a kizaw sia ka mu zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, ka thungetna hong za ta'n; kong thuumna panin hong nungngat heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hong ngai ta'n a hong zo ta'n; ka thinngimna taw zawmcip zo khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngalte hong tawnna hu in ka lau a, mihing seksolte hong zawthawkna hangin ka topcip zo hi. Amate in ka tungah ngimna hong puak hi; amate kei tungah hong thin uukin hong ensan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lau mama a, thi tu launa in hong nengcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Liinna le launa in kei hong lencip hi; patauna in kei hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vakhu bangin tha nei leng ka uuk hi. Leangin tawlngakna ka mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khualana ah ka leang tu a, duisung ah ka teang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thin uuk vuipi suangvalte panin bukna khat manlang takin ka mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa awng, ka ngalte kampau uh hi bialbualsak in. Khuapi sungah, ngoltolna le buainate ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sun taw zan taw tua khuapi kiim uum uh a, tua khuapi sia khut khialna le ngimna taw kidimsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mun theampo ah lalna om hi; lampite sia zawthawkna le kitheamna taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei hong nunau sia ka ngal khat hile thuak zo tu khi hi; kei hong langpan khat ii ka tungah hong kiphatsakna hile ama kung panin ka buu thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang tuasia in ka kitholpui, ka pawl, ka lawm cii pha ahi nangma hi thong ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khat le khat sia thu ih kumkhawm a, Biakinnpi sungah ih bia khawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ngalte sia amate hun a cin ma in thi tahen; mithi khua ah amate a hingtang in zuansuk tahen! Siatna sia a inn sung le a thinsung uh ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang hong hu tu in Topa Pathian ka sam a, tuaciang ama in kei hong hun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zingsang, sun le zan in ka thuumnate le ka taunate ama kungah paito a, tua ahikom ama in ka aw hong za tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngal tazata ka simnate pan ama in kei bit takin hong ciapui kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tawntung hun pan a, hong uk Pathian in kei hong za tu a, amate a zo tu hi; banghang ziam cile amate kikheal nuam ngawlin, ama a kiita bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tu ma sia a, ka kitholpui pa in a lawmte sim hi; a kamciamte a peal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kammal ahile noaidiat sangin neal zaw ahihang, a thinsung ah etsatna om hi; a kammalte sia sathau bangin neal a, ahihang tuate in namsau hiamte bangin bantan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na ngimna uh te Topa nusiat vun, tua hile ama in hong hung tu hi; ama in mihing thumaante bangma hunin lelna thuaksak ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang, Pathian awng, mihing thatte le a leilotte nangma in amate khanlang a cin ma in a thaankuulte ah na paipui tu hi. Kei ka hile nang kong muang tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, Kei hong hesuak ta'n, banghang ziam cile kei hong kisim hi; ka ngalte in a tawntungin kei hong vawtsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei hong langpante in nitangtumin kei hong sim hi. Kei hong simte tam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa awng ka lau ciang, ka muanna nang sungah kong nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ka muang a, ka lau bua hi; ama ii hong kamciam hu in ama ka pok hi. Mihing lelel khat in kei bang hong law thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngalte in nitangtumin ngim hong pia hi; kei hong liamsua natu in amate in ngeal tawntung hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a buliana munte ah kikhawm in, hong thatlum thei tu in ki um uh a, ka ngamtatna theampo hong encik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian awng, amate ngitlona hu in amate daan pia in; na thin uukna taw tua mite zothal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangza in ngim nga ka hi sia nong he hi; nangma in ka thituite nong tepteesak zo hi. Na laibu sungah tuate kiciamtee hi ka na ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang kong sam ni in ka ngalte kiheak kiksak tu hi. Hi thu ka he hi: Pathian sia keima sangah hong pang —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a kamciamte ka pok Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama ka muang a, ka lau buatu hi. Mihing lelel khat in kei bang hong law thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian awng, kong kamciamsa sia kong pia tu hi; lungdamko piakkhiatna kong pia tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />banghang ziam cile nangma in thina panin nong suatak a, lelna panin nong keam hi. Tua ahikom Pathian ii mai, a nungtate tungah a taang khuavak sia sungah ka vak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei hong hesuak ta'n, Pathian awng, kei hong hesuak ta'n, banghang ziam cile ngammuanna nga natu in nang kong zuan hi. A nasia mama vuipi suangvalte a thim dong na thakhui ii limh nuai ah kidalna ka nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saangbel Pathian, ka kisapna theampo hong pia Pathian ka biakpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in vantung panin hong zo tu a hong hun tu hi; kei hong zothawte ama in zothal tu hi. Pathian in a itna kip le a thumaanna kei hong lak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngalte in kei hong kiim uum a, amate sia mihing sa a du tawpite bang ahi uh hi. Amate ii hatangte sia tei bang thaltang bang ahi uh hi; amate ii leeite sia a hiam namsau bang ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Van ah na letna lak in Pathian awng, leitung theampo ah na minthanna lak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngalte in kei hong mat natu in ngeen khat phalh hi; thinngimna taw ka kidim hi. Amate in ka lampi ah vuum khat to uh a, ahihang amate ma tua ii sungah taaksuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian awng, muanna kicing ka nei hi; la ka sa tu a, nang kong pok tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thaa awng, khanglo in! Ka tengtongh le ka liamlo awng, hong khanglo tavun. Tung sunni ka phong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa awng, minam tuatuamte sungah, lungdam kong ko tu hi. mihingte sungah nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na itna kip in vantungte ban hi; na thumaanna in van dong pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na letna van ah lak in, Pathian awng, na minthanna leitung theampo ah lak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No ngamukte in a maan khensatna na pia ngei uh ziam? Mihing khat sim ii tungah thutang in thu na khen uh ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khen ngawl nu hi! a sia na vawt thei tu uh teng bekma na ngaisun uh a, tuaciang ngam le lei ah ngoltol khialna liante vawt nu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing ngilote in a khan tawntung ngamtatna maan ngawl taw nungta uh hi; a pian ni pan kipan leilot thuson uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sia ngulte bangin nguu taw kidim hi; amate in ngulsok nangong bangin a bil uh huh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuate in ngul zol thiamte aw le za ngawl, mitbum thiamte phuisamna le za ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian awng, hi a kiitakhuai tawpite ii hate thiaktan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lei sungah tui tum bangin amate mang vadi tahen; lampi lai lopate bangin kisiikcil tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate sia buan ii khulup toktolte bang hi tahen; khuavak a mu ngeingawl a thisa a suak nausen khat bang hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in zongh tel man ngawlin lopa bangin kivaattan hi; a lauhuai thin uukna taw Pathian in amate a nuntak lai ma in muutkeak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mawneite daan a kipiak a mu uh ciang thutangte lungdam tu hi; amate in a seksolte ii chisan sung siikin tan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte in “Thutangte sia thaman kipia takpi hi; Leitung ah thu a khen Pathian khat om takpi hi,” a ci tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian awng, ka ngalte khut sung panin hong hun ta'n; kei hong simte kung panin hong dal ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua mihing ngilote kung panin hong hun ta'n; tua mihing thatte kung pan hong suatak ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />En in! Amate in kei that tu in hong pang hi; mihing tatsiate ka lang ah hong kikhawmtua uh hi. Amate ii tuabang a, manlang tak a kei hong sim natu mun a zot uh sia, mawna khat po hang ahibuale ka tatkhialna khat po hang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua ahibuale keima ii kicin laakna khat po hang zongh hi ngawl hi, Topa awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tho in, Topa Vaanglianbelpa Pathian awng, kei hong hu tu in hong kuan ta'n; Israel te ii Pathian awng, nangma ma in en in! Khanglo in, Pathian he ngawlte daan pia in; a ngilo ngual leeheak theite tungah hesuakna lak heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in nitak sangin hong heak kik a, ui bangin ngual ngalh a, khuapi sungah vak kawkoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate ii hong selnonate le hong tawnnate ngai in. Amate ii kam sungah om a leei sia namsau taw kibang ahitazong, kuama in amate pau za ngawl tu in um uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nangma in amate na nuisan a, Pathian he ngawl theampo na selno hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thahatna kong muang hi; nang sia ka bukna na hi hi, Pathian awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka Pathian in kei hong it a, kei kungah hong pai tu hi; ama in ka ngalte ii ngallelna kei hong musak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate thatlum heak in, Pathian awng, tuabang hi thong le te ka mite in mangil tha thei tu hi. Topa, kote hong dal pa awng, Na thahatna taw amate thethaang in a, zo cip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mawna sia amate muk ah om hi; amate kammal theampo mawna vive ahi hi; a kiphatsakna sungah amate awkvalh tahen! Amate in longsia le leilot thu zangh ahikom,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />na thin uukna taw amate susia in; susia cimit in. Tuasia ciang a kuama po in Pathian in Israel te a uk hunlam he tu a, a ukna sia leitung bup ah kithung ahi hunlam tel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka ngalte in nitak sangin hong heak kik in, ui bangin ngual ngalh a, khuapi sungah vak kawkoai uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />an zongin a vak uite taw kibang a, an a kicingin mu buale mau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang na thahatna thu, la in ka sa tu hi; na itna kip sia zing simin a ngingin, la in ka sa tu hi. Nang sia ka bukna na hi zo a, ngimna sungah ka belhna na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei hong hungpa awng, nangma kong pok tu hi. Ka bukna sia Pathian hi a, kei hong it Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangma in kote nong nial zo a, Pathian awng, nong zothal zo hi. Ko tungah na thin uuk zo hi — ahihang tu in kote hong maingat kik ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitangte nangma in na liingsak a na kekthamsak hi; tu in a keknate kimatsak kik in banghang ziam cile cimhtham tu in kithoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na mite nasia takin nong thuaksak hi; zukham bang keakin ka hoi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang hong thasiate tungah kidop natu thu na pia zo a, tua taw amate in lalna tu pan suakta thei tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thahatna taw kote hong hun ta'n; na it, na mite a suatak natu in ko thungetna hong zo ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama ii a thiangtho mun panin Pathian in, “Zawna mualsuana taw Shechem ka khentham tu a, Sukkoth Ngamkuam sia ka mite ka hawmsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead sia keima aa hi a, Manasseh zongh keima aa ahi hi. Ephraim sia ka thik lukhu hi a, Judah sia ka kumpi ciangkhut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Moab sia kisilna kuangin ka zangh tu a, keima neisa ahi hunlam a kitel natu in ka peangdap taw Edom ka deang tu hi. Philistine te in kei tungah zawna mualsua in au tu ki um ziam?” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian awng, luphung taw a ki uum khuapi sungah akua in kei hong paipui tu ziam? Edom ah akua in kei lam hong pui tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kote hong nial takpi zo ni ziam? Ka ngalkap honte taw hong mainawt pui ngawl tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngal hong dopui ta'n; mihingte hong huna sia mannung ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian ei sangah hong pang pole ih zo tu hi; ama in ih ngalte zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, ka auna hong za ta'n; ka thungetna hong ngai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thin kiamin inn taw a kikhuala na pan nang kong biakpui hi! A muanhuai bukna ah hong zotpui ta'n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />banghang ziam cile nangma in ka kidalna na hi hi, ngalte ka nan natu a kho ngalnanna na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka khan tawntung na inn thiangtho sungah hong teangsak ta'n; na thakhui nuai ah ngammuanna hong ngasak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian awng, kong kamciamsate nong za zo a, nang vaang hong piate ii neisate kei nong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa ii nuntakna kum tampi belapsak in; a nuntakna sausak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian awng, nangma ompuina sungah ama in ngam uk tawntung tahen; na itna kip le na thumaanna taw ama sungsia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua hi a, kong kamciamsate nang tungah ni simin kong piak ciang pokna la kong sak tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei hong hun tu in Pathian thinsau takin ka ngak hi; Ama bekma ka suang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama bekma in kei hong sungsia a, hong hun hi; ama sia kei hong hungpa hi a, hong kizo thal ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dal a puk sa sia sangin a kho ngawl zaw mihing khat sia note theampo in bang tanvei sisim lai tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama vaang a kipiakna dinmun panin a khiasuk nuam bek hi thong nu hi; note in leilot thusonna sungah nuam na sa uh hi. Thupha piakna kammalte na zak uh hang, na thinsung uh ah ama na haamsiat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in Pathian bek ka suang hi; ama ii sungah ka lametna ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama bekma in kei hong sungsia a, hong hun hi; ama sia kei hong hungpa hi a, hong kizo thal ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei hong kingupna le hong ki upatna sia Pathian tung pan bek hi; ama in a thahat kei hong sungsia pa ahi hi; ama in ka belhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hun theampo sungah Pathian muang vun, ka mite awng. Na ngimna theampo ama ko vun, banghang ziam cile ama sia ih bukna hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihingte sia, husan khat bang bek hi siat hi; a lian a no a kibangin man nei ngawl hi. Khaikhin tungah koi leang bangma ngit ngawl hi; tuate sia husan khat sangin zaangzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngoltolna sungah thin muang heak vun; sutolna taw meetna bangma nga tu in ki um heak vun; na haunate a khangto hial zongin tuate suang heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in vaangletna sia ama aa hi a, ama ii itna sia kip hi ci in a son tamvei ma ka za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma tatak ma in mihing sim atu, a sep babangin thaman na pia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, nangma in ka Pathian na hi a, nangma kong thangai hi. Ka nuntakna buppi in nang hong dei hi; tui om ngawl, munko, lei tulsate in tui a du bangin ka thaa in nang hong du hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Inn thiangtho sungah nang hong musak ta'n; nang sia bangza in minthang a thahat cisia hong musak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nong itna kip sia nuntakna sangin phazaw hi, tua ahikom nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nuntak lai teng lungdam kong ko tu hi; ka khutte laamto in thu kong ngen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka thaa in kibuailamna an ne in lungkim tu a, pokna lungdamna late nang kong sak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lupna tungah ka lup ciangin nang kong phawk a, zankhuateakin nang kong ngaisun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />banghang ziam cile nangma in a tawntungin kei hong hu pa na hi hi. Na thakhui ii limh nuai ah lungdam in la ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma kong luai a, na khut in hong keamcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei hong thatlum nuamte mithi khua zuansuk tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngal kisimna sungah amate kithatlum tu a, ngiapuite in a luangte ne tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in ama zawna pia ahikom, kumpipa a lungdam tu hi. Pathian min taw kamciam a piate in ama pok tu a, ahihang leilot theite kam kihuksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngim nga khi hi, Pathian awng, ka thungetna hong ngai ta'n! Ka ngalte kiita khi hi, ka nuntakna hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing seksolte le mi ngilo honte ii hong thasawmna panin hong dal ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in a leei uh namsau bangin taat hiam uh a, tuaciang kamsia pau tu in thaltang kap tu bangin eal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in zummawk leilot thute manlang takin kizelsak hi; amate in mihing phate lauthauh vai taw sonsia in lalsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in khat le khat sia ngual sawmku tu in kihanthawn uh hi; a thaangsia na mun tu kikum in, “Kuama in amate mu thei buan te” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a sia tupnate ngeal kholin, “A cingtaak khialna lian ngeal zo hing” ci uh hi. Mihingte thinsung le lungsung sia telhak thu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in a thaltangte taw amate kap a, thakhat thu in liam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in tua kammalte hu in amate susia tu hi; amate a mu theampo in a lu pei san tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate theampo lau tu uh hi; Amate in Pathian sep sa nate ngaisun tu uh a, tuaciang ama ii sepnate sawson tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thutang mihing theampo in Topa sepnate hangin lungdam tu uh hi. Amate in ama sungah ngammuang tu uh hi; mipha theampo in ama pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, Zion khua sungah nang kong pok tu uh le nang tungah ka kamciamna uh ka kholet tu uh sia a maan ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />banghang ziam cile nangma in thungetnate na zo hi. Mun theampo panin mihingte in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />amate mawnate hangin nang hong zuan tu uh hi. Koma khialnate in hong zo hi, ahihang nangma in tuate na maisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na inn thiangtho sungah teang tu in na paipui, na teal sate mi nuamsate ahi uh hi. Na inn sungah na phate, na Biakinnpi thiangtho ii thuphate hangin ka lung uh kim tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zawna nong piakna taw kote ngetna nong zo a, ko nong ngup natu in nalamdangte na vawt hi. Leitung bup mihingte le a khuala tuipi ngal khat ah a omte in nang hong muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na vaangletna lian lakin, nangma in mualte na thahatna taw a om natu munah na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma in tuipite hawkna le tui kihual ngingte na thimsak hi; nangma in mihingte ii ngamlumna na thimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung bup in na sepsa na liante lamdang sa in om uh hi. Na nasepnate in lungdam aunate leimong khat pan leimong khat dong thengsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitang na thinbotna na lakna in nguatui na puak a; leipha leihoi in na vawt hi. Luamte tui taw na dimsak hi; leitung ah an na piangsak hi. Na sepzia in hi bang ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a kitho sa lote tungah nguatui a kicing piikpeak in na zusak a, lei na zenhsak hi; nangma in leitangte sia nguatui taw na nipsak a, thingno ankungte na khangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na phatna in bangza in an hauna piangsak ziam! Na paina theampo ah na a kicing takin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nganthana munte sia nganhon taw kidim hi; muallimveite sia lungdamna taw kidim hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lote sia tuu taw kidim a; ngamkuamte sia zungtaang taw kidim hi. Na theampo lungdamna taw au in lasa uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing theampo awng, lungdamin auna taw Pathian pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii minthanna la in sa vun a, a minthang pokna ama pia vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian mun ah, “Na sep na vawtte bangza in lamdang ziam! Na vaangletna in lian lawlawm a, na ngalte in kiitakna taw na mai ah kun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung mihing theampo in nangma hong bia uh hi; amate in pokna la hong sak uh a, amate in na min pokna la nang hong sak uh hi” ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hong pai tavun a, Pathian sepna sate, mihingte atu a lamdang a septe hong en tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in tuipi sia leiko suaksak hi; ih taanghpupite in a peang uh taw ngun kaantan hi. Tua munah eite in ama ii sepna hu in ih lawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a thahatna taw a tawntungin uk a, minam tuatuamte mitsuan hi. Ama langpanin kuama in tualngal tho heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minam theampo awng, ih Pathian pok vun; na pokna uh kiza tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in eite a nungta in hong keam a, ih liik tu a oai bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian awng, kote hong sit zo ni hi; ngunn sia meisa taw a kithiansak bangin kote nong sittel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thaang sungah nong awksak a, ka nungzaang uh ah vanhngit nong suan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ngalte in nong tuanhcilsak hi; meikuang le namthuam kaantanin ka pai uh hi, ahihang tu in nangma in ngammuanna mun khat nong then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na inn ah meihal biakpiakna kong paipui tu hi; kong kamciam sia kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngim ka nga hun lai kong pia tu hi ci in kong kamciam teng kong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biaknatau tungah hal tu in tuute ka pia tu hi; khuitalte le kealte sangaw biakpiakna in ka nei tu a, a meikhu in van ah kaato tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian a patoaite theampo awng, hong pai tavun a ngai vun, tuasia ciang kei atu ama sep theampo kong son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hu ngenin ama ka biakpui hi; late taw ama ka pok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka mawnate awlmawk ngawl hi leng Topa in kei hong nangai ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in kei hong za takpi zo hi; ka thungetna hong ngai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian ka pok hi, banghang ziam cile ama in ka thungetna hong nial ngawl a, hong itna kip sia kei kung panin la kik ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, kote hong hesuak ta'n a, thupha hong pia ta'n; cikna taw kote hong en ta'n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua hile leitung bup in na deina he thei tu hi; minam tuatuamte in na ngupna he thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian awng, mihingte in nang hong pok tahen; mihing theampo in nang hong pok tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minam tuatuamte lungdam in lawpna taw lasa hen, banghang ziam cile thukhaikim in mihingte tungah thu na khen hi; tuaciang leitung minam theampo lam na lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian awng, mihingte in nang hong pok tahen; mihing theampo in nang hong pok tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leitang in lo ante piangsak zo hi; Pathian, eite Pathian in thupha hong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in eite thupha hong pia zo hi; mun theampo ah om mihingte in ama upat thei tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hong dingto a, a ngalte kithethaangsak hi. Ama a ensante in lelna taw taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meikhu a kiseamkeak bangin amate hawlkeak hi; khuainunte meikuang mai ah a tuithap bangin, mihing seksolte Pathian mai ah a mangthang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang thutangte in ama ii omna ah lungdam in lawp uh hi; amate lungdam in, lawpna taw au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian tungah lasa vun, ama min pokna lasa vun; meei tungah a to pa atu in lampi sial khol vun. Ama min sia Topa hi a, ama ii mai ah lungdam vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama ii Biakinnpi thiangtho sungah a teang Pathian in tangate khoi a, meingongte sungsia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in pawl nei ngawl, a ngamkhingte ii teen natu inn khat pia a, thongtaakte lungdam suatakna sungah lampui hi; ahihang a leedote ngam tawnghtolna munah teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian awng, na mihingte lam na pui hun, sennealngam kaantan in mai na nawk pui ciangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sinai Pathian ahi Israel te ii Pathian hong paina hangin, lei kiliing a, van in nguatui buaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in ngua na zusak piikpeak a, a tul sa na leitang na puuapha kik hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na mite in tua munah a inn sa uh hi; na phatna taw mizawngte kisap teng na sik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in thupia a, numeite tam mama in tua thu son uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Kumpipate le a ngalkap honte taikeak hi!” ci uh hi. Inn ngak nupite in ngalte neisa a kiman teng hawm uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a thakhui khamh cipha taw a tee vakil, ngunn taw a kituam vakhu limte zongh kihel hi. (Banghangin ngal kido ni in note pawlkhat tuu khawk sungah om nu ziam?)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Pathian in kumpipate Zalmon Mual tungah a thethaang ciang tua munah ama in vuuk taaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bashan mual sia mualdawn tam mama a nei mual khat hi a, bangza in a nasia mual ahi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Banghangin a nasia na mualdawn saangte panin Pathian ii a ten natu a teal mualtung sia zawnsakna taw en ni ziam? Topa sia tua munah a tawntungin teang tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thahat siphu ngalleang tul tampite taw Topa in Sinai panin a thiangtho mun zuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a saangna munte ah kaato a, a ngalmat sa tam mama tonpui hi; ama in a leedo mite tung panin letsong saang hi. Tua munah Topa Pathian teang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ni khat zawkciang ni khat ih vanhngit hong puaksak Topa pok vun; ama in eite hong hunkhia Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eite Pathian sia hong hunkhia Pathian ahi hi; ama in Topa, eite Topa hi a, thina panin eite hong suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A mawna a kheal nuam ngawl, a ngalte ii lutang sia Pathian in sutham takpi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in, “Na ngalte Bashan panin kong paipui kik tu hi; tuipi thukna panin amate ka lato kik tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tua hile amate chisan sung siikin na tan thei tu uh a, na uite in a du zaza liak thei tu uh hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian awng, zawna mualsuana taw ka kumpipa, ka Pathian ii a biakinn thiangtho sung a zotna sia a kuama po in mu tek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />La sate masa a, music thiamte nungkhak in, a lai ah numeite in daalkual khuangnote tumin pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“A mite kikhopna sungah Pathian pok vun; No Jacob suan theampo awng, Topa pok tek vun!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A masa phitin unau sungah a nobel ahi Benjamin suante hong pai a, a zom in Judah suan lampuite le amate pawlte, a nung panin Zebulun le Nephtali suante ii lampuite in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian awng, kumpipate ii nang letsong hong piakna Jerusalem na Biakinnpi pan, ko atu na zak, na vaangletnate hong lak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pumpa sungah a om ngamsa ahi, Egypt te teih in; khuinote taw a omkhawm khuital hon ahi, minamte theampo na mai ah kunin a ngunn nei uhte nang hong piak mateng in, teih in. Ngal a kin mihingte thethaang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Egypt ngam panin tongciin uliante hong pai tu hi; Ethiopia mite in Pathian tungah a khutte laamto in thungen tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leitung kumpi ngamte awng, Pathian tungah lasa vun, Topa pokna lasa vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Taanghlai a, a om van, tua van ah a to pa pok vun. Ama ii a vaanglian awpui ngai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian ii vaangletna thangsak vun; A uk theina vaang sia Israel te tungah om a, ama thahatna sia van ah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian a thiangtho inn pan hong pai ciangin bangza in kiitakhuai ziam! Ama in thahatna le vaangletna a mite tungah pia hi. Pathian pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hong hun ta'n, Pathian awng! Tui in ka ngawng ciang hong khum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Buan thuk sungah ka tum suk a, lei ngum mun om ngawl hi; tui thukna sung ka theng a, tuihualte hangin tui ka ta dektak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hu ngenin ka biapupuina taw ka tha bo a, ka longtawl taak hi. Nong hu tu kong zawzonna ka mit taak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangma thu om ngawl a, kei hong ensante sia ka lu a samzamte sangin tamzaw hi. Ka ngalte in kei langpanna leilot thu son hi; amate hat a, kei hong thatlum nuam hi. Ka nguk ngawl bul nate amate in hong pia kiksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian awng, ka mawnate nang kung panin kiseal ngawl hi; bangzata mawmaw ka hi sia nong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma hong muangte maizum a pia hong hisak heak in, Vaanglianpipa Topa Vaanglianbelpa awng! Nangma hong biate tungah a mindaisak hong hisak heak in, Israel te ii Pathian awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei hong kiselnona sia nangma hang hi a, maizumna taw ka kikhucip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei sia ka suapuite atu in khualmi bang ka hi a, ka innkuanpuite atu in ngamdangmi bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na Biakinnpi atu ka thangaina in ka sungah mei bangin kuang liang hi. nang hong kiselnona kammalte kei tung hong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An tanna taw keima le keima kiniamkhiak in ka om ciang, mihingte in hong phunsan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />heena lakna puante ka silh hi, tuaciangin amate in hong nuisan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in lampite ah kei thu son a, zukhamte in kei huvau la phuak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang, Topa awng, kei ka hile nang tungah thu kong ngen tu hi; na teal hun khat ciangin kong ngetna hong zo ta'n, Pathian awng. Nong itna lianpi hu in hong zo ta'n, banghang ziam cile kong hun tu ci na kamciam sia na kipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Buannawng sungah ka tumsuk natu panin hong hun ta'n; ka ngalte kung panin hong keamcing ta'n, tuithuk sung panin hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuiliim namthuam in hong khumsak heak in; tui thukna ah hong tasak heak in a, thaankuul sungah hong taaksuksak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa awng, nong itna kip ii phatna sungah, kong ngetna hong zo ta'n; nong ciliapna lian taw kei sang hong nga ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na naseampa kung pan nangma le nangma kiseal heak in; kei sia ngimna lianpi thuak khi hi — tu mama in hong zo ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei kungah hong pai ta'n a, hong hun ta'n; ka ngalte khut sung panin hong suatak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei hong kiselnona, hong min daisaknate le, hong ngen ngasaknate na he hi; ka ngalte theampo na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hong kiselnona in ka thin hong tamhsak a, thinkiam in ka om hi. Hesuakna ka lamet hang koima ah a om bua hi; heenepna muangmaw ka hihang ka mu zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ngilkial ciangin amate in nguu hong pia hi; ka dangko ciangin amate in zuhau hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate ii poai khaamnate in amate lalna hi tahen; amate ii a thiangtho kibuailamna sia amate kiamsuk natu hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate a mit tawsakin! Amate a tawntungin a cingngu zawsak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thin uukna amate tungah tungsak in; na thangsiatna sia amate tungah tu tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate ii ngiaphualte kinusia tahen; amate ii buk sungah kuama kihingkhoai heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nangma ii daan na piak sate amate in vawtsia hi; nangma ii na liamsakte ii thuaknate amate in thuson in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate mawna theampo tepteena khat nei in; nang ii ngupna sungah amate kihelsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nuntakna laibu sung pan amate min sia kimel tahen; na mite a kitepteena lai sungah amate kihel heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahihang kei sia na sa in thinkiam in ka om hi; Pathian awng, hong laamto ta'n a, hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />La khat taw Pathian ka pok tu hi; ama ii letna sia ama tungah lungdamkona taw ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hisia in khuite taw ama biakpiakna sangin khuital khanthin sa khat taw sangaw biakpiakna a piak sangin Topa lungdamsak zaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A kizothawte in hisia a mu uh ciangin a lungdam tu uh hi; Pathian a biate kihansua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in a kitaangsamhte ngetna ngai a, thongtaak a mihingte a mangil bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Vantung le leitung awng, tuipi le a sung a om a nungta theampo awng, Pathian pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in Jerusalem hun tu a, Judah khuapite sa kik tu hi. Ama mite tua munah teang tu a, tua leitang lua tu uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a naseamte ii suan le paalte in tua ngam lua tu a, ama a itte tua munah teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, hong hun ta'n! Topa awng, tu ma in kei hong hu ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei hong thasawmte in lelna le thinbuaina thuak tahen. Kei ngim nganate hu in, a lungdamte in nungkin kik tahen a, maimawl tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei hong selnote in a lelna hu in thinkiam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang hong zuan theampo lungdam in thinnuam tahen. Nangma ii nong ngupna hu a, lungdam a ko thei theampo in, “Pathian bangza in lian ziam!” ci tawntung tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tha zawmin zawngkhal khi hi; ka kungah manlangin hong pai ta'n, Pathian awng. Nangma in kei hong ngumpa le ka Topa na hi a — kei hong hu memeang ta'n!
  </para>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, kidalna nga natu in nang kong zuan zo hi; lelna hong thuaksak ngei heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in thutang na hikom hong hu ta'n a, hong suatak ta'n. Kong ngetna hong ngai ta'n a, hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei atu in a muanhuai belna mun le kei hong dal tu a kho kulhpi hong hi ta'n; nangma in ka bukna le ka kihuukna na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Pathian awng, mihing tatsiate kung pan le, mihing ngilote le a khansiate thahatna panin kei hong suatak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa Topa awng, ka lametna sia nang sungah kong koi hi; ka khanmoi hun lai pan kipanin nangma kong muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khan tawntung nangma kong suang zo hi; ka pian ni pan kipan nangma in nong hung nong dal tawntung zo hi. A tawntungin nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nuntakzia sia mihing tam mama ii ettee ahi hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in a thahat hong hungpa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nitangtum in nang kong pok a, na minthanna ka thangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tu in ka khanhaam ciangin kei hong nial heak in a; ka thatual ciangin kei hong nusia heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ngalte in kei hong thatlum nuam a; amate in kikumin kei hong thasawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in, “Pathian in ama nusia zo hi; a nung pan zui in ama man tawng; ama a hun tu kuama om ngawl hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian awng, tuaza a khuala na ah om heak in ka Pathian awng; kei hong hu tu in hong manlang ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei hong simte in lelna le lalcipna thuak tahen. Kei hong liamsua nuamte in maizumna le minsiatna thuak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka lametna nang sungah kong koi tawntung tu a; nang sia kong pok thawthua lai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na phatnate ka son tu a; tua thu sia kei ii tel zawk zongh hi ngawl hi nave, nitangtumin, na ngupna thu ka son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na vaangletna ka pok tu hi, Vaanglianpipa Topa awng; nangma bek ii nei, na phatnate ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka khanmoi hun lai pan kipan nangma in nong hil zo a, tu dong ma in a lamdang na septe ka son lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in ka huai zo a ka puak zongh kaang zo hi. Kei hong nusia heak in, Pathian awng! hong pai pheang tu khang kikte tungah na vaangletna le na thahatna ka thansak laitakin keima taw hong omkhawm ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian awng, thutang na hina in van ban hi. Nangma in na liante na seam zo a; nang taw a kibang kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngimna le thuaknate kei tungah nong tungsak zo hi, ahihang nangma in ka tha ka ngal nong dim kik tu a; thaankuul panin nong keam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nong liansak seseam tu a; nong heeneam kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tengtongh tumna taw nang kong pok tatak tu hi. Na thu maanna kong pok tu hi, ka Pathian awng. Israel te ii a Thiangtho Pa awng, ka tengtongh tumin pokna la kong sak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tumtheite nang tungah kong tum ciangin lungdamna taw ka au tu hi; ka thin ka tak theampo taw la ka sa tu hi banghang ziam cile nangma in nong hun zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nitangtum in thutang na hina ka son tu hi, banghang ziam cile kei hong vawtsia nuamte kizo thal zo a, kimaizumsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, na thutang taw thu a khen natu in kumpipa thuhil in; nangma ii a kikhaikim thukhenna sia ama hawm in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua hile ama in na mite thutang taw uk tu a, a kizothawte thumaanna taw uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngam le lei in khantona nga tahen a, thutanna he tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in mizawngte tungah thutang in thukhen tahen a; a cimawte hu tahen a, Amate a zothawte zothal tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hong pai tu khang hunte sungah ni a taan laiteng, tha ii khuavak a piak laiteng na mite in nang hong bia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa sia lo sungah nguazu bang, leitang tungah nguatui buak bang hi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama khan sungah thutanna khangto tahen a, khantona sia tha in khuavak a piak lai theampo in om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama ukna kumpi ngam sia tuipi khat pan tuipi khat dong kithung tu a, Euphrates ngun pan leimong dong hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sennealngammite in ama mai ah a kun tu uh hi; a ngalte lei ah a bok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Spain le tuikulhte kumpipate in ama letsong pia tu uh hi; Arabia le Ethiopia kumpipate in ama tel pia tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kumpipa a kici theampo in ama mai ah kun tu uh a; minam theampo in ama atu sepsak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama a ko mizawngte theampo le a cimaw a kingaingonte theampo sia ama in suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in mizawngte le a thazawmte mulkim a, a kitaangsamh te ii nuntakna a hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in amate sia kizawthawkna le ngoltolna panin suatak hi; amate nuntak sia ama atu in man nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa a khansau tahen! Ama sia Arabia pan khamhte kipia tahen; ama atu in thungetna a tawntung kivawt tahen; Pathian thupha ama tungah om tawntung tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngam sungah antang tam mama om tahen; mualte sia lo ante taw kituam tahen, tua lo ante sia Lebanon ah ankungte bangin tak nei in nga thiam tahen. Ngampa sung lopate taw kidim bang keakin khuapite sia mite taw kidim tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpipa min kimangil ngei heak hen a; ni a taan laiteng ama minthang tahen. Kumpipa tungah ama in thupha a piak bangin minam tuatuamte in Pathian tungah thupha ngen tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian, Topa pok vun! Ama bekma in hi nalamdangte vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama min tuanngen sia a tawntungin pok vun! Ama ii minthanna in leitung bup ah dim tahen. Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hisia in Jesse ii tapa David ii thungetna a tawpna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in thinsung thiangtho a nei Israel te atu in pha tatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahihang ka thinmuanna ka thasua dedek a; ka upna bo dektak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />banghang ziam cile keima in mihing seksolte atu in na theampo a dik veu in a pian ka mu ciangin a kiphasakte ka eang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in natna thuak ngawl a; thahat in a ciidam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midangte bangin amate in thuak ngawl uh a; ngualdangte ngim nga bangin amate ngim nga ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate in kiphatsakna sia khi bangin aw a, ngoltolna sia puantual bangin sil uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />amate thinsung in ngitlona pusua in, a thinsung uh sia seksol tupnate taw komla uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in midangte nuisan zazaan in kamsia veu pau uh a; kiphasak in ngualdangte zawthawk sawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in vantung ah a om Pathian sonsia in leitung ah mihingte sia kiletsakna taw thupia uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tuabangin Pathian ii mihingte ngawngawn in amate sangah kiheak in tuaciang amate son theampo a um papaih uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in: “Pathian in he buan te; A saangbel Pa in phawk buan te” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in tuabang ahi uh hi. Amate hau a, nga thawthua lai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahile a thiangtho in kikeam a, mawna ka vawt ngawl sia a luithawthong ahi tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian awng, nangma in nitangtumin nong thuaksak a; zing simin daan nong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuabangin kampau ka hi le, na mite khat ii ngamtat tu bangin a kilawm in ngamta ngawl ka hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hi thu haksa sia ngaisun tu in ka hanciam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ahihang na Biakinn sung ka tum mateng in, kei atu haksa lei hi. Tua zawkciang mihing seksolte tungah bang piang tu ci in ka tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma in amate sia a naalna munah na koi tu a, siatcipna sungah na liiksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate thakhat thu in kisusia in, a kiitakhuai sungah bocip uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate sia zingsang a, a bo vangeu zanmang bang ahi hi; nangma nong thaw tak ciang, Topa awng, amate mang vadi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ngaisutna a siat ciang le ka thin a nat ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kei sia nganhingte bangin ka mawmaw hi; nang kong tel bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang nang kungah a nai in kong om tawntung a, nangma in ka khut panin nong len hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nong hilnate taw lam nong lak a, a tawpna ah nangma in upat minphatna taw nong saang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vantung ah nang simngawl bangdang ka nei ziam? Nang kong nei zawk nungsang leitung ah bangdang ka dei lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka khua ngaisutna le ka pumpi thazawm tu hi. Ahihang Pathian sia ka thahatna hi; a tawntungin ka kisap sia ama bekma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang hong taisante lalcip nanak tu a; nang tungah hong thumaan ngawlte na susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahihang kei ka hile, Pathian nai ah ka om tu, Topa Pathian ka belh tu le ama ii vawt sate theampo ka thansak tu sia bangza in pha ziam!
  </para>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Banghangin hi bangin kote hong nusia ni ziam, Pathian awng? Nangma mite tungah a tawntungin na thin uuksak tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khuangei lai pek a, nangma mama atu na tealsa mihingte phawk in, saltanna sung pan nangma minam tu a, na tat sate phawk in. Khatvei lai a, na teenna mun Zion Mual sia phawk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi a laltham sate munah pai in; ih ngalte in Biakinn sungah na theampo lalsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na ngalte in na Biakinn sungah zawna mualsuana taw au zo uh hi; amate in tua munah zawna lim in laandial khai zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in hei taw thing a phuk, thingphukte taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a kizeam thingpheak theampo a hei le a sekpuite taw saattham uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in nangma ii Biakinn lalsakin mei taw hal uh hi; amate in nang hong kibiakna mun ninsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in eite hong sucip nuam hi; ngamsung a thiangthona mun theampo haltum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koma ii tepteena lim thiangtho theampo bo siat zo hi; kamsaangte kuama taang nawn ngawl a, hisia bang tanvei khuangei tu ziam ci in kuama in he ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian awng, bang tanvei, ih ngalte in nang hong nuisan tu ziam? Na min a tawntungin hong selno tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Banghangin kote nong hu tu sia nial ni ziam? banghangin na khutte na nungsangah seal ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian awng, nang sia a kipat panin koma kumpipa na hi hi; nangma in kote tamvei ma nong hun zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thahatna lian taw tuipi na khen a, tuipi sung nganhing lianpuite lutang na sutham hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leviathan nganhing lianpui ii lutang na sutham a, a luang sia sennealngam sungah, nganhingte vaakna in na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ciktui le tuisamhte na luangsak a, ngun liante na kangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in sun le zan na bitphua a, ni le tha a omna tek ah na koi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />nangma in leitung ii mong na omsak hi; khuakhaal le phalbi hun na vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, na ngalte ii nang hong nuisat uh sia ciamtee in, pathian sel amate in nang hong zawngsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A cimaw na mite a ngilo a ngalte khut sungah nusia heak in; a kivawtsia, na mite mangil heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kote taw na vawt thuciamna sia ciamtee in. Ngam kingsong a zingna mun theampo ah zawthawk buaina om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kinengcip mihingte maizumsak heak in; tua mizawng le mi cimawte in hong pok tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian awng, nangma thu in hong kithawn ta'n a, na thu khosak in! Sunkhuateak in pathian sel mihingte in nang hong nuisan zazan ahi hunlam ciamtee in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na ngalte ii thin uuk auna le nang hong langpante ii a tawntung ngamlumna na mangil heak in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, lungdam kong ko uh a, nang tungah lungdam hong ko hi ung! Nang bangza lian ci ka thangsak uh a, na vawtsa a lamdang nate ka son uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in “Thukhen natu hun khat ka ciangtan zo a, thu maanna taw thu ka khen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bitphua sa a nungta theampo liingin leitung mama a ngawk zongin a tawdapte a kho in ka koi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A seksolte a kisakthei ngawl natu ka son hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a kisuantaakna uh a kheal natu ka son hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thukhenna sia nisuana le nitumna pan ahizong saksang pan le thangsang pan ahizong hong pai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thukhenpa sia Pathian hi; ama in pawlkhat sia mawsak a, pawlkhat sia suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in a khut sungah hai khat toai in, a thin uukna zu ciik taw kidim hi. Ama in tua zu bungh keak in a seksol theampo in ne uh hi; a mal bo dongin amate in ne siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang kei ka hile Jacob ii Pathian thu ka son tu le ama pokna la ka sak tu tawp ngeingawl tu khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in mihing seksolte thahatna suktansak tu a, ahihang thutangte thahatna sia kikhanto tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian sia Judah ngam sungah kihe hi; ama min sia Israel ngam sungah ki upat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem ah ama ii inn om hi; Zion Mual tungah teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua munah ama in ngalte ii ngalhiam theampo ahi a thaltangte, a lumte le a namsaute sutham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian awng, na minthang lawlawm hi! Na ngalte na zawna mual pan nong heak kik ciang, na vaanglian lawlawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ngalkap hangte sia a neisa theampo uh kiluak siatin amate in tu in a thite mutna ah a mut laitak hi a, amate hatna le thiamna theampo sia kimanna a nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jacob ii Pathian awng, nangma in amate na tawn ciang siphute le a tung tote pukin thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nang sia a kuama theampo in hong kiita hi. Na thin uuk ciang na mai ah kuama ding zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantung panin na thukhenna na kitelsak hi; leitung ah a kinengcip theampo hut natu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />thukhen tu in nong dinto tak ciang, leitung sia lau in thim khipkhep hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihingte thin uukna in nang atu in pokna tam vaial a pian natu hi bek hi; ngal kidona pan a taang laite in nangma ii poai khaam tan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama piak tu in na kamciamte Topa na Pathian ii tungah pia vun; no a nai ah a om minamte theampo awng ama atu letsongte puak vun. Pathian in ama kiita tu in mihingte a vawt hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in a kiphasak kumpipa tapate kiniamkhiaksak in, kumpi liante sia lausak vadil hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian tungah nging takin ka au hi; nging takin ka au ciang ama in hong za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngimna hun sung Topa tungah thu ka ngen hi; zankhuateakin thungen in ka khut ka laamto hi, ahihang heenepna ka mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ka ngaisut ciangin ka vuisa hi; khua ka ngai susut ciang ka thinkiam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in zankhuateak khangciim in hong koi hi; ka thinngim mama ahikom ka pau zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A bosa nite ka ngaisun a, taanghlai kumte ka phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zan hunte khua ngaisusutna in ka zangh hi; ka ngaisusun a, hi bangin keima le keima ka kidongh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Topa in hong nial top tu ziam? Ama in eite dik hong sa ngei nawn ngawl tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in eite hong it nawn ngawl ziam? A kamciamte kip nawn ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian in hesuakna a nei tu mangil zo ziam? A thin uukna taw khuangai huai a sak theina theak zo ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaciangin, “Na ka sakbel in hi thu ahi hi — Pathian sia a vaang lian nawn ngawl ci thu hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa awng, na nasepna liante ka phawk tu hi; hun bosa sungah a lamdang na sepnate ka phawk kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na sepsa theampo ka ngaisun tu hi; a nasia mama na sepna theampo ka ngaisusun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian awng, na sep na vawt theampo thiangtho hi. Nang za in a lian pathian om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma in nalamdang a vawt Pathian na hi hi; na thahatna sia minam tuatuamte tungah na lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jacob le Joseph suan na mite, na vaangletna taw na hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian awng, tuite in nangma hong mu ciang lau uh a, tuipi tawtawngte liing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Meeikaaite in nguatui buak suk hi; van panin vanto ngingkeak a, khualengte mun theampo ah taangkeak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na vanto sia a kipee in ngingkeak a, khualeng in leitung taangsak hi; leitung liingin ngawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui kihualte tungah na vak hi; tuipi thuk, na kaantan hangin, na khuanite a kimu thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma in Moses le Aaron ii a uk, na mite sia tuucingpa bangin lam na pui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mite awng, kong hilna hong ngai tavun a, ka pauna hong nadon tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ciim kamtepteete kong zangh tu a, hun bosa sung a, a telhak thute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ih taanghpupite hong son, ih zaaksa ih heaksa te, kong sonthiang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi thute ih tate tungah ih iim buatu hi. Topa ii a vaangletna, a sepna liante le a vawtsa a lamdang nate sia khang kikte tungah ih son tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Israel mite tungah thukhamte pia a, Jacob suan le paalte tungah thupiakte pia hi. Amate ii tate tungah ama ii thukhamte hil tu in ama in ih taanghpupite sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hile khangkikte in tua thute he thei tu a, amate in a tate tungah sonsawn nanak tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi bangin amate in zongh Pathian muang a, ama ii sepna sate mangil ngawlin, ama thupiakte ni tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in a langpante le thu ni ngawl, Pathian a upna uh a kho ngawl, ama tungah a thumaan top ngawl a taanghpupite bang ahi buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim mite in thal le thaltang taw kithoai napi ngal kido ni in taikeak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in Pathian taw a thuciamna a len bua uh hi; ama thukham a zui bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama sep sate le, nalamdang lakna a vawt a mu uhte amate in a mangil zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A taanghpupite ii mu tangin Egypt ngam Zoan zaangleitam ah Pathian in nalamdang laknate vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tuipi kikhensakin amate kaantansak hi; tuite sia pang bangin dingtosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in sun in meeikaai taw, zankhuateakin meikuang taang taw amate lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in senneal ngamsung suangpite khentham in lei thukna pan a piang tui sia amate pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in suangpi sung pan lui khat piangsak a, ngun bangin tui luangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang amate in Pathian tungah khialna vawvawt lai uh a, sennealngam sungah amate in Saangbel Pa a langpan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A duci ante ngetna taw Pathian ze et hamtang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Pathian langpanin: “Pathian in sennealngam sungah an pia thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in suangpi saat in tui luangsak vahawn peu hi; ahihang ama in eite anluum zongh hong pia thei tu ziam? tuaciang ama ii mite sa pia thei tu ziam?” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom tuabangin amate pauna a zaak ciang Pathian a thin uuk hi; ama in a mite meikuang taw sim a, amate tungah a thin uukna sia khang seseam hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />banghang ziam cile amate in ama sungah upna nei ngawl a, amate hun tu in um ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahihang ama in a tung a om van paupui a, a kongkhate a kihon natu thupia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in vantung panin amate antang pia a, amate neak tu in manna khiaksuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tuabangin amate in vantunglalangte ii an ne uh a, Pathian in a du zaza pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in nisuana sang vui vasak si a, ama ii vaangletna taw thangsang vui hamsak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuaciang a mite atu vacimte puaksuk a, vaalbo ah a om senneal za in tam hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ngiaphual saatna laizang a buk kiimkot theampo ah tua vacimte taak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahiciang mite an ne in a lungkim uh hi; Pathian in amate a duci teng pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang amate duna sia thai ngawl a, a neneak laitak ma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian sia amate tungah thin uuk a, amate sung pan a hatbel pasalte le Israel khangno sung pan a phabel teng thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hi zata hi napi mihingte in mawna vawt lalai uh hi; Ama nalamdang laknate om napi amate in ama a muang bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate ii ni sia husan khat bangin ama in bosak a, a nuntakna sia thakhat thu in lalna taw bosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate sung pan pawlkhat a thalup sim, a om lai teng in ama ii kung zuan a, kisiikin thin tak taw thungen uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in Pathian sia amate a hungpa hi a, amate hu tu in Vaanglianbelpa hong pai ahi hunlam phawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahihang a pauna uhte leilot thu vive hi a, bangma ci takpi thu a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama tungah amate in thumaan ngawl hi; ama taw a thuciamna tungah amate thumaan ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in ama mite hesuak hi. Amate mawna maisak a, a susia bua hi. Ama in tamvei mama a thin uukna iip in a thinsona vei kenkon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate sia a thi theite ahi lel hunlam, vuiva a, a bo kik paih bang ahi hunlam ama in phawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sennealngam sungah amate in ama bang tanvei langpan in, bang tanvei ama heesak ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in Pathian ze et kikik uh a, Israel ii a thiangtho Pathian tungah thin natna piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in ama ii vaangletna lian le a ngalte khut sung pan a suataksak ni mangil uh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Egypt ngam Zoan zaangleitam ah ama ii a nasia mama sepnate le nalamdang a laknate amate in mangil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama in ngunte chisan suaksak a, Egypt mite in tui neak tu a nei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in tua mihingte sungah ngim pia tu in thote puak a, a leitangte lalsak tu in ulolte paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ama in amate lo an a ne tu le a lote a lalsak tu in khaumawte puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama in amate ii sapitkungte ngial taw, a thei kungte vuuk taw thisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama in a ngante ngial taw, a tuu a keal honte keaktang taw in thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Thina vantung mite bangin hong pai ama ii thin uukna le thinsona a buaksukna taw ama in nasia takin amate thinngimna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama in a thin uukna iip ngawlin amate nuntakna uh khoaikhetsak ngawlin, pul natna taw amate thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama in Egypt ngammite innkuan theampo sung pan a tapaciil teng thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tuaciangin ama in tuucingpa bangin a mite lampui in pusuapui a, sennealngam kaantan pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ama in amate ngammuang takin lampui a, amate a lau bua uh hi; ahihang tuipi in a ngalte khulum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ama in a zaw sa mualte tung, a thiangthona leitang ah amate paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A mite a mainaw uh ciang tua ngamah a teang mite ama in notkeak hi; tua leitang sia Israel minamte hawmsakin amate ii innte sia a mite pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Ahihang amate in Vaanglianbelpa Pathian langpan in, a zia en uh hi. Amate in a thupiakte a zui bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />ahihang amate sia a taanghpupite bangma in, langpan nopna thin le thumaan nop ngawlna thin nei uh a, thaltang koai khat bangma in muanhuai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Amate in Pathian he ngawlte biakna munte taw ama thin uuksak uh a, amate ii milimte taw ama thinsosak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Pathian in tuate a mu ciang a thin uuk ahikom, ama mite a nial thiang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ama in eite taw hong teenkhopna sa a inn ahi Shiloh a om ama buk sia nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Ama in ama ii vaangletna le minthanna lim ahi Thuciamna Thingkuang sia eima ngalte in mansak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Ama ii mite tungah ama thin uuk ahikom a ngalte in ama ii mite thatsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tangvalte sia ngal sungah kithatlum a, ngaknute ii a teenpui tu kuama a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Thiampite ngual ii khutsa taw in thi a, amate ii zi meingongte sia a kaa tu zongh ki oai ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />A khakbel ciangin Topa sia a mutho bangin hong thoto hi; ama in sapittui ii a thot pasal thahat pa bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ama in a ngalte sia a kikhomsuan tu maizumhuai lelna sungah not kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Ahihang ama in Joseph suante a nial hi; ama in Ephraim minamte a tealtuam bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Tuate taangin ama in Judah minam le a it mama Zion Mual teal zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Ama in vantung a om a inn taw a kibang Biakinn sia tua munah sa hi; A tawntung a kho tu in tuasia leitung taw ma kibangin ama in kipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Ama in a naseampa David teal hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Ama in David sia ngantatna munte ah tuuhon a cinna pan la a, Pathian mihingte ii tuucingpa ahi Israel te ii kumpipa suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />David in ama ii kaang sung tu bek ngaisun ngawlin kipiakna taw amate khoi a, thiamna taw lampui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, Pathian he ngawlte in na ngam hong sim zo hi. Amate in a thiangtho na Biakinn sia ninsak uh a, Jerusalem sia a zaancip in nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in na mite luang vaciikte neak tu le na naseamte luang ngamsate neak tu in nusia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in na mite chisan sia tui bangin keesak hi; Jerusalem khuathing ah chisan sia tui bangin luang a, a thite a phum tu kuama taang nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kiimkot minamte in kote hong selno zazaan hi; amate in kote hong selno zazaan a hong nunau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, kote tungah a tawntungin na thin hong uuk tu ni ziam? Na thin uukna sia mei bangin kuang tan tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang hong bia ngawl minamte le nang tungah thu hong ngen ngawlte tungah thin uuk ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate in na mite thatlum zo hi; na ngam zaancipsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite mawna hu in kote daan hong pia heak in. Lametna theampo ka bosua siat zo uh a, tu in kote hong hesuak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian awng, kote hong hu ta'n a hong hun ta'n; nangma mama na ki upat natu in, kote hong suatak ta'n a, ka mawnate uh hong maisak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghangin minamte in “Na Pathian uh koi sungah om ziam?” ci in hong dongh tu ziam? Na naseamte chisan a buaksak hu in tua minamte tungah daan na piak sia kote in hong musak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thongtaakte ii a taunate ngai ta'n a, na vaangletna lianpi taw a thi tu in a kikoisate suatakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, minam dangte ii nang hong selnona hu in amate tungah a see sali in thuk kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuasia ciang na nganhon sungah tuute ahi ko na mite in a tawntungin lungdam kong ko tu uh a, hong pai lai tu hun theampo sungah nang kong pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te ii Tuucing pa awng, hong ngai ta'n; Na tuu hon lampuipa awng, hong za ta'n. Cherub te ii tung sang, na kumpi tokhum tungah a to pa awng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ephraim, Benjamin le Manasseh minamte tungah nangma le nangma hong kilaak ta'n. Na thahatna kote hong lak ta'n; hong pai ta'n a, hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hong ciapui kik ta'n, Pathian awng! Na hesuakna hong lak ta'n, tua hile ka suakta tu uh hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa Vaanglianbelpa Pathian awng, bang tanvei dong na mihingte thungetna tungah hong thin uuk tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Heena sia neak tu in kote nong pia zo a, dawn tu in thitui haipui khat nong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kote ii kiimkot ah ngamte kote ii leitang kituu in na kisimsak hi; ka ngalte in kote hong selno zazaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hong puuapha kik ta'n, Vaanglianbelpa Pathian awng! Na hesuakna hong lak ta'n, tua hile ka suakta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma in sapitkung khat Egypt panin na la a, minam dangte hawlkeak in amate leitang tungah tuasia na suan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in tuasia a khan natu in mun khat na thiangsak hi; zung thuk thasuk a ngam bup huamin zaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A limh taw mualte siin hi; a baakte in Cedar thingkung liante deap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A baakte sia Mediterranean Tuipi dongin beak a, Euphrates ngun dong zaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghangin a kiimkot uumna dalte talthamsak ni ziam? Tu in tua mun a kaantan pawpo in sapitngate ngu thei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ngalhte in siikcil a, ngamsate in an in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Pathian awng, ko sang hong nga ta'n! Vantung panin hong ensuk ta'n; hong pai ta'n a, na mite hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hong pai ta'n a, hi na suan sa sapitkung le a limcii tu na suan sapitkung moi sia hong hung ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ih ngalte in tua sapitkung sia mei taw halin saattan zo hi; amate sia thin uukna taw ngau in a, lalsak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thahat mama in na vawt minam, na tealsa mite dalin keamcing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang kung panin ka tai kik ngei buatu uh hi; kote hong nungtasak ta'n, tua hile nang kong pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hong puuapha kik ta'n, Topa Pathian Vaanglianbelpa awng. Na hesuakna hong lak ta'n, tuasia ciang ka suakta tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ei hong hungpa Pathian tungah lungdam in au vun; Jacob ii Pathian tungah pokna lasa vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Music tum kipan vun a, daalkual khuangnote tum vun; tengtonghte le liamlote taw aw hoite ngingsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thadet ciang le thalik ciangin poaikhaam natu in lemle tum vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hisia in Israel ngamsung thukham hi a, Jacob' Pathian ii thupiak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Egypt ngam a sim ciangin Israel mite tungah tua thukham a piak ahi hi. Heak ngeingawl aw khat in hi bangin a ci ka za hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Note nungzaang panin na vanhngit uh kong laakkeaksak hi; na puak uh uksuangte kong khiaksuksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngim na nga laitakin nong sam uh a, kong hun hi. Ka bukna vuipi sung panin kong zo a, Meribah cikte ah note kong ze et hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite awng, kidop natu kong sonte ngai vun; Israel awng, ka thu nong ngai tu uh ka thangai mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in pathian dang peuma na bia ngei buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in Egypt ngam pan note hong pusua pui Topa na Pathian ka hi hi. Na kam uh kaa vun, an kong vaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Ahihang ka mite in ka thu hong ngai nuam ngawl a, Israel te in ka thu hong ni ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate sia a thinpuina uh taw kizui in a uuk bang po ka paisak a, a vawt nop po ka vawtsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite in ka pau hong ngai hen a, ka thu hong ni le ka oai mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ngalte manlang takin ka zawsak tu a, a ngal a sa theampo ka zawthalsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei hong ensante in kiitakna taw ka mai ah hong kun tu uh hi; amate ii thuak daan sia a tawntungin kikhomsuan tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahihang note sia a limbel zungtaang taw kong vaak tu a, ngam khuaitui taw kong lungkimsak tu hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in vantung council kikhopna ah hun uk hi; tua pathiante kikhopna sungah ama in thukhensat hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“A maan ngawl thukhennate kheal vun; mihing seksolte ngum nawn heak vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A zawngte le tangate panpui tavun; kitaangsapna a neite le a cimawte tungah a kilawm in en vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate mihing seksolte khut sung panin suatak tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Note in bangza in tel ngawl nu ziam! Bangza in nangh nu ziam! Note na ngamta khial siat zo uh a, leitung ah thumaan ngamtatna bo zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Note in pathiante na hi uh hi’ kong ci hi; ‘note theampo sia a Saangbel Pa ii tate, na hi uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang mihingte bangma in na thi tu uh hi; na nuntakna uh sia kumpipa tate khat pawpo ii nuntakna bangin bo tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hong pai ta'n, Pathian awng, leitung hong uk ta'n; ngam theampo sia nangma neisa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, thim om heak in; huthe ngawlin om heak in, dai takin om heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En in! Na ngalte in hong langpan a, nang hong ensante in hong langpan nginge uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in na mite langkhat panin thu ngealku uh a, nangma ii na panpui mite thasawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in, “Hong pai tavun, amate ngam sutham tawng, tua hile Israel te sia a tawntungin kimangil tu hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in a ngealna tungah lungkim tek a, nang hong langpan tu kipawlna khat vawt uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuate sia Edom le Ishmael te; Moab le Hagri te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gebal, Ammon le Amalek mite, Philistia le Tyre mite ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lot ii suan Ammon le Moab ii pawlpui a thahat Assyria te zongh amate sangah pang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midian mite le Kishon Ngun a om Sisera le Jabin tungah na vawt bangin amate tungah vawt in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Endor ah nangma in amate na zothal a, amate luang lei ah a muat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pathian neisa leitang theampo eima atu in la tawng” a ci Oreb le Zeeb tungah na vawt bangin amate lampuite tungah vawt in; Zebah le Zalmunna te na zaw thal bangma in amate a ukte theampo zo thal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian awng, amate sia leivui bangin thezau in a, vui ii seamkeak taangphawte bang hisak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Duithuk mei ii a kak bang, mualte a kaanghsak meikuang bangin
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />na vuipi suangval taw amate del in a, a kiitakhuai na vuipi taw amate lausak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate maitang sia maizumna taw na tuam in, Topa awng, amate in na vaangletna telsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate lelna thuakin a tawntungin lau ngawp tahen a, maimawlna sungah amate thi tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma bekma in Topa na hi hunlam, leitung bup a lianbel ukpa na hi hunlam amate in he tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa awng, na Biakinn bangza in thangai khi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua munah bangza in om nuam khi ziam! Topa Biakinn sungah om tu ka thangai hi. Ka nuntakna buppi taw a nungta Pathian tungah lungdam in la ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tonbawmte ngawngawn in bu vawt a, pialpiate in amate buk tek nei hi; amate in na biaknatau taw a kinaina ah a note keam uh hi, Vaanglianbelpa Topa ka kumpipa le ka Pathian awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na Biakinn sungah teang a, a tawntung nang tungah pokna la a sate in mi lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma kung pan thahatna a ngate le a thiangtho Zion Mual ah Pathian biak tu a lawpte in bangza in lungdam ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in Baca kongaw mualkuam a kaantan uh ciangin tua mun sia ciktui phulna mun hong suak hi; tangngam ngua in tuicin theina munte dimsak siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a papai uh ciang, hat vaial a, amate in pathiante ii Pathian sia Zion mual tungah a mu tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Vaanglianbelpa Pathian awng, ka thungetna hong za ta'n. Hong ngai ta'n, Jacob ii Pathian awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian awng, na tealsa kumpipa kote kumpipa thupha hong piaksak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na Biakinn sungah ni khat hun zakna sia leidang mun khat pawpo ah kum tulkhat zak sangin phazaw hi; Mihing seksolte inn sungah ka teen sangin ka Pathian inn kongkha ah ka ding nuamzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in ei hong sungsia pa le a minthang kumpipa hi a, ama in cikna le minphatna taw eite thupha hong pia hi. A maan a seamte tungah ama in naphate khat zongh a haza bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa awng, nang hong muangte in bangza in a lungdam uh ziam!
  </para>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, na leitang na hesuak zo hi; nangma in Israel te na nuamsasak kik zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in na mite ii mawnate na maisak zo a, amate ii tatkhialna theampo na pengsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate tungah na thin uukna teng na thaisak zo a, na thin uuk thangsiatna zongh na vei kenkon kik zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hong puuapha kik ta'n, Pathian kote ngumpa awng, kote dik nong sak ngawlna thaisak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ko tungah a tawntungin nong thin uuk tu ziam? Na thin uukna thai ngei nawn ngawl tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kote hong thahatsak kik ta'n; tua hile ko na mite in nangma kong pok kik tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng, nong itna kip hong lak ta'n, tuaciang nangma ii ngupna le huna kote hong pia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Pathian paunate ka ngai nginge hi; ih mawmawtziate zui kik bua po leang ama in ei a mite tungah kilemna hong kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama a upatte hun tu in ama kinging takpi a, ama hong ompuina taw hong huutna in ih ngam ih lei ah kho top tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Itna le thumaanna kisitua tu hi; thutang le kilemna kingawngkoai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihingte thumaanna in lei panin van banto tu a, tuaciang Pathian thutang in vantung panin ensuk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in eite hong nuamsasak tu a, ih leitang in anlaak tu tam mama piangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thutang suana sia Topa mai ah pai tu a, ama atu lampi sial khol tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, hong ngai ta'n a, hong zo ta'n, banghang ziam cile kei sia cimaw in thazawm khi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei sia na tungah hong thumaan ka hikom thina pan hong hun ta'n; kei sia na naseampa hi a nang hong muang ka hi ciang, hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in ka Pathian na hikom, kei hong hesuak ta'n; sunkhuateak nang tungah thu kong ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, na naseampa hong lungdamsak ta'n, banghang ziam cile ka thungetnate nang kungah hong paito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ko tungah nangma na pha a, nong maisak hi, nang tungah thu hong ngente theampo atu in itna kip taw na kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng, ka thungetna hong ngai ta'n; hu ngen a kong auna hong za ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngimna hunte sungah nang kong ko hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in ka thungetnate nong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, nang taw a kibang pathian om ngawl hi, nang sep bang a seam kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na bitphua sa minam theampo hong pai in na mai ah kun tu hi; amate in na letna hong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma in thahat in a lamdang nate na vawt hi; nangma bek Pathian na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Seam a nong oaite hong hil ta'n, Topa awng, thumaan takin na thu kong ni tu hi; a kicing kipiakna taw, na na ka sep natu hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, ka thin theampo taw nang kong pok tu hi; Na letna sia a tawntungin ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nong itna kip sia kei atu bangza in lian ziam! thaankuul pan mama in nangma in kei nong hun zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian awng, mihing kiphasakte in kei hong langpan tu in hong pai hi; mihing tatkha hon pawlkhat kei thatlum tu in hong hanciam hi — nang hong thusim ngawl mihingte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nang sia, a hesuak thei le a it thei Pathian na hi a, a thin uai tawntung, a dik tawntung le a thumaan tawntung na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei sang hong nga ta'n a kei hong hesuak ta'n; hong thakhosak ta'n a hong hun ta'n, banghang ziam cile ka nu ii sep bangma in na na ka seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na phatna a kitelna hong lak ta'n, Topa awng; kei hong ensante in heenepna le huna nong piak a mu uh ciangin a maizum tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mual thiangtho tungah Topa in ama ii khuapi saat hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in Israel ngam sung mun dang theampo sangin Jerusalem khuapi it zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian khuapi awng, nang huvau a lamdang ama ii sonte ngai in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kei thu hong ni minam tuatuamte tepteena lai ka vawt ciangin Egypt le Babylon ka hel tu hi; Philistia, Tyre le Ethiopia te sia Jerusalem ah a teangte tepteena lai sungah ka khum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion taw kisai in, hi minam theampo sia ama ii neisa hi a, Vaanglianbelpa in ama sia a tha khosak tu hi, kici tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in mihing phaza tepteena lai vawt tu a, tua mite theampo sia Jerusalem khua mite suaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate laam in lasa uh a, “Thupha ka saan uh theampo ii naak sia Zion ah om hi” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa Pathian ka ngumpa awng, nitangtumin au a hu kong ngen hi, tuaciangin zanin na mai ah kong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thungetna hong ngai ta'n; hu ngen a kong auna hong ngai ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngimna tam mama kei tungah hong tung zo a, ka thi dektak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thi tu in a om midangte theampo bangma ka hi hi; ka thahatna theampo bo siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mithite sungah kei hong kinusia hi; thalup thuak a, thaankuul sungah a lumte, nangma ii na makngil biing, na hu nawn ngawlte taw ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma in kei sia thaankhuk thukte sung, a zingbel le a thukbel dum sungah nong lawn suk zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thin uukna kei atu ngit mama a, tua ii tuihual in keima hong delpeak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ngualtamhte in kei hong taisansak zo ni hi; amate atu in kei sia a kiihuai nong suaksak zo hi. Kei sia hong kikhabil a, ka suakta thei bua hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ka thuakna hangin ka mitte thazawm hi. Topa awng, ni simin nang kong biakpui a, ka khutte laamto in nang tungah thu kong ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mithi sate atu nalamdang laknate vawt kana ni ziam? Amate hong tho in nang hong pok kana ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thaankuul sungah na itna kip kison kana ziam? tua ahibuale siatna omna munah nang ii thumaanna om kana ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua khuazingna munah nang ii nalamdang laknate kimu ziam, tua ahibuale a kimangil cip sate ii ngam sungah nang ii phatnate kimu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa awng, nang tungah hu ngenin kong biakpui hi; zing simin nang tungah thu kong ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa awng, banghangin kei hong nial ni ziam? Banghangin kei hong nungngat ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka khanmoi lai pan ma in ka thuak a, thina taw ka kinai ngei hi; Daan nong piakna vanhngit hu in kei ka tul zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nasia mama na thin uukna in kei hong delpeak hi; a kiitakhuai nong donate in kei hong lalsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuate in keima sia namthuam bangin sunkhuateakin hong kiim um hi; mun theampo panin kei hong neak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka ngualtamh phabelte ngawngawn in nong nusaisak zo a, khuazing bekma sia kei kitholpui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nong itna kip sia la in ka sa tawntung tu hi; na thumaanna a tawntungin ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na itna in a tawntung atu in kikhomsuan tu ci in ka he a, na thumaanna in van bangin kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in, “Ka teal mihing pa taw thuciamna khat ka vawt zo hi; ka naseampa David tungah kamciam ka pia zo a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Nangma ii suan khat sia kumpi in maang tawntung tu hi; na kumpi khangngui sia a tawntungin kong kepsak tu hi,’ ka ci hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Vantungte in a lamdang na vawtte la in hong sak hi; Topa awng amate in na thumaanna la in sa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa awng vantung ah nang taw a kibang kuama om ngawl hi; vantung mi a minpiang nang taw a kibang kuama om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi thiangthote council kikhopna ah nang hong kikiita hi; amate theampo in nang hong thasia in ding uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa Pathian awng, nang za in kuama thahat ngawl hi; Topa awng na theampo ah nang na thumaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thahat tuipi na uk hi; tuasia ii a thin uuk tuihualte na thimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nganhingpui Rahab sia na sucip a, na thatlum hi; Na thahatna lianpi taw na ngalte na zothal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vantung in nangma aa hi a leitung zongh nangma neisa ma ahi hi; simlei le a sung a om theampo nangma vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Saksang le thangsang na bitphua hi; Tabor Mual le Hermon Mualte in lungdam in nangma la hong sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangza in na vaanglian ziam! Bangza in na thahatna lian ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na kumpi ngam sia thumaan le thutang tungah kidoppha hi; itna le thumaanna sia na sep na vawt theampo ii sungah kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lasakna taw nangma hong biate le na dikna khuavak sungah a teangte sia mi lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma hangin amate sia sunkhua in lawpna nei uh a, amate in na phatna hu in nang hong pok uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangma in zawna lianpite nong pia hi; na itna sungah zawna nong mualsuasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in kote hong dalpa nong tealsak hi; Israel ii a Thiangtho Pathian awng, nangma in ko atu kumpipa nong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thumaan na naseamte tungah taanghlai in mukholna khat na piak sungah, “Ngalkap minthang khat huna ka pia zo hi; mihingte sung pan ka tealsa khat kumpi tokhum ka pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka naseampa David sia sathau thiang noina taw kumpi in ka koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka thahatna ama taw om tawntung tu a, ka vaangletna in ama hatsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ngalte in ama zo ngeingawl tu hi; mihing seksolte in ama zo ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A ngalte ka sucip tu a ama a ensan theampo ka that tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama ka it tu a, ama tungah ka thumaan tu hi; ngalzo tawntung tu in ama ka siam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mediterranean panin Euphrates ngun dong a kumpi ngam ka keau tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in kei tungah ‘Nangma in ka pa le ka Pathian na hi hi; nangma in kei hong dalpa le hong ngumpa na hi hi’ hong ci tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama sia ka tapaciil in ka vawt tu a, kumpi theampo sung pan a lianbel hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama tungah ka kamciam ka kholet tu a, ama taw ka thuciamna sia a tawntungin a kikhomsuan tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama ii kumpi khangngui sia van bangin kip tu hi; ama ii suan khat sia kumpi in maang tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Ahihang a suan a paalte in ka thukham a ni bua a, ka thupiakte bangin a nungta bua uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />amate in ka hilnate a melsia a, ka thupiakte a len bua ahile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />amate mawnate huvau in daan ka pia tu hi; amate khialnate huvau in ka thuaksak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahihang David ka itna ka bosak buatu a, ama tungah ka kamciam ka peal buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama taw ka thuciamna ka tatsak buatu a, a tungah ka piak ka kamciamsa khat zongh ka dok kik buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“A tawntung atu in khatvei lian, ka min thiangtho taw kamciam ka vawt zo a: David tungah ka leilot ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in suan le paal nei tawntung tu a, ni a taan lai theampo in keima in a kumpi ngam ka etsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tuasia in van ah a om thumaan tetti a pang soltha bangin kip tu hi.” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahihang na tealsa kumpipa tungah na thin uuk hi; ama taisan in na nil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na naseampa taw na thuciamna sia na tatsak zo a, a kumpilukhu sia buan sungah na vawk zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangma in a khuapi luphungte na sutham zo a a kulhpite a cimh sa in na nusiat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kaantan in a pai po in a neisate nguksak hi; a innpaamte theampo in ama nui san uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ama ngalte sia ngalzawna na pia zo hi; amate theampo a lung na damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama ngalhiamte a luithong na suaksak zo a, ngal kidona sungah na lelsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A kumpi ciangkhut na laaksak zo a, a kumpi tokhum sia lei denna in na neizo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A hun ngawlin ama na huaisak zo a, maimawlna taw ama na tuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma le nangma a tawntungin kiseal tu ni ziam? Na thin uukna bang tanvei mei bangin kuang tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka nuntakna bangza in tom ziam ci sia hong phawsak ta'n; kote theampo sia a thithei tu a nong bitphua ahi hunlam phawk in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Akua thi ngeingawlin, nungta thei tu ziam? Mihing in thaankhuk pan bangbangin ama le ama kikeam thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Topa awng, tu ma sia a, na itna tetti te koisung om ziam? David tung kamciam na vawtte koisung om ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Kei na naseampa hong kilan zazaanna le Pathian he ngawlte hong haamsiatna ka thuakte hong makngilsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Topa awng, thaankhuk panin na ngalte in na tealsa kumpipa selno zazaan hi! a paina po ah amate in selno zazaan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A tawntungin Topa pok vun! Amen! Amen!.
  </para>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in a tawntungin kote inn na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mualte na bitphua ma, simlei na piansak ma in nangma in a om tawntung Pathian na hi a, a tawntungin Pathian na hi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kote sia ka hina uh ah cia kikin nong sawl hi; kote leivui nong suak kiksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kum tulkhat sia nang atu in ni khat bang ahi hi; tuate in a bosa zeini taw kibang a, zan lai hun tomno khat taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma in tuipawm ii taai bangin kote nong paipui hi; mangmat khat bang zaa ka hi bek uh hi. Kote sia zingsang in meang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />khangto in a paak, nitak sang ciang vulin a thi lopate taw ka kibang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na thin uukna in ko hong susia hi; thinso in na nge ngawpna in ko hong lausak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ko ii mawnate na mai ah koi in, ko ii maw kunaste na mu theina ah na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thin uukna in ka khan uh hong tomsak hi; ka khan uh sia kihuau khat bangin mang vadi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kote ii hun nei theampo in kum sawmsali hi — ka hat uh le kum sawmliat hi; Tuate in thinngimna le heena teng bekma hong puak hi; nuntakna sia hai ngawlin bo a, kote sia mu mun ka om nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thin uukna ii thahatna buppi akua in thuak ngei ziam? Na thinsona sia bangza lauhuai thei ci sia akua in he ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ciim thei natu uh in ka nuntakna uh bangza in tom ziam ci sia hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na thin uukna bang tan khuangei lai tu ziam? Topa awng, na naseamte tungah mulkimna hong nei ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka nuntak tawntung lungdam in la ka sak thei natu uh in zing simin na itna kip hong dim ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungmanna ka thuak uh kumte theampo sungah heena nong piak za ma in tu in lungdamna hong pia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ko, na naseamte in na lianpi na sepnate hong musak ta'n; ko ii suan le paalte in a minthang, na thahatna musak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa kote Pathian awng, na thuphate ko taw hong om tahen. Ka sep ka vawt uh theampo sungah zawna hong pia ta'n!
  </para>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngammuan natu in Topa kung a pai, akua po ahizong Vaanglianbelpa dalna sungah a om pawpo in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama tungah: “Nangma in kei hong hungpa le hong dalpa na hi hi; Nangma in ka Pathian na hi hi; nang sungah muanna kong nei hi,” ci thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in a kiseal launa theampo pan le thithei natna theampo panin, nang hong keam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a thakhuite taw nang hong uap tu hi; ama khoina sungah na ngammuang tu hi; Ama thumaanna in nang hong dal tu a, hong hung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan in launate le sun in thakhat thu in hong sim theite na kiita buatu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahibuale khuazing sungah hong vaat thei pul natnate ahizong suntangin hong thatlum thei a ngilote ahizong na kiita buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kungah mihing tulkhat pukin a thi zong, na kiimkot ah tulsawm a thi hialzong nang bangma hong kilaw ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A seksolte daan a kipiakzia en in, na mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in Topa sia nang hong hungpa in na nei zo a, a Saangbelpa sia nang hong sungsia pa in na nei zo hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua ahikom siatna khat pawpo in nang hong vaat ngawl tu a, na inn nai ah ngoltolna hong theng ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in a vantunglalangte nang hong cing tu, na paina po ah hong dal tu in tavaw tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na peang in suang sui tha in na liam ngawl natu, amate in a khut taw nang hong dom tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tawpite le ngulte, a kiitak huai tawpite le ngul nguu neite na tuanhcil tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian in, “Kei hong itte ka hun tu a, Topa a hong saangte ka hung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei hong biapui ciangin amate ka zo tu hi; ngim a nga ciangin amate taw ka omkhawm tu hi. Amate ka suatak tu a, ka upat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate sia khansauna tel ka pia tu a, amate ka ngum tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nang tungah lungdamko tu le Saang Bel Pathian awng, nangma upatna la sak tu sia bangza in pha ziam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />zing simin tatsat ngawl na itna thangsak tu, zan simin na thumaanna pualaak tu le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khau taw a kithua tum theite le tengtongh taw music hoite tumin lungdamkona sia bangza in pha ziam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, a lian mama na sepnate in kei hong lungdamsak hi; na sepsa na vawtsate hu in lawpin la ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, na tuk na diannate bangza in lian ziam! Na ngaisutnate bangza in thuk ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi thu in mihing mawmaw khat ii heak zawk hi ngawl hi; a nangh khat in tel zo ngawl hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a seksolte sia lopa bangin po thei tu a, a maan ngawlin a seamte nuamsa thei tu hi; ahitazong amate kilalcipsak tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Topa awng, nang sia a tawntungin a lianbel na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na ngalte thi tu hi ci in ka he uh a, a seksol theampo kizothal tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngam khuital bangin nong hatsak zo hi; lungdamna taw thupha nong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ngalte ngallelna ka mu zo a, a seksolte ii kaanate ka za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thutangte palm kungte bangin limci tu hi; amate Lebanon ah Cedar thingkungte bangin khang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate sia Topa inn sungah a kisuan, ih Pathian Biakinnpi sungah a palh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />haam napi nga a nga lai, a tawntung a hing, a kho thingkungte bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hisia in Topa thumaan a, kei hong hungpa sia khial ngawl hi ci in lak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in kumpipa hi. Ama in uk zawkna le thahatna sia puan bangin silh hi. Leitung sia a omna munah kho takin kiphut a, kikhiin thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, na kumpi tokhum sia a kipat pan ma khotop a, hun kipat ma in nangma na omkhol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa awng, tuipi thukte in a aw uh ngingsak hi; tuate in a aw uh khanin hawk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in vantung ah a lianbel in maang hi, tuipi liante hawkna sangin lianzaw a, tuipi ii tuihualte sangin thahatzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, na thukhamte a tawntungin kho a, a tawntung a tawntungin na Biakinnpi sia thiangtho takpi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in daan a pia Pathian na hi hi; na thin uukna kilanghsak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang sia mihing theampo ii thukhenpa na hi hi; hong tho ta'n a, a kiphasakte amate taw a kiphu bangin daan na pia in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing seksolte bang tanvei lungdam lai tu ziam? Topa awng, bang tan khuangei lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khialna lian neite bang tanvei kiphasak lai tu a, amate khialna liante tungah bang tanvei kisuangtaak lai tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, amate in na mite sucip hi; amate in nangma ii mite nengcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in meingong tangate thatlum uh a, ih ngam sungah a teang khualmite suamlum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in, “ Topa in ei hong mu ngawl hi; Israel te ii Pathian in hong phawk ngawl hi,” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite awng, bangbangin tuaza dongin mawmaw in ngoai thei nu ziam? Bang hun ciangin tel tu nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Eite bil a vawt Pathian in za thei ngawl tu ziam? Eite mittang a vawt Pathian in mu thei ngawl tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minamte a hil a pau pa in amate daan pia ngawl tu ziam? Mihing theampo ii syapa ahi ama in pilna nei ngawl ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate ngaisut sia Topa in he hi; Amate khua ngaisutna telmeal a om ngawlzia ama in he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma ii na lamlakte, nangma ii na thukham na hil mite in bangza a lungdamte ahi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mihing seksolte mat natu in vuum a kitaw dong nangma in ama sia ngimna hunte pan na ommuangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in a mite nusia ngawl tu hi; ama ii neisa mihingte taisan ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thukhenzumte ah thutang khenna hong piang kik tu a, a thutang mihing theampo in tua thutang khenna panpui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing seksolte langpanin kei atu akua ding ziam? Siatna a vawtte langpanin kei sangah akua hong pang ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in hong hu ngawl hi ka pole a thimthuna ngam, a manlang tak ka zot zawk ngei zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kei ka liik laitak hi” ka ci hi; ahihang Topa awng, nong itna kip in hong khuangkhosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thintoi a ka thin a ngim simin, nangma in nong heeneam a nong lungdamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sumnguk ne thei thukhenmangte, a khaikim ngawl thu, thutak a suate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing phate a thasawmte a maw ngawl khat thidaan a piate sia nang taw a kipawl thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahihang Topa in kei hong hung hi; ka Pathian in kei hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in amate ngitlo hu in daan pia tu a, a mawnate hu in susia tu hi; Topa ih Pathian in amate lalcipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hong pai tavun, Topa pok tek tawng! Ei hong dal Pathian tungah ih lungdamna hangin lasa tek tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama mai ah lungdamkona taw pai in, a lungdamhuai pokna late sa tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Topa in a vaanglian Pathian hi a, pathian dang theampo tungsia ah a vaanglian kumpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in lianghawng thuk belte panin mualsaang belte dong leitung buppi uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a vawtsa tuipi uk hi; ama mama ii a piansak leitung zongh uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hong pai tavun, kunin ama bia tek tawng; eite hong Vawtpa, Topa mai ah khupdin tek tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in eite Pathian ahi hi; eite sia ama hong khoi mite ih hi a, ama ii hong vaak tuuhonte ih hi hi. Tuni in ama son teng ngai vun:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na taanghpupite ii Meribah ngam Massah sennealngam sungah a om lai bangin na thinpuisak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah amate atu ka vawt theampo sia amate in mu napi amate in kei hong sit in hong phin zazaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sawmli sitset tua mite tungah ka lung a kim bua hi. ‘Amate in bangza in thumaanna sel ziam! Amate in ka thupiakte a zui nuam bua uh hi’ ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thin uuk a, a ciliap huai kiciamna ka vawt hi: ‘Muang takin na tawlngak natu a kong khapsa ngam sungah na tum ngei buatu uh hi’ ka ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah la thak khat sa vun! Leitung theampo awng, Topa tungah lasa vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah lasa vun a, ama pok vun! Ama ii eite hong ngupna lungdamna thupha ni simin thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ii minthanna minamte tungah thangsak vun, ama ii a vaanglian nasep nate mihing theampo tungah thangsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa sia lian a, nasia tatakin pok tu ahi hi; pathian dang theampo sangin ama vaang piak zawk tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minam dangte theampo ii pathiante sia milim hi lel bek hi, ahihang Topa in vantungte bitphua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minthanna le vaangletna in ama kiim uum hi; a Biakinnpi sia vaangletna le hoina taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />leitung mihing theampo awng, Topa pok vun. A minthanna le a thahatna pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa ii a minthang a min pok vun; biakpiakna khat kengin ama Biakinnpi sungah pai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A thiangtho Pa hong kilangh ciangin ama mai ah kun vun; leitung bup awng ama mai ah liingin om vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minam theampo munah “ Topa in kumpipa hi! Simlei sia kho takin kiphut a kikhiin thei ngawl hi; ama in mihingte thukhaikim taw thu tan tu hi” ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lei le van awng, lungdam vun! Tuipi awng, na sungah a om nuntakna nei teng taw hawk vun;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />lote awng na sungah a om teng taw lungdam vun! Taam sungah a om thingkungte in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />leitung uk tu in Topa hong pai ciang, lungdam in au tu uh hi. Ama in leitung mite sia thukhaikim taw a pha in a uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sia kumpipa hi! Leitung awng lungdam in! Tuipi sungah a om, no tuikulhte awng, lawp tek vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meeikaai le khuazing in ama kiim uum hi; ama in thutang le thukhaikim taw uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meikuang sia a mai ah pai a, a kiimkot ah a om a ngalte kaanghtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama ii khualeng in simlei taangsak hi; tuasia leitung in mu in liing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mualte sia Topa ii mai, leitung theampo ii Topa mai ah khuainun bangin tui tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantungte in ama thutang thangsak uh a, minam theampo in ama ii minthanna mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Milim a bia peuma maizum kingasak tu hi; pathian theampo in Topa mai ah kun uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion mite lungdam uh a, Judah khuapite lawp tek uh hi, banghang ziam cile na thukhenna hang ahi hi, Topa awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaanglianbelpa Topa awng, nang sia leitung theampo a ukpa na hi hi; pathian dangte theampo sangin na lianzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in siatna a ensante it hi; ama in ama mite ii nuntakna dal hi; mihing seksolte ii thahatna panin amate suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thutangte tungah khuavak taang a, miphate tungah lungdamna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No a thutang theampo awng, Topa ii a sep sate hu in lungdam vun! A thiangtho Pathian in bang teng seam zo ci sia phawk vun a, ama tungah lungdamko vun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah la thak khat sa vun; ama in nalamdangte vawt zo hi! ama ii neisa vaangletna le a thiangtho thahatna taw ama in zawna nga zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in a zawna thu thangsak hi; ama ngupna vaangletna sia minamte in hesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Israel te tungah a kamciam sia thumaanna le itna kip taw kholet hi. Mun theampo ah a om mihingte in ih Pathian ii zawna mu zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />leitung theampo awng, Topa tungah lungdamna lasa vun; late le lungdam aunate taw ama pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa tungah pokna late sa vun! tengtonghte taw music tum vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lemle le sakii te tum vun a, Topa , ih kumpipa tungah lungdam in au vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuipi awng, na sungah nuntakna nei teng taw hawk vun; leitung awng, na tungah a teang theampo taw lasa vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngunte awng, khutbeang vun; no mualte awng, Topa mai ah lungdamna taw lasa khawm vun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ama in leitung uk tu in hong pai hi. Ama in leitung mite sia thumaanna taw a pha in uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa sia kumpipa ahi hi; tuaciang mihingte liinglawng uh hi. Ama in Cherub te ii tung sang, a kumpi tokhum tungah to a, leitung sia kilok hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa sia Zion ah thahat hi; ama sia minam theampo tungah a lianbel ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihing sim in, a lian le a vaang nei ama ii min pok tu uh hi. Ama thiangtho hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thahat kumpipa awng, nangma in a maan nate na dei hi; nangma in Israel ngam sungah thutang khenna omsak zo ni hi; nangma in thutang le phatna nong paipui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian pok vun; a kumpi tokhum mai ah bia vun! Ama thiangtho hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Moses le Aaron in ama ii thiampite hi a, Samuel sia ama tungah thu ngen pa ahi hi; amate in Topa biakpui a, ama in zo kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in meeikhuam panin amate paupui hi; amate tungah ama ii piak thukhamte le a thupiakte amate in zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa kote Pathian awng, na mite ngetna na zo kik hi; A mawnate hu in amate daan na piak hial hangin, mawmaisakna a pia Pathian khat na hi hunlam amate na lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian pok vun a, ama mual thiangtho ah bia vun! Topa ih Pathian thiangtho hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Simlei bup awng, Topa tungah lasa vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa sia lungdamna taw bia vun; ama ii mai ah lungdamna late taw hong pai tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa sia Pathian hi ci in ciamtee vun. Ama in eite hong vawt a, eite in ama aa ih hi hi; eite sia ama ii mihingte ih hi a, ama tuuhonte ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Biakinn kongpite sungah lungdamkona taw tum vun; pokna taw a suum sungah pai vun. Ama tungah lungdamko in ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa pha hi; ama ii itna in bomaw a, ama thumaanna sia a tawntungin kikhomsuan hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima ii la in thumaanna le thukhaikim huvau hi a, nangma kong sak hi, Topa awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ngamtatna sia sitbaang ngawl tu hi. Bang hun ciang kei kungah hong pai tu ni ziam? Ka inn sungah nuntakna thiangtho taw ka nungta tu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a pha ngawl sia ka thuak zo buatu hi. Pathian kung pan a nungkinte ii ngamtatnate ka ngaimaw hi; amate taw kipee-awna bangma ka nei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thumaan ngawlin ka om buatu a, ngitlona sungah ka kihel buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngualdang khat po a thimtham in a ngensia thei te ka pawlvawt buatu hi; a kiphasak a kisathei mihing khat sia ka dual zo buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian tungah a thumaante sia ka thukim tu a amate sia ka kumpi inn sungah ka teangsak tu hi. A thumaan a citakte sia keima na ka seamsak thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kumpi inn sungah leilot thu son thei kuama a teang buatu hi; a kihi theamsak peuma kei omna munah a om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ih ngam sungah a om mihing seksolte sia ni khat zawk ni khat ka susia tu hi; mi ngilo theampo Topa khuapi panin ka hawlkhia siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, kong thungetna hong ngai ta'n a, hu ngen a ka auna aw hong za ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngim ka nga laitakin hong nungngat heak in! Kei hong ngai ta'n a kong biapui ciangin a manlang in hong zo ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nuntakna sia meikhu bangin bo vadi hi; ka pumpi sia mei bangin kuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lopa ko bangin hong kivaat hi; an zongh ka du nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ngingin ka tau hi; ka vun le ka ngu bek taw ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in sennealngam sungah a om sane vacim khat bang le, a zaancip a kinusia mun sungah a om simbu khat bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khangciim in ka lum hi; innkhum tungah om vacim lungzuang khat bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nitangtum in ka ngalte in hong selno hi; kei hong nunaute in keima min tomlawna in zangh uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thin uukna le na thinsona hu in, vut sia an in ka nei a, ka thituite sia ka tuineak taw kihel hi. Nangma in nong tawm a nong vawk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka nuntakna in nitak niliap bang hi a, keima in lopa ko taw ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nangma in kumpipa na hi tawntung hi; khang theampo in nang hong phawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma in tho in Zion tungah mulkimna na nei tu hi; tua khuapi tungah hesuakna na nei tu hun hong theng zo hi! Hi sia in a kiciangtan hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua khua sia kisusia zo hi napi na naseamte in it hi, tuasia zaancip zo ahitazong amate in khuangaihuai sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minam tuatuamte in Topa kiita tu hi; leitung ah kumpite theampo in ama ii vaangletna kiita tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in Zion a sakkik ciangin ama in ama ii letna pualaak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A kitaisan sa a mite thungetna ama in ngai tu a, za tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mihing a piang ngawl laite in Topa a pok thei natu, khangkik te atu in ama sep sate lai taw khum tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in a saangna a om ama ii thiangtho mun panin hong ensuk a, ama in vantung panin simlei ensuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in thongtaakte tauna za a, thi daan a kipiate suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama min sia Zion ah kithangsak tu a, Jerusalem ah ama kipok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa bia tu in minamte le kumpi ngam tuatuamte hong kikhop ciangin tuabangin kipok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa in ka khanmoi kimlai ma in hong thazawmsak hi; ama in ka khan hong tomsak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian awng, ka huai maa, tu in kei hong la heak in. Topa awng, nangma in a tawntungin na nungta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />khuangeipi lai in nangma in leitung na bitphua a, nangma khut mama taw vantungte na vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate sia bo vangeu tu a, ahihang nang sia na om lai tu hi; amate in puan bangin tul tu hi. Nangma in amate puan bangin na vawk tu a, amate a bo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ahihang nangma in a tawntungin na kibang a, na nuntakna a bo ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ih tate sia thin muang takin nungta tu a, nangma ii dalna sungah amate suan le paalte sia ngammuang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thaa awng, Topa pok in! Ka nuntakna theampo awng, ama min thiangtho pok in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thaa awng, Topa pok in a, ama bangza dik ziam ci sia mangil heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mawna theampo ama in hong maisak a, ka natna theampo hong damsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in thaankuul thet natu panin hong keam a, itna le hesuakna taw thupha hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Muvanlai bangin hatin ka moisua kik natu in ka nuntakna sia naphate taw ama in hong dimh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kinengcipte panpuina taw Topa in thukhen a, amate ii nga tuakte pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ii ngealnate Moses tungah ama in pualaak a, ama ii sepna liante Israel mite musak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in hong hesuak a hong it in, thin uuk hak a, itna kip taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in hong teih thapaai ngawl hi; a tawntungin a thin uuk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in eite taw a kiphu bangin daan hong pia ngawl a, ih mawnate le ih tat khialnate bangin hong thuk ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Van sia lei panin a saan za in ama a zaktate a itna sia lian mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nisuana sia nitumna pan a kikhualat za in ih mawnate sia eite sung pan tuabangza ma kikhuala in hong khiinsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pa khat in a tate tungah dik ahi bangma Topa sia ama a zaktate tungah dik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Eite sia bang taw kivawt ci sia ama in he hi; ama in eite leivui ih hi sia phawk nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Eite ih hile ih nuntakna sia lopa bang ahi hi. Ngam paak khat bangin ih khang a ih palh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua zawkciang a tungah vui hong va a, tua paak bo in- kuama in mu kik ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang Topa a zaktate atu in ama ii itna in a tawntungin kikhomsuan a, ama phatna sia khang tawntungin kikhom hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama thuciamna sungah a thumaante le ama thupiakte citakna taw a zuite atu in ama phatna sia khang tawntungin kikhom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in a kumpi tokhum sia vantung ah koi hi; ama in mun theampo a uk kumpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama thupiakte zui a, ama ci bang a ni, no, a thahat vantunglalangte awng Topa pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama deina bangin a ngamta no, ama naseam, vantung a om vaang nei theampo awng, Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa pok vun, ama ukna sung mun theampo ah ama ii bitphua sate awng. Topa pok in, ka tha awng!
  </para>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thaa awng, Topa pok in! Topa ka Pathian awng, nang bangza in na lian ziam! Kumpi zaletna le minthanna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nangma in puan bangin na silh hi; Nangma le nangma khuavak taw na kituam hi. Vantungte tuipuan buk khat bangin na phalh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaciangin na inn sia tungsang a om tuite tungah na sa hi. Meeite sia siphu ngalleang bangin na zangh a, vui ii thate tungah na to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vui sia kamtaite bangin na zangh a, khualeng sia na naseamte bangin na zangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Simlei sia a tawdapte ii tungah kho takin na phut a, a kikhiin ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tungah tuipi sia puantual khat bangin na koi a, tui in mualte a khum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuite na teih ciangin amate tai uh hi; na thupiakna aw hong zaak ciangin nawtai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua tuite sia mualte tung le leikuamte sungah luang a, na see sa mun zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leitung a khuum kik nawn ngawl tu, a kaantan thei ngeingawl natu in ngamngi na omsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ciktuite munkuam sungah na luangsak a, ngunte mualte kilaklaw ah na luangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuate in ngamsate atu tui ngasak hi; tua munah ngam laate a dangcim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hui ah a om thingkungte tungah vacimte bu vawtin lasa uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mualte tungah van panin nguatui na puaksuk a, leitung sia na thuphate taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khuite atu in lopa na posak a, mihingte zak tu in thingnote na posak hi, tua ahikom amate in lo ante ciing thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a lungdam natu in sapittui, a maitai natu in olive thau, a thahat natu in anluumte piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lebanon mual tungah Topa ii a suan a neisa Cedar thingkungte in nguatui tam mama a nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua munah vacimte in a bu vawt uh hi; hilniang vacimliante in mang taakthing tungah a bu vawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sathakte in mualdawn saangte tungah teang a, ngalhvangte in suangliangte ah buu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ni a thate teptee natu in tha na bitphua hi; ni in a tum tu hun he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma in zan na vawt a, khuazing sungah ngamsa theampo pusuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tawpi moite in sa a vai ciang hawk uh a, Pathian ii piak an zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni a sua ciangin amate akua zuanin lum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin mihingte in naseam tu in kuan a nitak dongin na seam suak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in na tam mama na vawt zo hi! Ciimna taw tuate theampo na vawt hi! Simlei sia na bitphua nuntakna neite taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kisim zo ngawl nganhingte a lian, a no a teen khopna tuipi sia lianin zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tungah teambawte khualhaw a, a sungah na vawtsa tuipi nganhingpui Leviathan kimai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuate theampo in an a taangsap hun ciang a pia tu in nang hong suang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma in amate an na pia a, a ne uh hi; an na piak ciang amate a lungkim uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na nungngat ciangin amate lau uh hi; a husan na laak ciangin amate thi in, amate pianna leivui ah cia kik uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang amate hu na mop ciang a kibitphua uh hi; Nangma in leitung ah nuntakna thak na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa minthanna kikhomsuan tahen! Ama vawt sate tungtaang ah Topa lungdam tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in simlei en a, leitung a liing hi; ama in mualte tham a, tuate sung pan meikhu pusuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka nuntak lai tawntung Topa tungah la ka sa tu hi; ka nuntak laiteng ka Pathian tungah pokna la ka sa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka la in ama lungkimsak tahen, banghang ziam cile ka lungdamna sia ama kung pan hong pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mawneite leitung panin kilalcipsak tahen; mihing seksolte om nawn heak hen. Ka thaa awng, Topa pok in! Topa pok in!
  </para>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamkona pia vun a, ama ii letna thangsak vun; ama ii sep sate minam tuatuamte tungah son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah pokna lasa vun; a lamdang a sep sa nate thu son vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ii neisa ih hi hu in lungdam vun; ama a bia theampo lawp tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hu ngen tu in Topa zuan vun; a kizom suakin ama bia vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A naseampa Abraham ii suante, a teal pa Jacob ii suante awng: Pathian ii a sep nalamdang laknate le a thukhennate phawk vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in ih Pathian hi; ama thupiakte in leitung bup atu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a thuciam sia a tawntung kholet tu a, ama kamciamte khang tul dongin kipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham taw a vawt thukimna sia le Isaac tungah a kamciam sia ama in kipsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tawntungin a kikhom tu thuciamna khat Topa in Jacob taw vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Canaan ngam nang kong pia tu a, nangma ii neisa hi tu hi,” ama in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian mite sia citawm a, Canaan ngam ah zin tang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate sia ngam khat pan ngam khat ah, kumpi ngam khat pan ngam khat ah vak kawkoai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in amate kuama in a zothawsak bua hi; amate a dal natu in kumpipate tungah hi bangin kidop natu thupia hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka tealsa ka naseamte susia heak vun; ka kamsaangte thutha heak vun,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in amate ngam ah kialpi tungsak a, a an uh a vekpi in laaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahihang ama in sal bangin a kizuak Joseph a kici mihing khat amate mai ah paikholsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama sonkhol thu a taangtun mateng in Joseph ii peangte thikkhau kibul a, thikkol sia a ngawng ah kibul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian kammal in ama sia maan hi ci in lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuasia ciangin Egypt ngam kumpipa in ama suaktasak hi; minamte a ukpa in ama suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama in Joseph sia a ngamukna teng lampui tu le, a ngam bup ukpa tu in koi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kumpipa ii uliante tungsia ah vaangneina le kumpipa ngaisutna a piate lamlak tu in thuneina pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua zawkciang Jacob sia Egypt ngam ah pai a, tua ngam ah teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah ta tam mama pia a, a ngalte sangin hatsak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in a mite Egypt te ii a ngaimawk natu in vawt a, ama in a naseamte theambawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in a naseampa Moses le a teal pa Aaron paisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in Pathian ii a nasia mama sepnate seam a Egypt ngam ah a lamdang laknate vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ngam sungah Pathian in khuazing puak hi, ahihang Egypt te in ama thupiakna a ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in nguntuite chisan suaksak a, a ngasate theampo thisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A ngam bup sia ulolte dimteak a, kumpipa inn ngawngawn ulol taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pathian in thupia a, tho le thataa sia a ngam sung bup ah a hataak in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Nguatui taangin ngialtang le khualeng te amate ngam sungah puak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />amate ii sapitkungte le theikungte lalsak a, thingkungte theampo nuaitan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in thupia a khaumawte hong pai in, sim zawk ngawl awn tampi pha uh hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuate in a ngam sungah thingno lopa theampo netum uh a, lo ante theampo khawng siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in Egypt ngam ah innkuante theampo sung pan tapaciil teng thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua zawkciang ama in Israel te pusua pui hi; amate in ngunn le khamh pua uh a, amate a vekpi in ciidam in thahat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Egypt te in amate kiita ahikom amate ii a nusiat ciangin a lungdam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pathian in a mite tungah meeilom khat koi a, zan in khuavak pia tu in mei khat koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in ngen a, ama in vamimte puak hi; ama in amate lungkim natu in vantung pan an khiak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in suangpi khat hong a, tui hong phulkeak hi, tua tui in sennealngam sungah ngun bangin luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A naseampa Abraham tungah a kamciam thiangtho a piak teng ama in ciamtee hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in a tealsa a mite pusuapui a, amate in lawpna taw lasa in au uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ama in midangte ii leitangte amate tungah pia a, tuaciang a lo teng a tansak sia,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />a mihingte in ama thukhamte a zui natu le a thupiak theampo a zui natu in a vawt ahi hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Topa tungah lungdamko vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi; ama ii itna in a tawntungin kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sep sa na liante theampo akua in son zo tu ziam? Akua in a kicingin pok thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama thupiakte ni a, a tawntungin a maan in a seamte sia mihing lungdamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, na mite na hu ciangin kei hong phawk ta'n; amate na ngup ciang kei zongh hong hel ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mihingte nopsakna hong musak ta'n a, na minam ii lungdamna, na mihingte ii lungdam angtannate hong siimsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka taanghpupite ii maw bangma in ko zongh ka maw zo uh hi; kote in seksolin ka ngilo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah ka taanghpupite in Pathian ii a lamdang a sepnate tel ngawl hi; tamvei tak, a itna a lak hunte amate in mangil hi, tuaciangin San Tuipi ah amate in Vaanglianbelpa langpan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang ama in a kamciamsa bangin a vaangletna lian a lakna in amate hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in San Tuipi thupia a, tua tuipi kang hi; ama in a mite leiko tung tawnsak in lampui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A ensante khut sung panin amate hun hi; a ngalte khut sung panin amate suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang a ngalte ahile tuitaa siat hi; khat zongh a taang bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a mite in ama kamciamte um in pokna la a sak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahihang amate in ama sep sa teng mangil pai uh a, ama ii ngaisut piakna ngak ngawlin ngamta uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Senneal sungah amate duhopna taw kidim a, Pathian ze et uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua ahikom amate nget teng ama in pia a, a kiitakhuai mama natna khat zongh amate sungah puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua sennealngam sungah amate in Moses le Topa ii a thiangtho naseampa Aaron a eang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuasia ciang lei kihong in, Dathan sia lei in valh a, Abiram le a innkuanpuite lei in hukcip hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a nungzuite tungah meikuang paisuk a, tua mihing seksolte kaanghtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Sinai ah khamh taw khuitalno lim khat vawtin tua milim bia uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />amate in Pathian minthanna sia lopa a ne nganhing khat ii lim taw theak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Egypt ngam sungah ama ii a nasia mama sepnate taw amate a hun Pathian, amate in mangil uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua munah ama in bang a lamdang nate vawt ziam! San Tuipi ah ama in bang a lamdangsak huaite vawt ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pathian in a mite ka lalsak tu a ci ciangin ama ii teal a naseampa, Moses in Pathian mai ah dingin a thin uukna taw amate a lalsak ngawl natu in khaam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in tua ngamnuam a nolh uh hi, banghang ziam cile amate in Pathian kamciam a um bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amate in a tuipuan buk sungah om in phun a, Topa aw a nangai nuam bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom amate sia sennealngam sungah a thisak natu ahizong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />a suan a paalte Pathian he ngawlte kawm ah a kithethaangsak natu ahizong, ngamdang ah a thisak natu ahizong ama in a ciliap huai kidop thei natu thupia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaciang Peor ah Pathian ii mihingte in Baal biakna pawm uh a, nuntakna nei ngawl pathiante tungah a kipia sangaw biak piaknate ne uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amate in a ngamtatna taw Topa thin uukna toklosak uh a, a kiitakhuai natna khat amate sungah hong tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahihang Phinehas dingto in a mawte daan a piak ciang, tua pul natna thai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hi thu sia ama maipha nga natu in tua hun pan kipan kiciamtee a, hong pai lai tu hun theampo sungah kiphawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Meribah ciktui ah tua mite in Topa thin uuksak uh a, amate hu in Moses ngim nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Amate in Moses ii thin siasak ahikom ngaisun phot ngawlin ama pau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Amate in Topa thupiak bangin Pathian he ngawlte a that bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tuabang ci thada amate taw nupa in kiteang uh a, doaibiate ii ziate zui uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian mite in milim bia uh a, tua in amate lalna piangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in a tapate a tanute sia Canaan milimte tungah sangaw biakpiakna in nei uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate in tua mawnei ngawl patangno numeinote thatlum uh a, tua kithalupnate in ngam ninsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />A ngamtatna uh taw amate le amate kininsak in Pathian tungah a thumaan bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa sia ama mite tungah thin uuk hi; ama in thasiathuai sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pathian in amate sia Pathian he ngawlte ii khut sungah nusia a, a ngalte in amate uk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate sia a ngalte in zothaw a, amate khutnuai theng siat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tamvei ma Topa in a mite suatak ahihang, amate in Topa langpan tu teal zaw ahikom amate sia mawna sungah a thuk zaw in taaksuk uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ahizong amate ii au in a biapui ciang Topa in za a, amate ii dongtawnate phawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amate atu in a thuciamna phawk a, ama ii itna lianpi hu in amate maisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Pathian in amate a vawtsia mihing theampo sungah, hesuakna thin neisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Topa kote Pathian awng, hong hun ta'n, nang tungah lungdam kong ko thei natu le na min thiangtho kong pok thei natu in, minam tuatuamte sung panin, hong kaikhawm kik ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Israel te ii Pathian, Topa pok vun; tu le a tawntungin ama pok vun! A kuama theampo in “Amen!” ci tahen. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa tungah lungdamko vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi; ama ii hong itna in kikhomsuan hi!”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama hong ngup sa note theampo in hi kammalte lo kikikin Topa pok vun. Ama in na ngalte kung panin hong suatak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ngamdang pan le nisuana, nitumna, sak le thang panin no hong ciapui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawlkhatte in senneal ngamsung lampi om ngawlna ah vakthap a, a teen natu khuapi paina lampi a mu zo bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate a ngilkialin a dangtaak a, lametna bangma a nei nawn bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuasia ciang a ngim ngana sung pan amate in Topa biakpui uh a, ama in a cimawkna uh sung pan hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in lampi tang khat tawnin amate lampui a, a teen thei natu khuapi khat ah then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate atu nalamdang a septe hang le ama ii itna kip hu in amate in Topa tungah lungdamko tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a dangkote dangcimsak a, a ngilkialte an phate taw ngilvasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawlkhatte khuangaina le khuazing sungah teang a, luangta in thikkol kibul uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />banghang ziam cile amate in Vaanglianbelpa Pathian thupiakte nalh a, ama hilnate nial uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in na ham sepna taw a tha uh tul hi; amate puk tu a, kuama in a hu buatu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ngim nga uh ciang amate in Topa biakpui a, ama in a cimawkna uh panin hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in amate sia khuangaina le khuazing sung pan pusua a, a thikkolte sukthapsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate atu a lamdang na a septe hang le a itna kip hu in amate in Topa tungah lungdamko hamtang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Taau taw kivawt kongkhate ama in saattham a, a ki uumna thikzawlte sutan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawlkhatte mawmaw a, a mawna hu le a ngitlo hu in thuak uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate in an kii a, thi dedek in om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciang a ngim nga uh ciangin amate in Topa sam a, amate cimawkna sung pan Topa in hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in a thupiakna taw amate damsak a, thaankuul panin hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate atu a lamdang na a septe hang le a itna kip hu in amate in Topa tungah lungdamko hamtang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama tungah sangaw biakpiakna taw lungdamko hamtang tu a, lungdam lasakna taw ama sep sa theampo son hamtang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawlkhatte in tuipite tungah teambawte taw khualhaw in tuipi tung panin a nuntak natu zong uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate in Topa vawt thei nate mu uh a, tuipi tungah a lamdang a vawtte mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in thupia a, vuipi nasia mama khat hong va a, tua in tuihualte thawn hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Teambawte vui sung a saangna ah kilawnto in, a thukna ah tumsuk hi. Tuabang lauhuaina sungah teambaw naseamte a thinkiam uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />amate sia zukhamte bangin lutu in hoi vatut uh a, amate thiamna theampo sia a kizangh thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A ngim nga uh ciang amate in Topa biakpui a, a cimawkna uh panin ama in hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a kinuai vuipi suangvalte thimsak a, tuihualte dai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua tuihualte a thim hu in amate lungdam a, amate thet nopna teambaw tawlngakna mun ngammuanna taw ama in then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Amate atu nalamdang a septe hang le a itna kip hu in amate in Topa tungah lungdamko hamtang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihingte kikhopna sungah amate in ama ii letna thangsak hamtang tu a, upate thu kikupna mai ah ama pok tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in ngunte kangcipsak a, ciktuite luangsak nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tua munah a teangte ii seksolna hangin, ama in leiphate ci al lei ngamtul suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in sennealngam sia tuicingna mun suaksak a, lei kona mun sia ciktui luanna in kheal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in a ngilkialte tua munah teangsak a, amate in a teen natu in khuapi khat saat uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in lote ah thaicii tu in sapitkung suan uh a, anlaak hun ciangin an tam mama la uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A mite ama in thupha pia a, ta tam mama hing uh hi; Khui honte zongh a kiam ngawl natu in ama in kepsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ngitlo zawthawkna le ngim nganate hangin, Pathian mite ngallel in zawnsak a thuak uh ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />amate a zothawte ama in ngaimawkna lak a, lampi om ngawlna sennealngam sungah vakthapsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahihang taangsapna a neite sia amate lungmanna panin ama in suatak a, a innkuanpuite tuu hon bangin pungsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thutang mite in hi thu mu in lungdam uh a, ahihang a seksol theampo thimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A ciimte in hi thute ngaisun thei tahen; Topa ii itna kip ngaisun thei tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungmuanna a cingin ka nei hi, Pathian awng! La ka sa tu a, kong pok tu hi! Khanglo in, ka thaa awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tengtongh le liamlo te awng, khanglo vun! Tung sunni zongh ka phong tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa awng, minamte sung nangma tungah lungdam kong ko tu hi. Mihingte kawm panin nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na itna kip in vantungte kalh hi; na thumaanna in vante ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian awng, van ah na letna le leitung bup ah na minthanna lak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thahatna taw kote hong hun ta'n; na it, na mite a suatak thei natu in ka thungetna hong zo ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A inn thiangtho pan Pathian in, “Zawna mualsuana taw Shechem ka khentham tu a, Sukkoth ngamkuam sia ka mihingte ka hawmsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead sia kei aa hi a, Manasseh zongh kei aa, ahi hi; Ephraim sia ka thik lukhu hi a, Judah sia ka kumpi ciangkhut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Moab sia ka kisilna kuangin ka zangh tu a, ka neisa hi ci in a kitel natu in Edom tungah ka peangdap ka lawn tu hi. Philistine te tungah zawna mualsua in ka au tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian awng, ngalnan natu in a ki uumcip khuapi sungah akua in kei hong tumpui tu ziam? Edom ah akua in kei lam hong pui tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hong nial takpi zo ni ziam? Ka ngalkap honte taw mainawt in hong kuanpui ngawl tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngalte langpanin ko hong hu ta'n; Mihingte kihuna in mannung ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian ei sang hong pang le eite in ih zo tu hi; ama in ih ngalte a zothal tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian awng, nang kong pok hi; thim om top heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing seksolte le leilot theite in kei hong sim hi. Amate in kei huvau leilot thu son hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei hong siatson hi, a thu om ngawl bulin kei hong sim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate it in amate atu thungetsak ka hi hangin amate in kei hong ngalvawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in kei tungah phatna sia siatna taw, itna sia etsatna taw hong thuk kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ngalpa tungah thusit tu in a maan ngawl thukhenpa khat teal in a, ama ngalte khat ma in ama mawsiatsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama sia thu kisit in, a maw hunlam kilangh tahen; ama ii thungetna ngawngawn khialna lian khat bangin kituat tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nuntakna hai ngawlin bo tahen; midang khat in a nasep lua tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A tate sia tanga suak tahen a, a zi meingong tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tate inn nei ngawl khutdaw ngente suak tahen; a siacip sa a teenna pan amate kinot tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A leibatnate in a neisa theampo laaksak tahen a, ama sep thaman theampo khualmite in nga tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kuama in ama tungah dik ngei heak hen a, ama ii nusiat tangate sia kuama in khoi a keam heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A suan a paal theampo mong tahen a, khang kik sungah a min kimangil tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A taanghpupite ngitlona sia Topa in ciamtee hen a, a nu mawnate maisak ngei heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate mawna sia Topa in a tawntungin ciamtee tahen a, ahizong amate sia kimangil biing tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua pa in cikna thiamna ngaisun ngeingawl hi; ama in a zawng, taangsapna a neite le a hu tu a nei ngawlte vawtsia in thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in ngual tomlaw thanuam ahikom, ama kitomlaw tahen! Ama in thupha pia nuam ngawlhet ahikom, kuama in ama thupha pia heak hen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in haamsiatna sia a puansilh bangin ngeina see hi; haamsiatnate in ama ii pumpi tui bangin tuamh tahen a, a ngu a taang sungah sathau bangin zenh tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua haamsiatnate in ama sia puan bangin tuam tahen a, kawngkhau bangin ama vial top tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa awng, kei hong langpanin kamsia a pau ka ngalte tungah tuabangin daan pia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang Vaanglianpipa ka Topa awng, nong kamciamsa bangin kei hong hu ta'n a, a pha na itna hangin kei hong suatak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in zawngin ka kitaangsamh hi; ka thinsung tawngh dongin na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nitak niliap bangin ka bo dektak hi; lungno khat bangin hong kiseamkeak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Anneak kisap hu in ka khupte huang hi; keima in vun le ngu bek taw ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihingte in kei hong mu ciangin hong nuisan uh hi; selnona taw a lu uh hong pei san hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa ka Pathian awng, kei hong hu ta'n; na itna kip hu in hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kei hong hunpa sia nangma na hi hunlam ka ngalte in hesak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in kei hong tomlaw thei tu ahihang nangma in thupha nong pia tu hi. Kei hong vawtsiate in lelna thuak tahen a, keima, na naseampa hong lungdamsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ka ngalte sia mindaina taw kituam tahen; amate in a maizumna sia puantual bangin silh tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamkona nging takin ka pia tu hi; mihingte kikhopna sungah ama ka pok tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ama in mizawng pa hung a, a thi natu in a puavawkte kung panin amate suatak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka topa tungah Topa in, “Na ngalte na peang nuai ah ka koi dong hi sung ka ziatsang ah to in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion panin Topa in na kumpi vaangletna hong khang tu hi. Ama in, “Na ngalte uk in” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ngalte na sim ni ciangin na mite in amate uuk thu in nang hong pawm tu hi. Zingsang tuung daaitui bangin na khangnote in nang kung mual thiangthote tungah hong pai tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in ciliap huai kamciam khat vawt a dok kik ngawl tu hi: “Nangma in Melchizedek pan a kinguizui thiampi nam sungah a tawntungin thiampi khat na hi tu hi,” ci in kamciam pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa sia na ziatsang ah om hi; ama a thin a uuk ciangin kumpite zothal siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minam tuatuamte tungah ama in thutan tu a, ngal kisimna phual sia mithiluang taw kidimsak tu hi; leitung kumpite theampo zo siat tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kumpipa in lamhui ah a luang luitui ne tu a, tuasia ciang kithakho sua in, zawna taw a ding tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Ama ii mite kikhopna ah ka thin theampo taw Topa ka pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii septe bangza in lamdang ziam! Tuate hu in a lungpilte in tuate thu a tel nuam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ii sep theampo sia patoaina le vaangneina taw kidim hi; ama ii thutang in kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in ama ii a lamdang a septe eite makngil tu a dei bua hi; ama dik a hesuak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama a zaktate atu in ama in an pia hi; ama ii thuciam a mangil ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngamdang mite ii leitangte amate a piakna taw in a mite tungah ama in a vaang lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sep a vawt theampo sungah ama thumaanin thutang hi; ama ii thupiakna theampo in muan thamman hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate in a tawntungin kikhomsuan hi; thumaan thutak le thutang taw a kipia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a mite suaktasak a, amate taw a kip tawntung thuciamna khat vawt hi. Ama thiangtho in vaanglian hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa zatakna in ciim natu lampi ahi hi; ama thupiakte a zui theampo tungah thu khentel thiamna pia hi. Ama sia a tawntungin pok tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Topa zakta a, a thupiakte zui tu nuam a sa sia in mihing lungdam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing pha khat ii tate sia a ngam sungah thahat tu uh hi; ama ii suan le paalte thupha kipia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama ii bangkua sia nei le lamh taw kicing tu a, ama a tawntungin nuamsa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing phate, ngual a hesuak theite, a dikte le thutangte atu in khuazing sungah khuavak a taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngual tungah ngo takin sum pukthaak a, a nasepna thumaanna taw a seam sia in mihing lungdam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mipha khat in lelna thuak ngeingawl tu hi; ama sia kiphawk tawntung tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in thusia zaak tu a patau bua hi; ama ii upna kho a, ama in Topa muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama sia thinngim ngawlin a lau bua hi; a ngalte ii a lel tu uh sia ama in mu nanak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kitaangsamhte tungah ama in ngo takin pia a, ama ii cikna thiamna sia bo ngeingawl hi; ama thahat tu a, kizakta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in hi thu mu in a thin uh uuk hi; amate in etsatna taw salh in tua teng taw amate a bo uh hi; amate lametnate a tawntungin mangthang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Topa naseamte awng, ama min pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu le a tawntungin ama min kipok tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuana pan nitumna ah Topa min pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in minam theampo uk hi; Ama ii minthanna sia vantungte sangin saang zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian taw a kibang kuama dang om ngawl hi. Ama sia tungsang a saangna ah teang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ahihang ama in vantungte le leitung en tu in kunsuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in leivui sung panin mizawngte phongto hi; a kitasamhte a lungmanna panin laamto hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuaciang a mite ii kumpipa tapate ahi, kumpipa tapate taw kithawlsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in tasel nupi sia a inn sungah patoai a; ama in tanu tapa piakna taw ama lungdamsak hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te in Egypt ngam pan pusuak a, Jacob suante in tua ngamdang sia a nusiat ciang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah sia Topa ii minam thiangtho suak a, Israel te sia ama ii neisa suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />San Tuipi in en a, taisan hi; Jordan Ngun a luan tawlnga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mualpite sia keal bangin leang valet uh hi; mualnote sia tuunote bangin kilawn kawkoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi awng, nang tuabangin na taikeak natu bang thu piang ziam? Tuaciang, Jordan awng, banghangin na luan tawlnga ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />No, mualpite awng, banghangin kealte bangin leang valet nu ziam? No, mualnote awng, banghang tuunote bangin kilawn kawkoai nu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa hong pai ciang, Jacob ii Pathian mai ah leitung awng, liing in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />suangpite sia tuicingte, suangliang kipte sia ciktui luangte in a kheal sia ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, na itna kip le na thumaanna hangin na minthanna sia kote tungah hi ngawlin, nang tung bek ah om tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghangin minam tuatuamte in, “Na Pathian uh koisungah om ziam?” ci in hong dongh tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ih Pathian in vantung ah om hi; ama in a uuk pawpo seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate ii pathiante sia ngunn le khamh taw kivawt a, mihing khutte taw kivawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua pathiante in kamte nei ahihang pau thei ngawl a, mittangte nei ahihang, khuamu thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in bilte nei ahihang khua za thei ngawl a, naakte nei ahihang a ngim za thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in khutte nei ahihang tham thei ngawl a, peangte nei ahihang lampai thei ngawl hi; amate in aw ngingsak thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabangte vawt a tuate ma a muangte in amate vawt milimte bang suak siat tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No, Israel te awng, Topa muang vun. Ama in no hong hu a hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />No, Pathian thiampite awng Topa muang vun. Ama in no hong hu a hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No, ama a biate theampo awng, Topa muang vun. Ama in no hong hu a hong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in eite hong phawk a thupha hong pia tu hi; ama in Israel te le Pathian thiampite theampo thupha pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama a zaktate theampo a lian, a no a kibangin ama in thupha pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in no le na suan na paalte uh tungah hin le toai hong pia tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Van le lei a vawt Topa in note thupha hong pia tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vantung sia, Topa bek ii neisa hi a, ahihang simlei sia mihingte atu in pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa sia, ngam thimna a zuansuk mithite peuma in pok ngawl uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahihang ei a nungtate in tu le a tawntungin ama tungah lungdam ih ko tu hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ka it hi, banghang ziam cile ama in ka aw hong za hi; ama in ka thungetnate hong ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka biapui simin ama in hong ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thi tu lau huaina sia ka kiimkot ah om hi; thaankuul kiitakhuaina in kei hong neak hi; kei sia launa le thintoina taw ka kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuasia ciang Topa sia hi bangin ka sam a, “Hong thuum khi hi, Topa awng, kei hong hun ta'n!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa sia hesuak thei a, pha hi; ih Pathian in khuangai huai hong sa thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hun tu a nei ngawlte Topa in sungsia a; a lau huaina sungah ka om ciangin ama in kei hong hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lungtang awng, kimuang in, banghang ziam cile Topa in kei tungah pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in thina panin kei hong suatak hi; ama in ka thitui hong khaamsak a, hong lelsak ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom Topa ii mai, a nungtate teenna leitung ah ka vak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Hong kisucip hi,” ka ci ciang ngawngawn ahizong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />kei lau in, “Kuama muan thei tu om bo” ka ci ciang ngawngawn zongin ka upna ka thasua bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa ii kei tungah a phatna theampo hu in ama bang pia thei tu khi ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei hong hutna lungdamkona in Topa tungah sapittui biakpiakna ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mite theampo kikhopna ah ka kamciamsa sia ama ka pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mite khat a thi ciangin Topa in bangza in na sa ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei sia na naseampa khi hi, Topa awng; ka nu ii nang atu hong sepsak bangma in kei zongh in nang atu ka seam hi. Thina panin nong hun zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungdamko biakpiakna kong pia tu a, nang tungah thungetna kong nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na mite theampo kikhopna mun, Jerusalem na Biakinnpi thiangtho sungah, ka kamciamsa sia kong pia tu hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun, minamte theampo awng! Ama pok vun, mite theampo awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii eite hong itna in lian a, a thumaanna sia a tawntung atu ahi hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi, tuaciang ama hong itna in a tawntung kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel te in: “Ama ii itna kip tawntung hi” ci tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian thiampite in “Ama ii itna kip tawntung hi” ci tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama a bia theampo in “Ama ii itna kip tawntung hi” ci tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ngim ngana sungah Topa ka biakpui hi; ama in hong zo a hong suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in keima taw hong omkhawm a, kei ka lau buatu hi; akua in kei bang hong law thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa sia kei hong hu pa hi a, ka ngalte ii lelna a thuak sia ka mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa muanna in mihing suan tu sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa muanna in mihing lampuite suan tu sangin phazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngal tam mamate ka kiim ah om hi; ahihang Topa vaang taw amate ka susia hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate ka kiimkot mun theampo ah a om uh hi; ahihang Topa vaang taw amate ka susia hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka kiimkot panin amate in khuai bangin hong uumci hi, ahihang lingkung kawm kaanghmei bangin amate kaanghtum paih hi; Topa vaang taw amate ka susia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei sia nasia takin hong kisim a hong zo uh hi, ahihang Topa in kei hong hu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in vaang hong pia a hong hatsak hi; ama in kei hong hun zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian mite tuipuan bukte sungah zawna lungdamna taw a auna ngai vun: “ Topa vaanglet thahatna in tu a bang a suaksak hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kidona sungah ama vaanglet thahatna in eite zawna ah hong then zo hi!” ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei ka thi buatu hi; ka nungta zaw tu a, Topa sepsate ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in nasia takin kei daan hong pia zo hi, ahihang ama in kei hong thisak bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Biakinn kongpite kei hong hon tavun; a sungah tumin, Topa tungah lungdam ka ko tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hisia in Topa kongpi hi; thutangte bek tum thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa awng, nang kong pok hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in ka aw nong za a, zawna nong pia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Inn sate in mannung sa ngawl a, a nil suangtum sia a thupibel hong suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hisia in Topa ii sepsa ahi hi; tua in bangza mu nop huai ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hisia in Topa zawna ni ahi hi; lungdam in poai vawt tawng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hong hun ta'n, Topa awng, hong hun ta'n! Kote zawna hong pia ta'n, Topa awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa min taw hong pai pa, Pathian in thupha pia tahen! Topa Biakinn panin nang thupha kong pia uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa sia Pathian hi; ama in ei tungah hong pha hi. Na khut sung uh ah thingsawlte toai in poai khaamna kipan vun a, biaknatau kiimkot in pai vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangma in ka Pathian na hi a, lungdam kong ko hi; na letna ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi, tuaciang ama ii itna a tawntungin kip hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa thukham bangin nungta a, a nuntakna a sit baang ngawlte in mihing lungdamte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama thupiakna a zuite, a thin theampo taw ama thu a nite in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in ngamtat khial a nei ngei bua uh hi; Topa lampi a tawn uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, na thukhamte ko nong pia zo a, thumaan takin ka zui natu nong sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nong hilnate thumaan tak a, ka kepcing natu sia bangza in lametna nei khi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na thupiakte theampo ka nadon le, ka mai hong zumsak buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thutang taw na thu khennate ka heheak ciangin, thinsung thiangtho taw nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thukhamte ka zui tu hi; Kei hong nusia ngei heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khangno khat in ama nuntakna bangbangin a thiangtho in a keam thei tu ziam? Na thupiakte zuina taw keam thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thin theampo taw nang atu sep tu ka hanciam hi; na thupiakte a zui ngawlin hong koi heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang tungah kong maw ngawl natu in na thukham ka thinsung ah ka keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang kong pok hi, Topa awng; nangma paiziate hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nong piaksa thukhamte theampo nging takin ka lo kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hau mama tu sangin na thupiakte zuina sungah lungpilna ka nei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nong lamlaknate ka kantel hi; nong hilnate ka mitsuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thukhamte sungah nuam ka sa hi; nong thupiaknate ka mangil buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka nuntak thei natu le nong hilnate kong nit thei natu in, kei na naseampa tungah hong dik ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na thukham sungah a lamdang thumaante ka mu thei natu in ka mit hong honsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi sung leitung ah tawm vei bek ka om tu hi; na thupiakte kei kung pan seal heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thu khennate a tawntungin ka he nuam a, thangai in ka thin na hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kiphasakte na mawsak hi; na thupiakte a ni ngawlte haamsiatna thuak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na thukhamte ka kepcing hu in kei hong selno a, hong nomute taw hong kipealsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngam ukte kisitua in kei hong thasawm uh hi, ahihang nangma hilnate ka kantel tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na lamlaknate in kei thinnopna hong pia hi; tuate in ngaisutna hong piate ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Leivui sungah lelna taw ka lum hi; nong kamciamsa bangma in hong hingsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka sepsa theampo nang tungah kong pualaak a, nangma in nong zo hi; nangma ii paiziate hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na thukhamte ka tel thei natu in hong hu ta'n, tua ciangin a lamdang nong hilnate ka ngaisusun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Heena in keima hong khucip hi; nong kamciamsa bangin hong hatsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A maan ngawl lampi ka zui ngawl natu in hong keam ta'n a, na phatna zui in na thukham hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thu nit tu ka teal zo hi; na thu khennate ka nadon zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Na lamlakna ka zui zo hi, Topa awng; maizum hong ngasak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na thupiakte thalawp takin ka zui tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in tel theina a tamzaw nong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa awng, na thukhamte ii khiakna hong hil ta'n, tua hile a tawntungin ka zui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na thukham kei tungah hong thiangson ta'n, tua hile ka zui tu hi; ka thin theampo taw ka keam tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na thupiakte hong zuisak ta'n, banghang ziam cile tuate sungah lungdamna ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hau natu sangin na thukhamte zui nopna thin hong pia zaw ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A man nei ngawl nate nadon na panin hong keamcing ta'n a, nong ciamsa bangma kei tungah hong dik ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na thu hong nite tungah na piak kamciam sia na naseampa kei tungah hong tungsak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Selnona thuak tu ka launa panin hong hun ta'n; na thu khennate bangza in lamdang ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na thupiakte ka zui nuam hi; nuntakna thak hong pia ta'n, banghang ziam cile nangma in thumaan thutang na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Topa awng, kei bangza hong it ni ziam hong lak ta'n a, na kamciamsa taw kizui in, kei hong ngum ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tuasia ciang kei hong selnote pauna ka zo thei tu hi banghang ziam cile na kammal ka muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A tawntungin thumaan hong pausak thei ta'n, banghang ziam cile ka lametna sia nangma thukhen nate sungah om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na thukham sia a tawntung a tawntungin ka zui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A cialcing suatakna sungah ka nungta tu hi, banghang ziam cile na hilnate zui tu ka hanciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kumpipate munah na thupiaknate ka son tu a, ka mai a zum buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Na thupiakte zuina sungah thinnopna ka nga hi, banghang ziam cile tuate ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Na thupiakte thasia in ka it hi; na lamlaknate thuk takin ka ngaisusun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Na naseampa kei tung a, nong kamciam sia phawk in; tuasia in lametna hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ka ngimna sung ngawngawn ah keima hong kiheneam hi, banghang ziam cile na kamciamna in kei nuntakna hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />A kiphasakte in kei hong zawnsak tawntung hang, na thukham panin ka pial ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Topa awng, taanghlai a na thukhennate ka ciamtee a, tuate in heenepna hong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Mihing seksolte ii na thukham a paltan ka mu ciangin thin uukna taw ka kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Leitung ka nuntak hun tom no sungah na thupiakte huvau la in ka phuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Topa awng, zanin nang kong phawk a, na thukham ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na thupiakte zuina in ka lungdamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Topa awng, ka dei theampo sia nangma na hi hi; na thukhamte zui tu in kong kamciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Nong kamciamsa bangma kei tungah hesuakna nong nei natu in ka thin theampo taw kong ngen hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka ngamtat nate ka ngaisun zo a, nong lamlaknate zui natu kamciam kong pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Na thupiakte zui natu ka haisaang bua a, ka manlang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in kei thaang hong sia zo hi, ahihang na thukham ka mangil bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Thutang taw na thu khennate hangin nangma pok tu in zan kimlai in ka khanglo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Keima in nang atu hong sepsakte theampo le, na thukhamte a zuite theampo ii lawm ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Topa awng, leitung in na itna kip taw kidim hi; na thupiakte hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Topa awng, na kamciam, na kholet zo a, na naseampa keima ii tungah nong dik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ciimna le heakna hong pia ta'n, banghang ziam cile na thupiaknate ka muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Daan nong piak ma in ka pai khial bul hi, ahihang tu in na pau kong ni hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Nang sia na pha a, na thuthiam hi! Na thupiakte hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Mihing kiphasakte in kei huvau leilot thu son zo uh hi, ahihang na lamlaknate ka thinsung theampo taw ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Hi mihingte in tel theina bangma nei ngawl hi, ahihang kei in na thukham sungah nuam ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Daan ka thuakna in kei atu in pha hi, banghang ziam cile na thupiakte hong hesak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Leitung ah a om sum le vanh manpha theampo sangin nong piak na thukham in kei atu in khiakna nei zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Nangma in kei nong bitphua a, nong keamcing hi; tel theina hong pia ta'n, tua hile na thukhamte ka he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Nang hong upatte in kei hong mu ciangin a lung uh dam tu hi, banghang ziam cile na kamciam ka muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Topa awng, na thukhennate tang hi ci in ka he hi, tuaciang daan nong piak zongh nangma thumaan hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Na naseampa kei tungah nong kamciamsa bangma in na itna kip in kei hong heeneam tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Kei hong hesuak ta'n, tua hile ka nungta tu hi, banghang ziam cile na thukham sungah thinnopna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />A kiphasakte in a maan ngawl bulin kei hong suanhkhial ahikom maizumna nga tahen; kei ka hile nangma lamlaknate thuk takin ka ngaisusun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Nang hong zaktate na thupiakte a hete theampo kei kungah hong pai tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Lelna maizumna taw ka kipeal natu in na thupiakte a cing takin hong zuisak thei ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Topa awng, nong ngup tu kong ngakna in, ka tha tul zo hi; na kammal sungah muanna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />“Bang hun ciang hong hu tu ni ziam?” ci in kong dok kawmin nong kamciamte muangmaw a ka e etna in ka mit taak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />A kivawk sa savun tuithawl bangin kei sia kimanna ka nei nawn bua hi; ahihang na thupiakte ka mangil bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Bang tanvei hong ngak lai tu khi ziam? Kei hong vawtsiate bang hun ciangin daan pia tu ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Na thukham a zui ngawl mihing kiphasakte in kei thaang hong sia natu in vuum a to zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Na thupiak theampo muan thamman hi; mihingte in leilot thu taw kei ngim hong pia hi — kei hong hu ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Amate in kei hong thatlum dektak zo hi, ahihang na thupiakte ka ngaingon ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />Na itna kip hu in kei tungah hong dik ta'n, tua hile na thukhamte ka zui thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Topa awng, na kammal in kikhomsuan tu hi; tua in vantung ah kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="90" style="v" />Na thumaanna sia khang theampo dong kikhomsuan hi; nangma in simlei sia a om natu munah na nga a, tuabang ma in om top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="91" style="v" />Tuni dong na theampo amate om babang tekin om hi, banghang ziam cile nangma thupiak hang le amate theampo sia na naseamte a hi siat uh hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" />Na thukham in ka lungdamna ii naak hi buathong le ka thuaknate taw ka thi zo tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="93" style="v" />Na lamlaknate ka ngaingon ngei buatu hi, banghang ziam cile tuate taw keima a nungta in nong keam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="94" style="v" />Kei sia nangma aa ka hi hi — kei hong hun ta'n! Na thupiakte zui tu ka hanciam zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="95" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in kei hong thatlum tu in hong ngak hi, ahihang na thukhamte a thukin ka ngaisusun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" />Na theampo sia a kiciangtan in om hi ci in ka he hi; ahihang na thupiakna sia sitbaang ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" />Na thukham bangza in it khi ziam! Tua thu nitangtumin ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="98" style="v" />Na thupiak sia kei taw a tawntungin omkhawm a, kei sia ka ngalte sangin hong ciimsak zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="99" style="v" />Ka syate theampo sangin ka tel zaw hi, banghang ziam cile keima in nong lamlaknate thuk takin ka ngaisusun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="100" style="v" />Pasal haamte sangin ciimna lianzaw ka nei hi, banghang ziam cile na thupiakte ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" />Ngamtat sia theampo ka pial hi; banghang ziam cile na thu ka ni nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="102" style="v" />Na lamlaknate ka ngaingon bua hi; banghang ziam cile nangma in ka syapa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="103" style="v" />Na lamlaknate thum mama a, khuaitui sang ngawngawn in thum zaw hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="104" style="v" />Na thukhamte panin ciimna ka nga hi; tua ahikom a sia ngamtatna theampo ka ensan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" />Na kammal in kei lam hong lak tu meiinn hi a ka lampi atu khuavak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="106" style="v" />Na lamlakna maante zui natu in, a ciliaphuai ka kamciam sia ka len tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" />Topa awng, ka thuaknate sia lauhuai takpi hi; nong kamciamsa bangma in hong nungtasak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="108" style="v" />Topa awng, lungdamko ka thungetna hong saang ta'n a, na thupiakte hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="109" style="v" />Ka nuntakna khaamh tu in ka kinging tawntung hi; na thukham ka mangil bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="110" style="v" />Mihing seksolte in thaang taw kei hong sia hi; ahihang na thupiakte zui ngawlin ka om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="111" style="v" />Na thupiakte sia a tawntungin keima neisa ahi hi; tuate in ka lungdamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="112" style="v" />Ka thi ni matengin na thukhamte zui tu in ka khensat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" />Nang tungah a pha tak hong thumaan ngawlte ka ensan hi, ahihang na thukham ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="114" style="v" />Nangma in kei hong hungpa le hong dalpa na hi a; na kamciam sungah lametna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="115" style="v" />No, mawnei mite awng, kei kung panin tai vun. Ka Pathian thupiakte ka zui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="116" style="v" />Nong ciamsa bangma in thahatna hong pia ta'n, tua hile ka nungta tu hi; ka lametna sungah hong thinkiamsak heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="117" style="v" />Ka ngammuan natu in hong len ta'n, tuaciang na thupiakte a tawntungin ka nadon tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" />Na thukhamte a zui ngawl peuma na nial hi; amate thimthel ngiimnate sia a mannung bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="119" style="v" />A seksol theampo sia ninteak bangin na ngaisun hi, tua ahikom na lamlaknate ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="120" style="v" />Nangma hu in ka lau hi; na thukhennate hu in launa taw ka kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" />A phate le a maante ka seam zo hi; ka ngalte khut sungah hong nusia heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="122" style="v" />Na naseampa na hu tu sia kamciam pia in; a kiphasakte in hong zothawsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="123" style="v" />Nong hut natu kong etna, nong kamciamsa ngupna ka etna in ka mit taak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="124" style="v" />Nong itna kip taw kizui in kei tungah hong vawt ta'n a, na thupiakte hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="125" style="v" />Keima in na naseampa ka hi hi; na hilnate ka heak thei tu in, tel theina hong pia ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" />Topa awng, na sep tu hun zo hi, banghang ziam cile, mihingte in na thukham hong zui ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="127" style="v" />Khamh le, khamh ciitak sangin na thupiakte ka itzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="128" style="v" />Tua ahiciang na lamlaknate theampo ka zui a, lam khialna theampo ka ngaimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" />Na hilnate lamdang hi; ka thin theampo taw ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="130" style="v" />Na hilnate na thiang sonna in khuavak pia a, a he ngawlte ciimna pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="131" style="v" />Na thupiakte ka deina hangin kamkaa in ka haihaw liang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" />Kei sang hong nga ta'n a, nang hong itte theampo tungah na ngamtat bangmain kei hong hesuak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="133" style="v" />Nong kamciamsa bangin liik natu pan hong keam ta'n; siatna in hong zosak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="134" style="v" />Na thupiakte ka zui thei natu in kei hong zothawte kung panin hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="135" style="v" />Nong ompuina taw thupha hong pia ta'n a, na thukhamte hong hil ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="136" style="v" />Mihingte in na thukham hong zui ngawl hu in ka thitui ngun bangin luang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in thumaan thutang na hi a, na thukhamte maan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="138" style="v" />zui tu ngeina na piakte sia pha tatak a, maan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="139" style="v" />Ka ngalte in, na thupiakte thusim ngawl ahikom ka thin uukna sia, ka sungah mei bangin kuang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="140" style="v" />Na kamciam sia bangza in maan ziam! Tuasia bangza in diksa khi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="141" style="v" />Kei sia a thupi ngawl ka hi a, zawnsak ka thuak hi, ahihang na hilnate ka ngaingon bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" />Na thutang sia a tawntungin kikhomsuan tu a, na thukham sia maan tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="143" style="v" />Ngimna le thintoina taw ka kidim hi, ahihang na thupiakte in lungdamna hong puak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="144" style="v" />Na lamlaknate a tawntungin thutang ahi hi; telthiamna hong pia ta'n, tua hile ka nungta tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" />Ka thin theampo taw nang kong sam hi; Topa awng, hong zo ta'n, tuaciang na thupiakte ka zui tu hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="146" style="v" />Nang kong sam hi; hong hun ta'n, na thukhamte ka tang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="147" style="v" />Nisua ma in hu ngenin nang kong sam hi; na kamciam sungah ka lametna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="148" style="v" />Na lamlaknate ka thuk ngaisusutna in zankhuateakin khangciim in ka lum hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="149" style="v" />Topa awng, nong itna in kip ahikom hong za ta'n; nong hesuakna hong lak ta'n a, ka nuntakna hong keamcing ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" />A ngilo kei hong vawtsiate in hong neak vaial hi; amate sia na thukham a tang ngeingawlte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="151" style="v" />Ahihang Topa awng, nangma in keima nai ah nong om a, na thupiakte theampo kho top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="152" style="v" />Na lamlaknate ka heak zawk ngei zo hi; tuate sia a kikhomsuan tu in na vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" />Ka thuakna hong en ta'n a, hong ngum ta'n, banghang ziam cile na thukham ka ngaingon bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="154" style="v" />Ka vai hong panpui ta'n a, hong suaktasak ta'n; nong kamciamsa bangin hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="155" style="v" />A seksolte kingum ngawl tu hi, banghang ziam cile amate in na thukhamte a ni bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="156" style="v" />Ahihang, Topa awng, na mulkimna in lian hi; na hesuakna hong lak ta'n a hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" />Keima in ngalte le hong zothaw theite tam mama ka nei hi, ahihang na thukhamte ka zui khial ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="158" style="v" />Tua ngual leeheak theite ka et ciangin kiihuai ka sa hi, banghang ziam cile amate in na thupiakte a len bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="159" style="v" />Topa awng, na lamlaknate bangza in it khi ziam cisia, hong mu ta'n. Na itna in kikheal ngeingawl ahiciang hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="160" style="v" />Na thukham laingil in thumaanna hi a, a tangin na thukhennate theampo sia kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" />Mihing vaang neite in a maan ngawlin kei hong do hi, ahihang na thukham ka thasia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="162" style="v" />Na kamciamte hu in bangza ka lungdam ziam — Sumngum kikholna a mu khat bangin ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="163" style="v" />Leilot thu theampo ngaimaw in ka huatsa hi, ahihang na thukham ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="164" style="v" />A tang na thukhennate hu in ni simin salivei nang tungah lungdam kong ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" />Na thukham a itte in ngammuanna tatak nei a, amate a puksak thei bangma a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="166" style="v" />Topa awng, nong ngup tu ngakin ka om a, nong sawl po ka seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="167" style="v" />Na hilnate ka ni hi; ka thinsung theampo taw tuate ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="168" style="v" />Na thupiakte le nong lamlaknate ka zui hi; ka sep ka vawt theampo na mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" />Hu ngen a kong auna nang kung hong theng tahen, Topa awng! Nong kamciamsa bangin tel theina hong pia ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="170" style="v" />Kong thungetna hong ngai ta'n a, na kamciamsa om bangin hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="171" style="v" />A tawntungin nang kong pok tu hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in na thukhamte nong hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="172" style="v" />Na thukham tungtaang ah la ka sa tu hi, banghang ziam cile na thupiaknate maan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="173" style="v" />Kei hong hu tu in a tawntungin hong kinging ta'n, banghang ziam cile na thupiakte ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="174" style="v" />Topa awng, hong ngum tu nong huna sia bangza in thangai khi ziam! na thukham sungah lungdamna ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="175" style="v" />Nang kong pok thei natu in nuntakna hong pia ta'n; na lamlaknate in kei hong hu tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" />Ngam amh tuuno khat bangin ka vakthap hi; Tua ahikom hong pai in, na naseampa keima hong zong ta'n, banghang ziam cile na thukhamte ka ngaingon bua hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngim ka nga ciangin Topa ka sam a, ama in hong zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, leilot theite le ngualtheam theite kung pan hong hun ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />No a leilot theite awng, Pathian in bang hong law tu ziam? Bangbangin daan hong pia tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngalkapte thaltang hiamte le meikam sa taw daan hong pia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Note kawm ah teen sia Meshech ah teen bang, Kedar mite kawm sungah teen bangin sia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kilemna a ngaimawte taw ka teen khop zawk ngei lei zo hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kilemna vai ka son ciangin amate in ngalvai vaihawm uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei hong kihuna koisung pan hong pai tu ziam ci in mualtung ka ento hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei hong kihu natu sia van le lei a vawt Topa kung panin hong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in nang hong puksak ngawl tu hi; nang hong dalpa in a tawntungin khangciim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel te a dalpa in lusu ngeingawlin mu ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in nang hong cing tu hi; ama sia na kungah nang hong dal tu in om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sunin ni in nang hong liamsua ngawl tu a, zanin tha in zongh nang hong nasak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa in nang sia launa theampo panin hong dal tu hi; ama in nang hong keamcing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in na sungtanna le, na pusuana ah tu le a tawntungin nang hong dal tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Topa inn ah pai tek tawng” hong ci a om ciangin ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu in eite sia hi sung Jerusalem kongpite sung sangah ih ding hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem sia a etlawm, a hoi in a kipua kik khuapi khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa thupiak bangin ama tungah lungdamko tu in, Israel minamte hong paina mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Israel kumpipate in a mite tungah thukhen tu in hi sungah to uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem khuapi ah kilemna a om thei natu thungen vun: “Nang hong itte khangto tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na suumsung sangah kilemna om tahen a, na kumpi innte ah ngal muanna om tahen,” ci vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mealheakte le ka ngualtamhte ka ngaisutna in Jerusalem tungah, “Kilemna om tahen!” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa ih Pathian inn atu in na nopsak natu thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, na ukna vantung le, nangma kong ento hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa kote Pathian awng, naseampa khat in a topa suang a, naseamnu khat in a tonu a suan bangma, kote tungah hesuakna nong nei mateng in nang kong ento tawntung tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kote hong hesuak ta'n, Topa awng, hong hesuak ta'n; kote hong kizawnsak vawt mama zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kote sia sumhaute in hong nunau zawk ngei lei zo a, tuaciang a kiphasak hong zothawte in hong zawngsak uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in ei sangah hong pang ngawl hile bang suak tu hi ziam? Hong zo tavun, Israel te awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Topa ei sangah hong pang ngawl hi thong le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ih ngalte ii hong sim ciang, thinsona taw eite a hingtang in hong valhlum zo tu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuaciang namthuam in hong taikeak zo tu a, tui in hong khum zo tu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a lauhuai khuanawl in tui hong tasak zo tu hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ih ngalte ii hong lalthapsak tu, a oai ngawl Topa tungah lungdamko tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Savaipa thaang sung pan a suakta vacim khat bangin ei zongh ih suakta zo hi; a thaang taltham zo a, eite suakta hi hing!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Simlei vantung a vawt Topa kung panin eite hong huna hong pai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa a muangte in a ngawk thei ngeingawl, a kikhiin thei ngeingawl Zion Mual bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mualpite in Jerusalem kiim uum in a om bangma Topa in a mite kiim ah tu le a tawntungin om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thutangte ii ngam le lei sia mihing seksolte in a tawntungin a uk buatu hi; uk tawntung thong le a thutangte mama in zongh siatna vawt thei tha tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, mihing phate tungah dik in a, na thupiakna a zuite phat vawt ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahihang mihing seksolte daan na piak ciangin nangma ii thu le la a taisante zongh daan na pia in. Israel te tungah kilemna om tahen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem ah hong ciapui kik ciangin mang bang phet ma ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangza in ih nui a, lungdam in la ih sa ziam! Tuasia ciang minam dangte in ei huvau sia, “ Topa in amate atu in na lianpi seam zo hi” a ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lianpite ei atu hong seam takpi zo hi; bangza in ih lungdam ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nguntui kang a, a kona munah ngua in tui a puak kik bangin, Topa awng, ko hong nuamsasak kik ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thitui taak a, thaicii a tute sia lungdamna taw an lasak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thitui taak a thaicii pua in a kuante sia anla a hong cia kik uh ciangin lungdam in la a sa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in inn a sa buale inn sate ii dianna in a luithawthong ahi hi; Topa in khuapi a dal buale ngalvilte ii cinna sia a luithawthong ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingsang thopal a, nitak lum hakin kivaak kitaa natu nasia takin nasep sia, a luithawthong ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile Topa in ama ii itte a mutthip lanin hu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tanu tapate sia Topa hong piak letsong hi; amate sia thupha tatak khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihing khat ii a khanmoi lai a hin tapate sia ngalkap khat ii khut sungah a om thaltangte bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuabang thaltang tam a neipa sia mihing lungdam ahi hi. Thukhenna munah a ngalte taw a kisik ciangin ama in a lel ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa thu ni a, a thupiakte babangin a nungtate in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na nasepna in na kisap tu teng hong sik tu hi; nangma in na lungdam tu a, na nuamsa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na zi in na inn sungah a ngathiam sapitkung taw kibang tu a, na sabuai kiim ah na tate in olive kung moite taw kibang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa thu a ni mihing khat sia, tu a bang keakin thupha kipia takpi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Zion panin nangma thupha hong pia tahen! Na khan tawntung Jerusalem nopsakna hong musak tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tunu tupa mealmu tu in hong nungtasak tahen! Israel te tungah kilemna om tahen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel te awng, na khangmoi lai pan ma kipan na ngalte in bangza in hong vawtsia zo ziam ko tungah hong son ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Khangmoi ka hi lai pan ma kipan ka ngalte in hong vawtsia zazaan hi, ahihang amate in hong zo zo ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in ka nungzaang nasia takin hong liamsak a, lo kitho vuungsa khat bangin hong vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang a thutang pa Topa in saltanna panin hong suatak zo hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion a ensante theampo in lelna le nawkeakna thuak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate sia innkhum tungah a po, a khan ma a kocip lopate bang hi tahen;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuate sia kuama in khawmtua ngawl a, a lom in zongh kipua ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate kaantan in a pai a kuama po in, “ Topa in thupha hong pia tahen! Topa min taw thupha hong pia khu hi” ci ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, ka thinkiam dikdekna panin nang kong biakpui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, ka auna hong za ta'n; hu ngen a kong sapna hong ngai ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in ko mawnate hong tepteesak hi thong lete akua peuma puavawkna pan suakta thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahihang nangma hong thasia in kong din thei natu uh in, nangma in tua mawnate nong maisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa hong hu natu lawpin ka ngakla a, ama kammal ka muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngalvilte in zingsang khuavak tu kaal a ngalaak mama sangin, Topa ka ngakla zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel te awng, Topa muang vun, banghang ziam cile ama ii itna in kip a, ama in hong hunnuam tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Israel a mite sia amate mawna theampo panin ngum tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, ka kiphatsaknate ka kheal zo a, ka kisaktheinate ka nungngat zo hi. Thu liante ahizong, kei atu a haksa leilam thute ahizong patau in ka nei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua taangin lungkim thinnuamin ka om zaw hi. Nute kaang sungah nauno khat ommuangin a lup bangin ka sungah lungmuanna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel te awng, Topa sia, tu le a tawntungin muang tavun.
  </para>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, David le ama ii thuak haksatnate mangil heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa awng, a vaanglian Jacob ii Pathian, nangma tungah hong kamciamna, hong kiciamnate phawk in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Inn ah ka cia buatu a, lupna ka zuan buatu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa atu mun khat, a vaanglian Jacob ii Pathian teenna tu inn khat, ka piak mateng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ka tawlnga buatu a, ka mu buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bethlehem khua ah Thuciamna Thingkuang huvau ka za uh a, Jearim lote sungah tua thingkuang ka mu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Topa inn ah pai tawng; a kumpi tokhum mai pan bia tawng” ka ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, na vaangletna lim ahi, na Thuciamna Thingkuang taw na Biakinnpi sungah hong pai ta'n a, hi sungah a tawntungin hong om ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na thiampite in a maan sepnate vawt tawntung tahen; na mihingte in lungdamna taw au tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na naseampa David tungah kamciamna khat na pia hi; Topa awng, na tealsa kumpipa nial heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David tungah ciliap huai takin kamciamna khat na pia hi; tua kamciam sia na dawk kik tu in na piak ahi bua hi; “Na tapate sung panin khat kumpi ka suaksak tu a, ama in nang zawkciang ngam a uk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tate in ka thuciamna sungah thumaan a, amate tungah ka piak thute a zui le, amate ii tate zongh in a tawntungin kumpi suakin na za hong lua tu hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in Zion sia teal zo hi; ama teenna tu in vawt nuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hi sia in a tawntungin, ka teen natu mun ahi hi; hi mun in ka uk nopna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zion tungah ama kisap theampo kicing takin ka pia tu hi; a mizawngte an pia in ka lungkimsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thiampite sia a sepna theampo ah thupha ka pia tu a, ama mihingte in lasa in lungdamna taw a au tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hi sungah David ii suan khat sia kumpi lian khatin ka siam tu hi; hi sungah ka tealsa kumpipa ukna ka keamcing tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ngalte sia maizumna taw ka tuam tu a, ahizong ama ii kumpingam khangto in nuamsa tu hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian ii mihingte kituiton takin a teen khop uh ciang bangza in lamdang a, bangza in nuam ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua in Aaron lu tungah a kibuak a luzang pan a khamul ah a puantual kithepna mong dong a luangsuk sathau manpha sia taw kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hermon Mualvum tungah daaitui Zion mualte tungah a kia sia taw kibang hi. Tuasia in tawpna a nei ngawl nuntakna a kici Topa ii thupha piak tu a kamciamna mun ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zan hun sung Biakinn sungah a naseam, ama ii naseamte theampo awng, hong pai tavun a, Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama Biakinn sungah thungetna taw na khut uh laam vun a, Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van le lei a vawt Topa in Zion panin, note thupha hong pia tahen!
  </para>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! No Topa naseamte awng, ama min pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ii inn sung le, ih Pathian Biakinnpi sungah a dingte awng, Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa pok vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi; ama ii min pokna late sa vun, banghang ziam cile ama dik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in ama atu in Jacob teal a, ama aituam tu in Israel mite teal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ih Topa lian hi ci in ka he a, pathian dang theampo sangin lianzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantung le leitung ah ahizong, tuipi sung le a nuai a thuknate ah ahizong ama uuk pawpo a vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in leitung mong panin vuipi meeite hong puak hi; ama in vuipi suangvalte atu in khualeng vawt a, tuaciangin vuite sia ama ii kholna sung panin pusua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt ngam ah ama in mihing le nganhingte ii taciil tek a kibangin thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua munah nalamdangte le a lamdadangte kumpipa le a upate daan piak natu in vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in ngam tuatuam tam ma susia a, a thahat kumpite thatlum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuate sungah Amor kumpipa Sihon, Bashan kumpipa Og, le Canaan kumpi theampo kihel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ii leitangte sia ama in a mite pia hi; ama in tuate Israel mite pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma sia Pathian hi ci in a tawntungin hong kithangsak tu hi; khang theampo in nang hong phawk tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in ama ii mihingte hung tu hi; ama in a naseamte hesuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua minamte ii pathiante sia mihingte ii khut taw a vawt tawm khamh le ngunn taw a kivawtte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in kam nei ahihang a pau thei bua hi, mit nei ahihang a mu thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in bil nei ahihang khua a za thei bua uh hi; amate sia hu ngawngawn a sang thei bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate a vawtte le a muangte theampo sia amate vawt sa milimte bangma suak tahen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel mite awng, Topa pok vun; no Pathian thiampite awng, ama pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />No Levi mite awng, Topa pok vun; no ama a biate theampo awng, ama pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa sia Zion ah pok vun, a inn ahi Jerusalem ah pok vun. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko vun, banghang ziam cile ama pha hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathiante theampo sung pan a lianbel pa tungah lungdamko vun, ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />To theampo sung pan a thahatbel pa tungah lungdamko vun, ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama bek in nalamdang lakna liante vawt hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama ciimna taw vantungte vawt hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in simlei sia tuithukna tungah sa hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in ni le tha vawt hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ni in sun hun a uksak hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tha le aksi te in zan hun uksak hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in Egypt te ii tapaciil teng that hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in Israel mite Egypt ngam panin pusuapui hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a khut tha khona, a vaanglian baan taw pusuapui hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in San Tuipi khen hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuasia kaantan in a mite lampui hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahihang Egypt kumpipa le a ngalkap teng tuitaasak hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a mite sennealngam kaantan in lampui hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a thahat kumpite that hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in kumpi minthangte thatlum hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor mite kumpipa, Sihon thatlum hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tuaciang Bashan kumpipa Og thatlum hi, ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate ngam teng a mite piaksak hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A naseam Israel te tungah tua ngamte pia hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ngal ih lel ciangin ama in hong mangil ngawl hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in ih ngalte khut sung panin hong suatak hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama in nuntakna nei theampo an pia hi; ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vantung a om Pathian tungah lungdamko vun, ama ii itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babylon ngunte hui ah ka to uh hi; tua munah Zion ka phawk uh ciangin ka kap uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nai a om pakngiam kungte tungah ka tengtonghte uh ka khai uh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ko hong pummatte in lasa in hong sawl hi. Amate ngualnop natu in “Zion la hong sak tavun” hong ci uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngual ngam ngual lei ah bangbangin Topa tungah lasa thei tu khu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem awng, nang kong mangil le tengtongh zongh tum thei ngei nawn bua tong!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang sia ka lungdamna lianbel na hi hunlam kong ngaisun bua a, nang kong mangil le, la zongh sa kik thei ngei nawn bua tong!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa awng, Jerusalem a kilaak ni in Edom te ngamtatna na phawk in. “A bul dongin sutham vun” a ci kikik uh sia na phawk in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Babylon awng, nang sia hong kilalsak tu hi. Kote tungah nong vawtna sa teng hong thuk kik te —
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />na nausente uh hong laaksak in suangpi tungah hong teaklupsak te sia mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, ka thin theampo taw lungdam kong ko hi; tua pathiante mai ah nangma pokna la kong sak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thiangtho na Biakinnpi sang maingatin, kunin na min kong pok hi, banghang ziam cile itna kip le na thumaanna hang ahi hi, na min le na thupiaknate sia a lianbel in nong lak hang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kong sam ciangin nong zo kik hi, na thahatna taw kei nong thakhosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa awng, leitung ah kumpi theampo in nang hong pok tu hi, banghang ziam cile na kamciamte amate in za zo uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in na sep na vawt sate le na minthanna liante huvau in la hong sak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang sia tungsang ah, saang mama na hihang, a kiniamkhiakte na khoi a, a kiphasakte sia nang kung panin a buu thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngimnate in kei hong uumci ciangin nangma in nong keamcing hi. A thin uuk ka ngalte nong dosak a na vaangletna taw kei nong hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na kamciamsa theampo na seam tu hi; Topa awng, na itna kip tawntung hi. Na patsa nasep sia a khuangkhim dongin hong seam ta'n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in nong sit ngiingeei zo a nong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in ka sep ka vawt theampo na he hi; ka ngaisutna theampo a khuala na panin na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na ka sep laitak ahizong, ka tawlngak laitak ahizong, nong mu hi; ka ngamtatna theampo na he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pau ma ngawngawn in ka son tu teng na he zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma in ka kiimkot mun theampo ah na om hi; na vaangletna taw kei nong dal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei nong heakna sia thuk mama a; kei tel zawk ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma pial in koisung zuan thei tu khi ziam? Nang omna pan koisungah ka tai thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantung ah paito kaleng zong tua munah na om hi; mithi khua ah lum kaleng zong tua munah na om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nisuana kalhin ka leang hial zong ahibuale nitumna sang a khuala belna ah teang kaleng zong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />kei hong lampui tu in tua mun ma ah na om tu hi, kei hong hu tu in tua mun ma ah na om tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khuazing ii hong sealcip natu, tua ahibuale ka kiimkot khuavak sia zan a suak tu in ka ngen thei hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ahihang khuazing ngawngawn nang atu zing tuan ngawl a, zan sia sun bangin a taang hi. Khuazing le khuavak sia nang atu in kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma in ka pumpi sungah a om na theampo na bitphua hi; Ka nu naubu sungah ka pumpi nong ngawmtua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangma kong pok hi, banghang ziam cile nangma in kiitak tu na hi hi; na sep na vawt theampo tumdangin lamdang hi. Tuasia ka thinsung theampo taw ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ngute kipiangsak in, ka nu naubu sungah pha takin kingawmtua a, a thimtham in ka khanto hunin, tua munah ka om hunlam nong he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka sua ma in kei nong mu zo hi. Kei atu hong kisee sa ni le hunte a kipat ma in na laibu sungah kiciamtee siat zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian awng, na khua ngaisutnate sia kei tel tu bangza haksa ziam, bangzata tam ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in tuate sim hi leng senvui za sangin tamzaw tu hi. Ka khanlaw ciang zong nangma taw ma ka omkhawm lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian awng, mihing seksolte hong thalupsak le te ka uuk hi! mihing ngoltolte, kei hong nusia in tai le ka uuk hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in nangma taw kisai in seksol kamte hong zangh uh hi; na min siat thethei natu in pau uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa awng, nang hong ngaimawte bangza in ngaimaw khi ziam! Nang hong langpante bangza in ensan khi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate sia ngaimawk tawpin ka ngaimaw hi; amate keima ngal bangin ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kei hong sit ta'n, Pathian awng, ka thinsung hong he ta'n; hong sittel ta'n a, ka ngaisutnate a thakin na mu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka sungah siatna a om ziam hong mu ta'n a, tawntung lampi ah kei lam hong pui ta'n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mihing tatsiate kung panin hong hun ta'n, Topa awng, mihing ngoltolte kung panin hong keamcing ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in a tawntungin a sia vawt tu a sawm ku uh a, kihau thei natu in ngual a hol tawntung uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate ii leeite sia hong thisak thei ngulte taw kibang a; amate kammal in ngulsok ii nguu bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A seksolte thahatna panin hong dal tan Topa awng, ka puk natu hong sawm ku a ngoltol mite kung panin hong keamcing ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing kiphasak te in thaang hong sia hi; amate in khau thaangte pha in lamdung ah kei hong mat natu in thaangte keaksa in koi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Nangma in ka Pathian na hi hi,” Topa tungah ka ci hi. Topa awng, hu ngen a kong auna hong za ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vaanglianpipa ka Topa awng, a tha kho kei hong hungpa, nangma in ngal kidona sungah nong dal zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa awng, a seksolte ii deite pia heak in; amate sawmku thute taangtungsak heak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ngalte in hong zosak heak in; amate ii kei hong tawn nate amate tungah tusak kik in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meikam san vahem te amate tungah taak tahen; dum sungah amate kilawn suk tahen a, pusuak ngei nawn heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Midangte maw a suan khialte, zawna nga heak hen; mihing ngoltolte sia siatna in ban tahen a, lalsak tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in mizawngte vai le, a cimawte ii nga tu a kilawm thute ah na panpui sia ka he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thutangte in nang hong pok takpi tu hi; amate sia nangma ii omna munah teang tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nang kong sam hi, Topa; tu in hong hu ta'n! Kong sam ciangin hong ngai ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kong thungetna a namtui biakpiakna in hong saang ta'n a, ka khutte kong lapto sia nitak sangaw biakpiakna khat bangin hong saang ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa , ka kam ah a cing tu khat, ka muk kongkha ah a cing khat koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A maan ngawl sep nopna le, mihing tatsiate seksolnate panpui nopna pan hong keam ta'n. Amate ii anneak poai sungah ka kihel ngei buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihing pha khat in deisakna taw hong teih in daan zongh hong pia thei hi, ahihang mihing ngilote ii upatna ka saang ngei buatu hi, banghang ziam cile amate ngamtat siatnate langpanin thu ka ngen tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a ukte sia suangliang tung panin a kilotsuk tak ciang mihingte in ka kammalte sia maan sa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A bebek in a ki ektham thing bangin amate ii ngute sia thaan kiil ah kithethaang tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang nang kong muang tawntung hi, Vaanglianpipa ka Topa awng. Nong dalna ka zong hi; Hong thisak heak in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate ii kei hong siana thaangte panin hong dal ta'n a, thusia vawtte khauthaang panin hong hung ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei bangma tat ngawlin ka pai laitakin, a seksolte sia amate ii thaang sung ma ah awk tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hu ngenin Topa ka sam hi; ama ka maangkaa hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lungkim ngawlna theampo ama ka puak hi; ka ngim ngana theampo ama tungah ka son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A cimaw hi zo ing ci tu in ka kithoai ciang, ama in ka ngamtat natu he hi. Ka lampi totna ah ka ngalte in kei thaang hong sia ku zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kiim ka paam ka et ciangin kei hong hu tu kuama ka mu bua hi, kuama hong dal tu a om bua hi. Kuama in kei hong awlmawk bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, nang tungah hu ngenin kong au hi; Topa , nangma in kei hong dalpa na hi hi; hi nuntakna sungah ka dei theampo kicinna in nangma na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hu ngen a, kong auna hong ngai ta'n, banghang ziam cile ka thin kiamcip zo hi. Ka ngalte kung panin hong hun ta'n; amate sia kei atu in hat lei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thinngimna pan suatakna hong pia ta'n, tuasia ciang kei tungah nong phatna hangin na mite kikhopna sungah nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa awng, ka thungetna hong za ta'n! Na thutang sungah kong maangkaana hong ngai ta'n; na thumaanna hangin kei hong zo ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei na naseampa thusitna hong thuaksak heak in; nang muna ah a maw ngawl kuama a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngalpa in savai bangin hong vai a hong zothal hi. Ama in thongzing khat sungah hong khum zo a, ngei tawngh lai ah a thisate bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom, a cimaw hi zo ing ci tu in ka kithoai a, ka thinkiam dikdek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A bosa nite ka phawk hi, na sepsa theampo ka ngaisun hi, na ngamtatna sa theampo ka thin sungah ka sut kikik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thungenin ka khutte nang kungah kong laamto hi; lei ko bangin ka thaa in nang hong dangtaak law hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu ma in hong zo ta'n, Topa ! lametna theampo ka bosua zo hi. Kei kung panin buu heak in, na buu le kei sia mithi khua a zuansukte taw ka omkhawm tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zing simin na itna kip hong phawksak kik ta'n, banghang ziam cile nangma kong muang hi. Ka thungetnate nang kung hong theng hi, ka tot tu lampi hong lak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kidalna nga tu in nang kungah kong pai hi, Topa ; ka ngalte kung panin hong suatak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma in ka Pathian na hi hi; na deina bang ka vawt thei natu hong hil ta'n. Kei tungah hong dik ta'n a, a muanhuai lampi ah lam hong pui ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa awng, nong kamciamsa bangma in hong suatak ta'n; na phatna taw ka ngim ngana sung pan hong hun ta'n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei nong itna hu in ka ngalte that in a, kei hong zothaw theampo na susia in, banghang ziam cile kei sia na naseampa ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei hong sungsia pa Topa pok vun! Ama in ngal kidozia kei hong hil a, ngalsim tu in hong kingingtasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in kei hong dalpa le hong hungpa ahi hi, ka belhna le ka ngumpa, ngammuan natu in, ka muanpa ahi hi. Ama in minamte ka khutnuai ah om tu in hong zawsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa awng, nangma in na phaw tham tu in a thithei mihingte bang hi a; a thithei lelte po banghangin thusim ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate sia vui muut khat taw kibang hi; amate ii khan sia a kaantan ziau limh khat bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa awng, van khentham in hong pai suk ta'n; mualte tham in, tua hile tuate in meikhu pusua tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khualeng tee vazalte tha in a, na ngalte thethaang in; na thaltangte kap in a, amate taikeaksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tungsang panin hong baansuk ta'n. Tuithukna pan hong dokto ta'n a, hong suatak ta'n; ngamdang mite thahatna panin hong hun ta'n,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amate in thumaan son ngeingawl a, kiciam napi leilot lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang tungah la thak khat kong sak tu hi, Pathian awng; tengtongh tumin la kong sak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipate tungah zawna na pia a, na naseampa David na suatak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ngilo ka ngalte kung panin hong hun ta'n; thumaan son ngeingawl a, kiciamna ngawngawn taw a leilot lai, ngamdangmite thahatna panin hong suatak ta'n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tapate uh a khanmoi lai in thahatin a khang thingkungte bang hi tahen. Ka tanute uh sia kumpi inn kingte a zeam khuam hoite taw kibang tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ansaal uhte an namcin taw kidim tahen a, ka lo sungah tuute in a tul a then in pung tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka khuite uh zongh a no tol, a sumsi om ngawlin ta tam mama nei tahen. Khua sung ih lampite ah ngim nga kikona aw nging heak hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hi thute bangin a piang minam sia mi nuamsa ahi hi; Pathian sia Topa in a nei mite in mihing lungdamte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Na letna ka thangsak tu hi, ka Pathian le ka kumpipa awng; a tawntung a tawntungin lungdam kong ko tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni simin nang tungah lungdam kong ko tu hi; a tawntung a tawntungin nang kong pok tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa sia lian ahikom, nasia takin pok tu ahi hi; ama ii letna in tel zawk ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na sepsate hu in khang khat panin khang khat ah hong kipok tu hi; amate in a nasia mama na sepnate thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in na minthanna le na letnazia son tu uh a, a lamdang na sepnate thuk takin ka ngaisusun tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mihingte in a lianpi na sepnate son tu a, na letna ka thangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in na phatna theampo son tu a, na thuthiamna la in sa tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in itna le hesuakna nei a, thinsau in itna kip taw kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama sia mihing sim tungah pha in, a vawt theampo tungah mulkimna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa awng, na bitphua sa nuntakna nei theampo in nang hong pok tu a, na mite theampo in lungdam hong ko tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in na kumpi vaangletna ii minthanna sia thuson in nei tu a, na thakhona thu son tu uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuasia ciang mihing theampo in na sepna lianpite he tu a, na kumpingam sungah na minthanzia hong he tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na ukna kip tawntung a, nang sia a tawntungin kumpipa na hi hi. Topa in a kamciamnate tungah thumaan a, a ngamtatna sung theampo ah hesuak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in ngim a ngate theampo hu hi; a puksa theampo phongto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nuntakna a nei theampo in lametna taw nang hong mitsuan a, amate kisap ciangin an na pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate a kikhom in na pia a, kitaangsapna theampo ah a lung na kimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa in ama ii sepna theampo sungah thutang a, a ngamtatna sung theampo ah hesuak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama a kote, thintak taw a samte nai ah ama om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama a zaktate ii kitaangsapnate ama in sik hi; amate auna za in hun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama a it theampo ama in sungsia hi, ahihang a seksolte susia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa ka pok tawntung tu hi; ama bitphua sa nuntakna nei theampo in a min thiangtho a tawntungin pok tahen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Ka thaa awng, Topa pok in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nuntak lai teng ama ka pok tu hi; ka khan tawntung ka Pathian tungah la ka sa tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na muanna uh sia mihing lampuite tungah koi heak vun; mihing kuama in no hong hun thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate a thi ciangin leivui ah cia kik uh hi; tua ni in amate ngealna theampo bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jacob ii Pathian sia ama ii hupa in a neipa le Topa sia amate ii Pathian in, a muangte sia mi nuamsate hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />ama sia vantung, leitung le tuipi, tua teng sung a om theampo a Bitphuapa ahi hi. Ama in a kamciamte kholet tawntung hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zawthawk a thuakte sangah pangin thukhen a, a ngilkialte an pia hi. Topa in thongtaakte suaktasak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mittawte khua musak hi. Ama in a puk sate phongto hi; a thutang ama mite it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ih ngam sungah khualmi hong teangte ama in sungsia hi; ama in meingongte le tangate hu hi, ahihang a seksolte sia siatcip natu munah then hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa sia a tawntung kumpipa ahi hi. Zion awng, na Pathian sia hun theampo ah maang tu hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Ih Pathian tungah, pokna la sak tu pha hi; ama pok tu sia nuam a maan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Jerusalem thaksua kik a, ngamdang ah saltaangte hong ciapui kik hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in thin kitamhte damsak a, a liammate tuamsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in aksite a phakza tu see a, khat sim a min taw sam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A lian a thakho sia eite Topa hi; ama ciimna in kitee thei ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a kiniamkhiak te laamto a, ahihang a seksolte lei ah sucip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa tungah pokna biakna late sak vun; Ih Pathian tungah tengtongh taw music tum vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in van ah meeite phalh hi; ama in leitung atu in nguatui pia a, mualte tungah lopa posak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in nganhingte an pia a, va-ak note a au uh ciang anvaak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama ii nuam a sak sia siphu thahatte hi ngawl a, ama ii dik a sak zongh ngalkap hangte ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang ama in ama a zaktate le ama ii itna kip a muangte tungah lungkim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa pok in, Jerusalem awng! Na Pathian pok in, Zion awng!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in na kongpite khosak a, na mite thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na ngamngi uhte bitsak a, zungtaang phabelte taw hong lungkimsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in simleitung ah thupia a, ama ci babang, a manlang in kiseam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in vuuk sia puanvan khat taw kibangin phalh a, thuamluak sia leivui bangin thethaang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in ngial sia suangpim bangin puak a, ama puak khuasik sia kuama in a thuak zo bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuasia ciang ama in thupia a, tuikhalte tuitham hi; ama in vui vasak a, tui luangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in a mite tungah thupuak a, lamlaknate le thukhamte Israel te pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in minam dangte tungah hi bangin a seam bua hi; amate in ama thukhamte a he bua uh hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! No, tungsang a saangna a teangte awng, vantung panin Topa pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ii vantunglalang theampo, ama ii vantung ngalkaphonpi theampo awng, ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni le tha awng, ama pok vun; a taang aksite awng, ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A saangbel vantungte le van ii tungsia a om tuite awng, ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate theampo in Topa ii min pok tek tahen! Ama in thupia a, amate kibitphua hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama thupiakna taw amate sia a om na sasan tek ah a tawntungin kikoi a, tuaciang amate in a thu ni ngawlin a om thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitung panin Topa pok vun, tuipi nganhingpuite le tuipi thukte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a thupiak a zui khualeng le ngialte, vuuk le meeite, vui thahatte awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pok vun, mualniamte le mualsaangte, a nga thei thingkungte le taamthingte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />innsa ngamsa nganhing theampo, a awmtaal nganhingte le vacimte awng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama pok vun, kumpipate le mihing theampo, kumpi tate le a dang ngamukte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ngaknunote le tangvalnote, khanghaamte le patangnote zongh in pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate theampo in Topa ii min pok tek tahen! Ama ii min in a dang theampo sangin lianzaw hi; ama ii minthanna in van le lei ii tungsia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ii a it mama Israel mite ahi ama mite theampo in ama a pok natu in ama in ama ii minam thahatsak hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Topa tungah la thak khat sa vun; a thumaan a mite kikhopna sungah ama pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel te awng, nang hong Bitphuapa hangin lungdam vun; Zion mite awng, na kumpipa hangin lawp vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama min sia lapna taw pok vun; ama pokna in khuang le tengtonghte tum vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungtaang ah thinnopna nei hi; ama in a kiniamkhiak te zawna taw patoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian ii mihingte in zawna mualsuana tungah lawp in zankhuateak lungdam takin late sa tek tahen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian a pok ciang nasia takin au tahen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />minam dangte zaw natu le, a mihingte daan piak natu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a kumpipate thikkhau a khii natu, a lampuite uh thikkol a bul natu le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian thupiak bangin minam dangte daan a piak natu in a khut sungah namsau hiamte toai kawm tahen. Hisia in Pathian mite ii zawna ahi hi. Topa pok vun!
  </para>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pok vun! Pathian sia ama Biakinnpi sungah pok vun! Vantung ah ama ii thahatna pok vun!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sep sa na lianpite hu in ama pok vun. Ama ii letna lianpi pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lemlete taw ama pok vun! Tengtonghte le liamlo te taw ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuangte le lapna taw ama pok vun. Tengtonghte le tamngaite taw ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Daalkopsaite taw ama pok vun. Daalkopsai nging tatak taw ama pok vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nuntakna a nei theampo in Topa pok vun! Topa pok vun!
  </para>
</usx>
